(1, 'dewdewd', '<p><strong>Final Hour AQAR Filing Offline Workshop&nbsp;</strong><br />\r\nIn Collaboration with <strong>Nirmala Niketan Institute&#39;s College of Home Science Nirmala Niketan &amp; IQAC Cluster India</strong>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Who can join?</strong><br />\r\nIQAC personnel, vice principals, deans, heads of departments, office bearers, office superintendents, and people want to join IQAC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dates:</strong><br />\r\n12th December 2024<br />\r\n(10:00 AM to 4:00 PM)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Resource Person:</strong><br />\r\nMr. Peeyush Pahade<br />\r\nPresident<br />\r\nIQAC Cluster</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Organising Team</strong><br />\r\nCollege of Home Science Nirmala Niketan,Mumbai.<br />\r\nDr. Kamini Rege<br />\r\nIQAC Co - coordinator&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Pratima Goyal&nbsp;<br />\r\nIQAC Coordinator&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr. Asha Mathew<br />\r\nPrincipal</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Location</strong> - Marie Adelaide de Cice&rsquo; Hall,<br />\r\nCollege of Home Science Nirmala Niketan,&nbsp;<br />\r\n49, New Marine Lines,<br />\r\nMumbai-400020<br />\r\n<strong>Map:</strong> <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/h15No21yrsdtK1nZA\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/h15No21yrsdtK1nZA</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Registration Fee: </strong>INR 1200/-</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Registration Link:</strong><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://rzp.io/rzp/Qk75JPVN\">https://rzp.io/rzp/Qk75JPVN</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Technical Support</strong><br />\r\nRutuja - 7972227216<br />\r\nAtharv - 9175551176</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Regards<br />\r\nIQAC Cluster<br />\r\nwww.iqaccluster.com</p>\r\n', NULL, 'demo2@gmail.com', 'wedwed', '2020-12-10 11:03:15', 0, 3),
