(462, '“Read for Joy: A Commitment for Lifelong Reading, A Vision for a Brighter Future!”', '&ldquo;Read for Joy: A Commitment for Lifelong Reading, A Vision for a Brighter Future!&rdquo;\r\nIn accordance with Government Circular No. Sankirna&ndash;2024/E&ndash;905221, Sathaye College successfully implemented the initiative &ldquo;Read, Rise and Ev', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2026-01-13', '2026-01-13', '10:00', '14:00', '', '', 'Smt. Swapna Gawde', 64, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 446, '2026-03-06', 'Reading Hall Library', 'Past Event', 'Upcoming Event', '<p><strong>&ldquo;Read for Joy: A Commitment for Lifelong Reading, A Vision for a Brighter Future!&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n<p>In accordance with Government Circular No. <em>Sankirna&ndash;2024/E&ndash;905221</em>, <strong>Sathaye College</strong> successfully implemented the initiative <strong>&ldquo;Read, Rise and Evolve of Maharashtra&rdquo; Government.&rdquo;</strong> In alignment with this initiative, the College Library and the Marathi Literary Association jointly organized several innovative and high-quality activities during the first term of academic year 2025-2026. As part of this programme, a <strong>&ldquo;Group Reading and Presentation&rdquo;</strong> session was conducted in the College Library on <strong>31<sup>st</sup> December 2025</strong>. Further continuing this initiative and as per the guidelines of &ldquo;<strong>Read, Rise and Evolve of Maharashtra&rdquo;</strong>, <strong>Mrs. Chitra Wagh</strong>, renowned Editor and Author has been invited on <strong>13 January</', 'uploads/Events/Poster_page-0001.jpg', '', NULL, 'Degree College and Junior College Students\'', 'NaN', '[{\"name\":\"Smt. Chitra Wagh\",\"designation\":\"Co-editor\",\"affiliation\":\"Amhi Parlekar, Abhutpurva\"}]', 1, '2026-01-10', 1, ''),
(463, 'Educational Visit Tour', 'The main objective of this educational tour was to take Mathematics students outside the regular classroom setting and provide them with practical experience of the mathematical and scientific concepts embedded within the artistic and historical artifacts', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2025-11-28', '2025-11-28', '10:00', '15:00', '', '', 'Smt. A. A. Namjoshi', 38, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 376, '2026-01-20', 'Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Vastu Sangrahalaya (CSMVS), MG Road, Fort, Mumbai 400023.', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '<p>The main objective of this educational tour was to take Mathematics students outside the regular classroom setting and provide them with practical experience of the mathematical and scientific concepts embedded within the artistic and historical artifacts of the museum. The goal was also to encourage interdisciplinary learning and help students understand the connection between the nation\'s heritage and Mathematics.</p>', 'uploads/Events/20251128_20717PMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', 'uploads/Report-on-Eductional-visit-Tour-NEW.pdf', NULL, NULL, '7', '[{}]', 1, '2026-01-20', 1, ''),
(464, 'MATHSPIRE -2025', '', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2025-12-19', '2025-12-20', '10:00', '16:00', '', '', 'Smt. A. A. Namjoshi', 38, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 376, '2026-01-20', 'PTVA’s Sathaye Collge, Room No. 108', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '', 'uploads/Events/20251219_10436PMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', 'uploads/MATHSπRE-2025-report.pdf', '', '', '90', '[{}]', 1, '2026-01-20', 1, ''),
(465, 'Archaeology Fortnight 2025-26', '', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2025-12-04', '2025-12-21', '09:00', '18:00', '', '', 'PTVA\'s Sathaye College (Autonomous) Department of AIC and Archaeology', 15, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 246, '2026-04-09', 'PTVA\'s Sathaye College (Autonomous)', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">PTVA&rsquo;s Sathaye College (Autonomous), Department of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology and Buddhist Studies, co-organized by the Ministry of Tourism, Government of India, in collaboration with Labdhi Vikrama Janaseva Trust, Ahmedabad, Janaseva Samiti, Vile Parle, Ashwamedh Pratishtan, Indian Institute for Research in Numismatic Studies, Garware Institute of Career Education and Development, University of Mumbai, Itihas Sankalan Samiti, Shiva Garjana Pratishthan, Marathidesha Foundation and Purasanskruti (Heritage, History, Research) organized the Archaeology Fortnight celebration from 4th December to 21st December 2025. This annual event celebrates the contributions of the Late Professor. H. D. Sankalia, eminent archaeologist in the field of Archaeology on the occasion of his birth anniversary, which falls on the 10</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">th</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> of December.&nbsp;</span></p>', 'uploads/Events/week.jpg', 'uploads/Report-for-Archaeology-Fortnight-Dec-2025-.docx-(2).pdf', 'Ministry of Tourism, Government of India', NULL, '9600', '[{}]', 1, '2026-01-28', 1, ''),
(466, 'GURUPOURNIMA CELEBRATION', 'Gurupournima is celebrated by Education students with the distribution of cards to authorities. The movie \"UDAAN\" was screening.', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2025-07-10', '2025-07-10', '08:00', '01:00', '', '', 'Department of Education', 20, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 253, '2026-01-29', 'GROUND FLOOR AUDITORIUM', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '<p>Gurupournima is celebrated by Education students with the distribution of cards to authorities. The movie \"UDAAN\" was screening.</p>', 'uploads/Events/UDAAN.jpg', 'uploads/Guru-Purnima-report.pdf', 'NSS', 'All students', '74', '[{\"name\":\"NIL\",\"designation\":\"NIL\",\"affiliation\":\"NIL\"}]', 1, '2026-01-29', 1, ''),
(467, 'GUEST LECTURE', 'Guidance Lecture organised by the Department of Education. The lecture is organized to inspire students to set meaningful career goals and to equip students with the mindset and skills needed for career development.', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2025-08-07', '2025-08-07', '11:00', '13:30', '', '', 'Department of Education', 20, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 253, '2026-02-02', 'GROUND FLOOR AUDITORIUM', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '<p>Guidance Lecture organised by the Department of Education. The lecture is organized to inspire students to set meaningful career goals and to equip students with the mindset and skills needed for career development.</p>', 'uploads/Events/GUEST-LECTURE.jpg', 'uploads/Education-Department-Guest-Lecture.pdf', 'NSS Unit', 'All students', '74', '[{\"name\":\"Shri. Girish Zende\",\"designation\":\"Motivational speaker and Master Trainer YASHADA\",\"affiliation\":\"CD Institute of Administrative career\"}]', 1, '2026-02-02', 1, ''),
(468, 'Dr. Ambedkar Jayanti', 'Report of Celebration of Birth Anniversary of Dr. B. R. Ambedkar\r\n&nbsp;\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; On 13th April 2024, the NSS Unit of Sathaye College solemnly observed the Birth Anniversary of Bharat Ratna Dr. B. R. Ambedkar.\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2024-04-13', '2024-04-13', '10:00', '12:00', '', '', 'Dr. M. R. Rajwade', 64, 0, '', 'SSR', NULL, 1, NULL, 446, '2026-02-17', 'Reading Hall Library', 'Past Event', 'Past Event', '<p><strong>Report of Celebration of Birth Anniversary of Dr. B. R. Ambedkar</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; On 13th April 2024, the NSS Unit of Sathaye College solemnly observed the Birth Anniversary of Bharat Ratna Dr. B. R. Ambedkar.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; To mark this significant occasion, a book exhibition featuring the works of Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar was organized in the College Library. The exhibition aimed to familiarize students and staff with Dr. Ambedkar&rsquo;s scholarly contributions, visionary thoughts, and enduring legacy.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The programme was graced by the esteemed Principal, Dr. Madhav Rajwade. In his address, he spoke about the extraordinary life of Dr. B. R. Ambedkar, highlighting his struggles, determination, and monumental contribution to the framing of the Indian Constitution. He also emphasized the importance of democratic participation, especially in the context of the upcoming General Elections. Dr', 'uploads/Events/Dr.-B.-R.-Ambedkar-2024-25.jpg', 'uploads/Birth-Anniversary-Dr.-B.-R.-Ambedkar-2024-25.pdf', 'NSS Unit Sathaye College', 'Degree College Students', '55', '[{}]', 1, '2026-02-17', 1, ''),
