(607, 'Prof. Madhusudhan Dhaky Memorial lecture', 'The Department of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology along with the Department of Buddhist Studies is organizing &lsquo;Shri Madhusudan Dhaky Memorial Lecture&rsquo; on the occasion of the 99th birth anniversary of the eminent art historian, Shri Ma', '2026', '', '2026-07-31', '2026-07-31', '19:30', '20:30', '', '', 'Department of Ancient Indian Culture & Archaeology and Department of Buddhist Studies', 15, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 245, '2026-08-01', 'Online', 'Past Event', 'Upcoming Event', '<p>The Department of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology along with the Department of Buddhist Studies organised <strong>&lsquo;Shri Madhusudan Dhaky Memorial Lecture&rsquo;</strong> on the occasion of the 99th birth anniversary of the eminent art historian, Shri Madhusudan Dhaky and was open for all. The memorial lecture was delivered online by Dr. Manisha Puranik, a distinguished scholar in the said field.&nbsp;</p>', 'uploads/Events/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-27-at-14.55.18.jpeg', '', NULL, NULL, 'NaN', '[{\"name\":\"Dr. Manisha Puranik\",\"designation\":\"Assistant Professor,\",\"affiliation\":\"Tilak Maharashtra Vidyapeeth\"}]', 1, '2026-07-30', 1, ''),
