(626, 'Workshop on ‘Introduction to Stone tools’', 'The Department of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology, Department of Buddhist Studies, along with the Social Science Association (DC), organised a Workshop on &lsquo;Introduction to Stone tools&rsquo; by Ms. Radha Sabnis, Head, Dept of Ancient Indian', '2026', 'Intra-College', '2026-08-18', '2026-08-18', '11:30', '13:00', '', '', 'Department of Ancient Indian Culture & Archaeology and Department of Buddhist Studies along with Social Science Association', 15, 0, '', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 245, '2026-08-18', 'Room no 6', 'Past Event', 'Upcoming Event', '<p>The Department of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology, Department of Buddhist Studies, along with the Social Science Association (DC), organised a Workshop on &lsquo;Introduction to Stone tools&rsquo; by Ms. Radha Sabnis, Head, Dept of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology and Mr. Omkar Karbhari, Faculty, Dept of Ancient Indian Culture &amp; Archaeology of Sathaye College (Autonomous) for the JC students on the occasion of <strong>&lsquo;India Week 2026&rsquo;</strong> on <strong>18th August to 22nd August 2026.</strong> It was an interactive session where participants were introduced to Stone tools and its uses.</p>', 'uploads/Events/20260818_10428PMByGPSMapCamera.jpg', '', 'Department of Buddhist Studies and Social Science Association (DC)', 'JC students', '67', '[{\"name\":\"Ms. Radha Sabnis\",\"designation\":\"Head, Dept of Ancient Indian Culture & Archaeology\",\"affiliation\":\"Sathaye College (Autonomous)\"},{\"name\":\"Mr. Omkar Karbhari\",\"designation\":\"Faculty, Dept of Ancient Indian Culture & Archaeology\",\"affiliation\":\"Sathaye College (Autonomous)\"}]', 1, '2026-08-18', 1, ''),
