(113, 'Swarupa Ameya Salvi', 'Chemistry', 'swarupa.salvi@sathayecollege.edu.in', 'Organic Chemistry', 'uploads/BIO.docx', 'Dear viewer, I am happy to share my academic achievements through this platform.'),
(114, 'Swarupa Ameya Salvi', 'Chemistry', 'swarupa.salvi@sathayecollege.edu.in', 'Organic Chemistry', 'uploads/copy-1734888692-BIO.docx', 'Dear viewer, I am a teacher of Organic Chemistry for B,Sc and M.Sc. students, teaching since last 23 years. The topics that I teach include Stereochemistry, Spectroscopy, Natural products, Polymers, Aromaticity. I believe, Education is empowerment of individual to think and make decisions  that are good for entire society. We need others for our progress and happiness. I am grateful being part of Sathaye College.'),
