(132, 'Sukruta Pethe', '', 'sukruta.pethe@sathayecollege.edu.in', 'Physics', '', 'It is very unfortunate that while updating of the website, my name is omitted by the persons handling this work. I am head of the department of Physics and i had entered all my profile by spending a lot of time. \r\nAlso, since many months i have consistently raised request to remove the technical glitch we face while updating our DBT page for Physics. Almost one year has passed and still the scenario is the same.\r\nPlease take a serious note of my complaint.'),
(133, 'Sukruta Pethe', '', 'sukruta.pethe@sathayecollege.edu.in', 'Physics', '', 'It is very unfortunate that while updating of the website, my name is omitted by the persons handling this work. I am head of the department of Physics and i had entered all my profile by spending lot of time. \r\nAlso, since many months i have consistently raised request to remove the technical glitch we face while updating our DBT page for Physics. Almost one year has passed and still the scenario is the same.\r\nPlease take a serious note of my complaint.');
