(50, 'Advance Learner Session', '2024-25', 1, '2025-04-25', 'uploads/copy-1745558742-Advance-Learner-Session-photo-1.jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/copy-1745558742-Advance-Learner-Session-photo-2.jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/copy-1745558742-Advance-Learner-Session-photo-3.jpeg~%~image', 0, 0, 173, '', '', 1, '32', '', '', 0, 'On Thursday, 28th November, 2024, at 9.30 a.m. to 10.30 a.m. a highly informative and engaging session on Advance Learner was organized for B. Com and BAF students at PTVA’s Sathaye College (Autonomous). The event aimed to enhance the skills, knowledge in their subjects of Accountancy and Plan for advance study in Accountancy & related subjects.', 1, ''),
