(223, 'Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24', '2023-24', 1, '2026-04-02', 'uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-13-at-14.25.06_b8b2fda9.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/copy-1775109622-IMG-20240102-WA0119.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20231223-WA0010.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20231223-WA0023.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20231223-WA0040.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/copy-1775109602-IMG-20231223-WA0049.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0006.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0025.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0039.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0051-(1).jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0056.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240102-WA0086.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/IMG-20240103-WA0004.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortnight 2023-24~^~uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2023-12-15-at-21.16.07_f91facef.jpg~%~Archaeology Fortni', 0, 0, 246, '', '', 1, '15', '12', 'NULL', 485, 'On the occasion of the 115th birth anniversary of the late Dr. H. D. Sankalia and the 109th birth anniversary of the Late Dr. P. L. Gupta, the Department of Archaeology, Center for Extra Mural Studies, University of Mumbai in collaboration with PTVA’s Sathaye College (Autonomous) Department of Ancient Indian Culture and Buddhist Studies, Department of BAMMC (Bachelor of Arts in Multimedia and Mass Communication) and History Department of Junior College, Archaeology Week was celebrated between 9th December 2023 to 24th December 2023.', 1, ''),
