(246, 'Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26', '2025-26', 1, '2026-04-16', 'uploads/20250818_191237.jpg~%~Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26~^~uploads/IMG_20250818_191134.jpg~%~Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26~^~uploads/IMG_20250819_130525.jpg~%~Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26~^~uploads/IMG-20250818-WA0018.jpg~%~Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26~^~uploads/IMG-20250818-WA0022.jpg~%~Dhruva Sanskrit Mahotsav – Intercollegiate Competitions 25-26', 0, 0, 266, '', '', 1, '29', '4', 'NULL', 511, 'Our institution, Sathaye College (Autonomous) actively participated across different events, From Group 3 (Degree College), students participated in all major events including चित्राभिव्यक्तिः, चित्रश्रेणिका, प्रश्नमञ्जूषा, वाग्युद्धम्, गीता-अन्त्याक्षरी, अङ्कीयचित्रम्, and विद्वत्परिषद्. In Group 4 (Teachers’ Category), our faculty participated enthusiastically in चित्रश्रेणिका and अङ्कीयचित्रम्.', 1, ''),
(247, 'Industrial Visit to STPI and CDAC, Pune', '2022-23', 1, '2026-04-16', 'uploads/pune1.png~%~image~^~uploads/pune2.png~%~image', 0, 0, 330, '', '', 1, '43', '', '', 530, 'Industrial Visit to STPI and CDAC, Pune', 1, ''),
