(287, 'One Day Industrial Visit', '2025-26', 1, '2026-04-20', 'uploads/IMG-20260420-WA0046.jpg~%~One Day Industrial Visit~^~uploads/IMG-20260420-WA0045.jpg~%~One Day Industrial Visit~^~uploads/IMG-20260420-WA0000.jpg~%~One Day Industrial Visit', 0, 0, 526, '', '', 1, '35', '', 'NULL', 451, '	An industrial visit to Amul Co-operative at Taloja was organized on 28th October, 2025 for the students of FYB.Com (Management Studies) and SYB.Com (Management Studies). The visit aimed to provide students with practical exposure to the operations of a large-scale dairy unit and to bridge the gap between theoretical learning and industrial practices.', 0, ''),
