(347, 'Poster Presentation Competition on Pi Approximation Day', '2026-27', 1, '2026-08-05', 'uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-22-at-9.06.05-PM.jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-22-at-9.06.06-PM-(2).jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-22-at-9.06.07-PM.jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-22-at-9.06.11-PM.jpeg~%~image~^~uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2026-07-22-at-9.06.20-PM.jpeg~%~image', 0, 0, 376, '', '', 1, '38', '17', '', 612, 'A total of 14 students enthusiastically participated in the competition, presenting 11 posters on various themes related to π (pi). The students showcased their understanding of Pi through informative and visually appealing posters. The themes of student presentations covered a wide range of topics, including the history of π, information about Pi Day as well as Pi Approximation Day and its significance, interesting facts about Pi, the role of Pi in scientific and mathematical advancements, graphical interpretation of differentiation using Pi, role of Pi in understanding topological holonomy, etc. The event provided an excellent platform for students to explore the historical, mathematical, and practical importance of Pi while enhancing their creativity and presentation skills.', 1, ''),
(348, 'Prize Distribution Ceremony of Poster Presentation Competition', '2026-27', 1, '2026-08-05', 'uploads/1000138046.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000138049.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000138098.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000138102.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000138515.jpg~%~image', 0, 0, 376, '', '', 1, '', '17', '', 613, 'The prizes and certificates for the Poster Presentation Competition, held on 22nd July 2026, on the occasion of Pi Approximation Day, were awarded to the participants.', 0, ''),
