(375, 'TYBSC Parent-Teacher Meeting', '2026-27', 1, '2026-08-22', 'uploads/1000142320.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000142317.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000142314.jpg~%~image', 0, 0, 376, '', '', 1, '38', '', '', 633, 'A Parent-Teacher Meet for the students of TYBSc was organized by the Department of Mathematics in room no.8 to discuss the students’ academic progress, punctuality as well as career opportunities. The meeting provided an opportunity for parents and teachers to interact and discuss the students’ academic performance, overall development and future plans. The professors shared their observations regarding the students’ classroom participation, regularity and academic progress.', 0, ''),
(376, 'SYBSC Parent- Teacher Meeting', '2026-27', 1, '2026-08-22', 'uploads/1000142324.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000142321.jpg~%~image~^~uploads/1000142313.jpg~%~image', 0, 0, 376, '', '', 1, '38', '', '', 632, 'A Parent-Teacher Meet for the students of SYBSc was organized by the Department of Mathematics in room no.8 to discuss the students’ academic progress, punctuality as well as career opportunities. The meeting provided an opportunity for parents and teachers to interact and discuss the students’ academic performance, overall development and future plans. The professors shared their observations regarding the students’ classroom participation, regularity and academic progress.', 0, ''),
