(32, 'Grievance Redressal', '', '', 'same_window', 'grievance-form', 'system_defined', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 'Grievance Redressal', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(35, 'Campus', '<div class=\"script-holder\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p>The Physical infrastructure facilities available are as listed below.</p>\n<div class=\"panel-content\">\n<h2 class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><span style=\"background-color: #00305e; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #00305e; color: #fff;\"><em>&nbsp;Infrastructure For Academic Activity:&nbsp;</em></span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>There are well illuminated and well ventilated 58 lecture halls varying in size to accommodate different strength of students which makes teaching-learning process comfortable for students and teachers.</li>\n<li>Laboratories (Physics, Chemistry, Botany , Zoology, Microbiology, Statistics, B.Sc. IT,</li>\n<li>Teaching Staff Common Room.</li>\n<li>Girls common room.</li>\n<li>Auditorium.</li>\n<li>Botanical Garden.</li>\n<li>Few Classrooms equipped with LCD Projector and screen.</li>\n<li>Over Head Projectors.</li>\n<li>Bore well.</li>\n<li>Examination Department.</li>\n<li>Result Preparation Room.</li>\n<li>CAP Room.</li>\n<li>Toilet facility and drinking water facility with purifier to individual departments like chemistry and physics.</li>\n<li>A room for co-operative stores.</li>\n<li>Terrace is used for different activities in Astronomy.</li>\n<li>Principal&rsquo;s cabin is renovated in 2008-09.</li>\n<li>A compound wall and security cabin at the college entrance are build for security reasons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><span style=\"background-color: #00305e; color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #00305e; color: #fff;\"><em>&nbsp;Infrastructure For Co-Curricular Activities:&nbsp;</em></span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>College-katta is a corner especially for the students to provide them platform.</li>\n<li>Classrooms are provided for &ldquo;Shanivar gappa&rdquo;, a student&rsquo;s activity to discuss the current issues in the society.</li>\n<li>German Language Courses are conducted with a formal Tie up with a foreign Agency Viz. Maxmuller.</li>\n<li>Computrain Centre is set up to impart industry oriented skills for IT.</li>\n<li>A Book appreciation Club is formed every year to motivate students for Reading good books.</li>\n<li>Cultural room is provided in the basement where Musical Instruments are preserved and student can practise there for various cultural programmes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #00305e;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #00305e; color: #fff;\"><em>&nbsp;Extra-Curricular Activities:&nbsp;</em></span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>N.C.C. and N.S.S.: Separate rooms are provided for conducting their activities.</li>\n<li>Sports:<br />Well equipped gymkhana with various indoor sports like Carom, Table tennis, Chess etc. &amp; a fitness centre for the use of student &amp; staff members.<br />College play ground.<br />PTVA&rsquo;S playground near M.L. Dahanukar College.</li>\n<li>The chemistry lab on the ground floor, B.Sc. IT lab on the second floor was fully renovated in the year 2006-07.</li>\n<li>A new Auditorium for exclusive use of students&rsquo; association activities was built in 2007-08 on the third floor. In the same year, 60 new computers were installed in the renovated B.Sc. IT lab.</li>\n<li>A fully air-conditioned professional use auditorium was constructed by replacing the old one on the ground floor. Also, other new facilities like &ldquo;ASPA&rdquo; room , staff room toilet , mezzanine for storage in staff room were created in 2008-09. A film club &lsquo;Chitrayatri&rsquo; is also formed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"line-bottom font-20 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\">Campus<span class=\"text-theme-color-2\">&nbsp;Gallery</span></h2>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\n<div class=\"gallery-holder 1 \">\n<div class=\"gallery 1\">\n<div class=\"stack 1\"><a class=\"SecondImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c1.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c1.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a><a class=\"ThirdImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c2.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c2.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a><a class=\"FourthImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c3.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c3.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"FifthImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c4.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c4.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"FifthImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c5.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/c5.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"firstImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/slider-24551bea-0c63-4d2f-9b02-62e1040026b5.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/slider-24551bea-0c63-4d2f-9b02-62e1040026b5.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/35/campus', 'user_defined', 0, 'Campus', 'Discover Sathaye College’s campus facilities including modern lecture halls, labs, cultural spaces, sports areas, and a visual gallery showcasing the college environment.', '', 'Campus', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(37, 'Auditorium', '<div class=\"script-holder\">\n<script>\n$(\'body\').addClass(\'facilities-page auditorium-page\');\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>Vile-Parle (East) is a culturally rich suburb of Mumbai. It is also an educational &ldquo; Hub &rdquo;. Sathaye College(Autonomous) is one of the reputed institutions of Vile-Parle which has a compact Auditorium with all the modern amenities required for any performing art.</p>\n<p>It has a capacity of precisely 163 seats and it is very convenient as well as it gives a joyful experience to any performer due to its good &ldquo; Acoustics &rdquo;.</p>\n<p>The Auditorium facilitates performances like Dance, Musical Concerts, One-Act Plays, Interviews, Mono-Acts, Lectures, and Presentations, etc.</p>\n<p>It has all the necessary equipment which is updated from time to time.</p>\n<p>The greatest advantage of Sathaye College(Autonomous) Auditorium is its easy accessibility since it is located near Western Express Highway as well as at a walking distance from Vile-Parle (East) Railway Station.</p>\n<p>This auditorium has become popular in quite a short time and has also become a &ldquo; Cultural Hub &rdquo; of not only Vile-Parle but also of Mumbai district.</p>', '', 'same_window', 'page/37/auditorium', 'user_defined', 0, 'Auditorium', 'Sathaye College Auditorium in Vile-Parle (East), Mumbai, is a modern, fully equipped 163-seat venue ideal for cultural performances, lectures, and presentations', '', 'Auditorium', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(39, 'Botanical Garden', '', '', 'same_window', 'page/39/botanical-garden', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Botanical Garden', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(40, 'Cafeteria', '<p>The Cafeteria is based on the ground floor of the college building and is open during hours notified by the Principal.</p>\n<p><br />The Cafeteria prospects with</p>\n<div class=\"panel-content\">\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Nutritious, healthy food is available for students.</li>\n<li>Spacious place.</li>\n<li>Income generation (Ads).</li>\n<li>Good hang-out.</li>\n<li>Useful for small gatherings (informal).</li>\n<li>Efficient catering service for college functions.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 class=\"line-bottom font-20 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><span class=\"text-theme-color-2\">Cafeteria Gallery</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/canteen-009efee5-60d7-4ff2-a0d0-3082b44b5fbb.jpg\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/40/cafeteria', 'user_defined', 0, 'Cafeteria', 'Sathaye College Cafeteria offers nutritious food, a spacious seating area, and efficient catering services, making it a popular student hangout and event space.', '', 'Cafeteria', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(41, 'NAAC', '', '', 'same_window', 'page/41/naac', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'NAAC', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(42, 'NAAC Certificates', '<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NAAC-Extention-Certificate.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NAAC Extension Certificate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NAAC-Certificates.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NAAC Certificate</a></li>\n</ul>', '', 'same_window', 'page/42/naac-certificates', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'NAAC Certificates', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(44, 'AQAR', '', '', 'same_window', 'aqar', 'system_defined', 0, NULL, NULL, '', 'AQAR', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(47, 'About IQAC', '<div class=\"script-holder\">\n<script>\n$(\'body\').addClass(\'iqac-page aboutiqac-page\');\n</script>\n</div>\n<p><strong>IQAC</strong></p>\n<p>In pursuance of its Action Plan for performance evaluation, assessment &amp; accreditation &amp; quality up-gradation of institutions of higher education, NAAC proposes that every accredited institution should establish an Internal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC) as a post-accreditation quality sustenance measure. Since quality enhancement is a continuous process, the IQAC will become a part of the institution&rsquo;s system &amp; work towards realisation of the goals of quality enhancement &amp; sustenance. The prime task of the IQAC is to develop a system for conscious, consistent &amp; catalytic improvement in the overall performance of institutions. For this, during the post-accreditation period, it will channelize all efforts &amp; measures of the institution towards promoting its holistic academic excellence.</p>\n<p><strong>STRATEGIES</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>IQAC shall evolve mechanisms and procedures for:</li>\n<li>Ensuring timely, efficient and progressive performance of academic, administrative and financial tasks</li>\n<li>The relevance and quality of academic and research programmes</li>\n<li>Equitable access to and affordability of academic programmes for various sections of society</li>\n<li>Optimization and integration of modern methods of teaching and learning</li>\n<li>The credibility of evaluation procedures</li>\n<li>Ensuring the adequacy, maintenance and functioning of the support structure and services</li>\n<li>Research sharing and networking with other institutions in India and abroad</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>FUNCTIONS</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Some of the functions expected of the IQAC are:</li>\n<li>Development and application of quality benchmarks/parameters for various academic and administrative activities of the institution</li>\n<li>Facilitating the creation of a learner-centric environment conducive to quality education and faculty maturation to adopt the required knowledge and technology for participatory teaching and learning process</li>\n<li>Arrangement for feedback response from students, parents and other stakeholders on quality-related institutional processes</li>\n<li>Dissemination of information on various quality parameters of higher education</li>\n<li>Organization of inter and intra institutional workshops, seminars on quality related themes and promotion of quality circles</li>\n<li>Documentation of the various programmes/activities leading to quality improvement</li>\n<li>Acting as a nodal agency of the Institution for coordinating quality-related activities, including adoption and dissemination of best practices</li>\n<li>Development and maintenance of institutional database through MIS for the purpose of maintaining/enhancing the institutional quality</li>\n<li>Development of Quality Culture in the institution</li>\n<li>Preparation of the Annual Quality Assurance Report (AQAR) as per guidelines and parameters of NAAC, to be submitted to NAAC</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong><strong>BENEFITS</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;IQAC will facilitate/contribute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ensure heightened level of clarity and focus in institutional functioning towards quality enhancement</li>\n<li>Ensure internalization of the quality culture</li>\n<li>Ensure enhancement and coordination among various activities of the institution and institutionalize all good practices</li>\n<li>Provide a sound basis for decision-making to improve institutional functioning</li>\n<li>Act as a dynamic system for quality changes in HEIs</li>\n<li>Build an organised methodology of documentation and internal communication</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>COMPOSITION</strong></p>\n<p>IQAC may be constituted in every institution under the Chairmanship of the Head of the institution with heads of important academic and administrative units and a few teachers and a few distinguished educationists and representatives of local management and stakeholders</p>\n<p>The composition of the IQAC may be as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Chairperson: Head of the Institution</li>\n<li>A few senior administrative officers</li>\n<li>Three to eight teachers</li>\n<li>One member from the Management</li>\n<li>One/two nominees from local society, Students and Alumni</li>\n<li>One/two nominees from Employers /Industrialists/stakeholders</li>\n<li>One of the senior teachers as the coordinator/Director of the IQAC</li>\n</ol>', '', 'same_window', 'page/47/about-iqac', 'user_defined', 4, 'About IQAC', 'Explore the  IQAC details', '', 'About IQAC', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
