(109, 'Commerce', '<div id=\"pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"pills-first\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"pills-first-tab\">\n<div class=\"vtabs admissionsTabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3  tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-1\" aria-controls=\"first1-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">First Year</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1\" aria-controls=\"first1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Second Year</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"second-tab3\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#second3\" aria-controls=\"second3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Third Year</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9  tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"first1-1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\">F.Y.B.Com. (Sem I &amp;Sem II)</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1-1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">F.Y.B.Com. (Sem I &amp;Sem II)</h2>\n<p>In take Capacity - 600<br />(Each paper of 100 marks)</p>\n<p>F.Y.B. Com</p>\n<p><strong>SEM I (Each Paper of 100 marks)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accountancy and Financial Management - I</li>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; I : Introduction to Business</li>\n<li>Business Economics - I</li>\n<li>Business Communication - I</li>\n<li>Environmental Studies - I</li>\n<li>Foundation course - I OR Foundation Course in NCC - I (only available to NCC cadets) - Theory + Project (75 + 25)</li>\n<li>Mathematical and Statistical Techniques &ndash; I</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>SEM II (Each Paper of 100 marks)</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accountancy and Financial Management - II</li>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; II : Introduction to Service Sector</li>\n<li>Business Economics - II</li>\n<li>Business Communication - II</li>\n<li>Environmental Studies - II</li>\n<li>Foundation course - II OR Foundation Course in NCC - II (only available to NCC cadets) - Theory + Project (75 + 25)</li>\n<li>Mathematical and Statistical Techniques &ndash; II</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\">S.Y.B.Com (Sem III &amp;Sem IV)</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">S.Y.B.Com (Sem III &amp;Sem IV)</h2>\n<section>\n<p>S.Y.B. Com</p>\n<p><strong>SEM III (Each paper of 100 marks)</strong></p>\n<p>A student is required to select seven papers as under:<br /><br /></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accountancy and Financial Management - III</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing-V: Introduction to Management Accounting</li>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; III : Management : Functions and Challenges</li>\n<li>Business Economics - III</li>\n<li>Advertising - I</li>\n<li>Foundation course &ndash; III OR Foundation Course in NCC - III (only available to NCC cadets) - Theory + Project (75 + 25)</li>\n<li>Business Law I</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>S.Y.B. Com<br /><strong>SEM IV (Each paper of 100 marks)</strong></p>\n<p>A student is required to select seven papers as under:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Accountancy and Financial Management - IV</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing-VI: Auditing</li>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; IV : Management : Production and Finance</li>\n<li>Business Economics - IV</li>\n<li>Advertising - II</li>\n<li>Foundation course - IV OR Foundation Course in NCC &ndash; IV (only available to NCC cadets) Theory + Project (75 + 25)</li>\n<li>Business Law - II</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">T.Y.B.Com. (Sem V &amp;Sem VI)</button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">T.Y.B.Com. (Sem V &amp;Sem VI)</h2>\n<section>\n<p>T.Y.B.Com. SEM V</p>\n<p>(Each paper of 100 marks)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; V: Marketing</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing - VII - Financial Accounting</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing - VIII - Cost Accounting</li>\n<li>Business Economics &ndash; V</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Applied Component Group: (Any one of the following combinations)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Export Marketing I and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper I</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Computer and Application System and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper I</li>\n<li>Export Marketing I and Marketing Research I</li>\n<li>Industrial Psychology and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper I</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>T.Y.B.Com. SEM VI</strong></p>\n<p>(Each paper of 100 marks)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Commerce &ndash; VI: Human resource management</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing - IX - Financial Accounting</li>\n<li>Financial Accounting and Auditing - X - Cost Accounting</li>\n<li>Business Economics &ndash; VI</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Applied Component Group: (Any one of the following combinations)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Export Marketing II and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper II</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Computer and Application System and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper II</li>\n<li>Export Marketing II and Marketing Research II</li>\n<li>Industrial Psychology and Direct and Indirect Taxation Paper II</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>N.B.: The Subject combinations will be allotted to students on the basis of marks obtained at the S.Y.B.Com.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/109/commerce', 'user_defined', 0, 'Commerce', 'Discover Sathaye College’s Commerce faculty with in-depth programs in business studies, economics, and finance.', '', 'Commerce', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
