"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBCOM-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Com.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBSC-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Sc.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBSCIT-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Sc. I.T.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBCOM-Mgt-Std-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Com.(Mgt.Std.)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBCOM-Acc-&amp;-Fin--CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Com.(Acc &amp; Fin.)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBAMMC-ENG-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.A.M.M.C. (English)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBAMMC-MAR-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.A.M.M.C (Marathi)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBCOM-LSCM-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Com. LSCM</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBCOM-SP-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">S.Y.B.Sports Mgt.</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 about-coll\">\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBA-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.A.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBCOM-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.Com.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBSC-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.Sc.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBSCIT-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.Sc. I.T.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBCOM-Mgt-Std-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.Com. (Mgt. Std.)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBCOM-Acc-&amp;-Fin--CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.Com.(Acc &amp; Fin.)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBAMMC-ENG-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.A.M.M.C (ENGLISH)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBAMMC-MAR-CATALOGUE-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T.Y.B.A.M.M.C (MARATHI)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/124/degree-college-catalogue', 'user_defined', 0, 'Degree College Catalogue', 'Browse the Degree College Catalogue of Sathaye College, featuring detailed information on F.Y., S.Y., and T.Y. programs in Arts, Commerce, Science, IT, Management, Mass Media, and more', '', 'Degree College Catalogue', 1, NULL, 139, '1970-01-02', 1, '');
