working Standards</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first2\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#policy-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"policy-article1\">Sem 3 </button></div>\n<article id=\"policy-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab2\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 3</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Python Programming</li>\n<li>Data Structures</li>\n<li>Computer Networks</li>\n<li>DataBase Management Systems</li>\n<li>Applied Mathematics</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">Sem 4 </button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 4</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Core Java</li>\n<li>Introduction Embedded Systems</li>\n<li>Computer Oriented Statistical Techniques</li>\n<li>Software Engineering</li>\n<li>Computer Graphics</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first4\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" style=\"border: 3px solid red;\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Research - Project And Publications\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#registration-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"registration-article1\">Sem 5</button></div>\n<article id=\"registration-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 5</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Network Security</li>\n<li>ASP.NET with C #</li>\n<li>Software Testing</li>\n<li>Advanced Java</li>\n<li>Linux Administration</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first6\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Achievements\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#meritlist-article1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"meritlist-article1\"> Sem 6</button></div>\n<article id=\"meritlist-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#merit-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"meritlist-article1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 6</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Internet Technologies</li>\n<li>Project Management</li>\n<li>Data warehousing</li>\n<li>Geographic Information Systems (Elective)</li>\n<li>Project</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/248/bsc-it', 'user_defined', 0, 'B.Sc. (I.T.)', 'Explore B.Sc. I.T. Semester-wise syllabus at Sathaye College covering programming, networking, software development, and emerging IT technologies.', '', 'B.Sc. (I.T.)', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(249, 'B.Com. Management Studies', '<div class=\"script-holder\">\n<script>\n$(\'body\').addClass(\'academics-page bms-page\');\n</script>\n</div>\n<div id=\"pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"pills-first\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"pills-first-tab\">\n<div class=\"vtabs admissionsTabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3  tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-1\" aria-controls=\"first1-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Sem 1</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1\" aria-controls=\"first1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Sem 2</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab2\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first2\" aria-controls=\"first2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Sem 3</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"second-tab3\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#second3\" aria-controls=\"second3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Sem 4</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab4\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first4\" aria-controls=\"first4\" aria-selected=\"false\">Sem 5</div>\n</li>\n<!-- <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n                                    <div id=\"first-tab5\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first5\" aria-controls=\"first5\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n                                    Music Association\n                                    </div>\n                                </li> -->\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab6\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first6\" aria-controls=\"first6\" aria-selected=\"false\">Sem 6</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9  tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"first1-1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1-1\"> Sem 1 </button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1-1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 1</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Foundation of Human Skills</li>\n<li>Introduction To Financial Accounts</li>\n<li>Principles of Management</li>\n<li>Business Law</li>\n<li>Business Statistics</li>\n<li>Business Communication</li>\n<li>Introduction to Computers</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\"> Sem 2 </button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 2</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Business Environment</li>\n<li>Industrial Law</li>\n<li>Computer Applications in Business</li>\n<li>Managerial Economics I</li>\n<li>Business Mathematics</li>\n<li>Introduction to Cost Accounting</li>\n<li>Environmental Management</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first2\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#policy-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"policy-article1\">Sem 3 </button></div>\n<article id=\"policy-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab2\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 3</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Managerial Economics &ndash; IIPrinciples of Marketing<br />Accounting of Managerial</li>\n<li>Decisions</li>\n<li>Organizational Behaviour &amp; HRM</li>\n<li>Finance Group - (Elective)<br />- Basics of Financial Services<br />- Corporate Finance</li>\n<li>Marketing Group - (Elective)<br />- Consumer Behaviour<br />- Strategic Management</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">Sem 4 </button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 4</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Business Planning &amp; Entrepreneural Management</li>\n<li>Business Research Methods</li>\n<li>Direct Taxes</li>\n<li>Production &amp; Total Quality Management</li>\n<li>Finance Group - (Elective)<br />- Advanced Costing &amp; Auditing<br />- Equity &amp; Debt Market</li>\n<li>Marketing Group - (Elective)<br />- Integrated Marketing Communication<br />- Advertising Rural Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first4\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" style=\"border: 3px solid red;\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Research - Project And Publications\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#registration-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"registration-article1\">Sem 5</button></div>\n<article id=\"registration-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 5</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Logistics and Supply Chain Management</li>\n<li>Ethics &amp; Governance</li>\n<li>Project Work</li>\n<li>Finance Group - (Elective)<br />- Investment, Analysis and portfolio Management<br />- Commodity and Derivatives Market<br />- Wealth Management<br />- Strategic Financial Management</li>\n<li>Marketing Group - (Elective)<br />- Services Marketing<br />- E-commerce and Digital Marketing<br />- Sales and Distribution Management<br />- Customer Relationship Management</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first6\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Achievements\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#meritlist-article1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"meritlist-article1\"> Sem 6</button></div>\n<article id=\"meritlist-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#merit-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"meritlist-article1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Sem 6</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Operation Research</li>\n<li>Indian Ethos in Management</li>\n<li>Corporate Communications &amp; Public Relations</li>\n<li>Finance Group - (Elective)<br />- Risk Management<br />- International Finance<br />- Innovative Financial Services<br />- Project Management</li>\n<li>Marketing Group - (Elective)<br />- Brand Management<br />- Retail Management<br />- Retail Management<br />- Media Planning &amp; Management</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/249/bcom-management-studies', 'user_defined', 0, 'B.Com. Management Studies', 'Discover the Semester 1 syllabus of B.Com. Management Studies at Sathaye College, focusing on business fundamentals, accounting, communication, and management principles.', '', 'BCom Management Studies', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(250, 'B.A.M.M.C.', '<div class=\"script-holder\">\n<script>\n$(\'body\').addClass(\'academics-page bmm-page\');\n</script>\n</div>\n<div id=\"pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"pills-first\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"pills-first-tab\">\n<div class=\"vtabs admissionsTabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3  tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-1\" aria-controls=\"first1-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Session 1</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1\" aria-controls=\"first1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Session 2</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab2\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first2\" aria-controls=\"first2\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 3</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"second-tab3\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#second3\" aria-controls=\"second3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 4</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab4\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first4\" aria-controls=\"first4\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 5</div>\n</li>\n<!-- <li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n                                    <div id=\"first-tab5\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first5\" aria-controls=\"first5\" aria-selected=\"false\">\n                                    Music Association\n                                    </div>\n                                </li> -->\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab6\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first6\" aria-controls=\"first6\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 6</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab7\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first7\" aria-controls=\"first6\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 7</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab8\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first8\" aria-controls=\"first6\" aria-selected=\"false\">Session 8</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9  tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"first1-1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1-1\">Session 1 </button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1-1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 1</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Effective Communication Skills 1</li>\n<li>Basics of public awareness</li>\n<li>Computer ID (Office, Mahajal, Quark Express, Photoshop, Pagemaker)</li>\n<li>Important historical events of the twentieth century, India and Maharashtra</li>\n<li>Sociology, sociological approach to news and social movement</li>\n<li>Face recognition of economics (microscopic and basic holistic)</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\">Session 2 </button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 2</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Effective Communication Skills 2 (Conversation, Editing, Debating, Translation Skills)</li>\n<li>Political concept and the Indian state system</li>\n<li>Principles of Management Science</li>\n<li>Principles of marketing</li>\n<li>Data communication and Networking Standards</li>\n<li>Introduction to world and Indian literature</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first2\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#policy-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"policy-article1\">Session 3 </button></div>\n<article id=\"policy-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab2\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 3</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduction to creative writing</li>\n<li>Introduction to Culture Education</li>\n<li>Public relations</li>\n<li>Media Research - (Introduction to Media Thoughts)</li>\n<li>Understanding Film (Global and Indian Film Studies)</li>\n<li>Computer - Extended (Web Designing, 2D Animation, Video Production)</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">Session 4 </button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 4</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Advertising area identification</li>\n<li>Introduction to Journalism</li>\n<li>Photography &amp; Printing (Photography &amp; Printing)</li>\n<li>Radio and television</li>\n<li>Mass Media Research</li>\n<li>Organizational Behavior</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first4\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" style=\"border: 3px solid red;\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Research - Project And Publications\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#registration-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"registration-article1\">Session 5</button></div>\n<article id=\"registration-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 5: Special Professional Skills Journalism</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Writing stories</li>\n<li>Editing skills</li>\n<li>Photography &amp; Printing (Photography &amp; Printing)</li>\n<li>Journalism and public opinion building</li>\n<li>Regional journalism</li>\n<li>Newspaper, magazine, weekly and production</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first6\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Achievements\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#meritlist-article1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"meritlist-article1\">Session 6</button></div>\n<article id=\"meritlist-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#merit-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"meritlist-article1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 6: Special Professional Skills Journalism</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Newspapers, laws and ethics</li>\n<li>Business and Monthly Journalism</li>\n<li>News media management</li>\n<li>Controversy over the global web and media</li>\n<li>Ongoing developments</li>\n<li>The structure of newspapers</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first7\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Achievements\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#meritlist-article1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"meritlist-article1\">Session 7</button></div>\n<article id=\"meritlist-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#merit-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"meritlist-article1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 7: Advertising Special Professional Skills</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Advertising in contemporary society</li>\n<li>Copyright</li>\n<li>Media planning and procurement</li>\n<li>Advertising and design</li>\n<li>Customer behavior</li>\n<li>Brand building</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first8\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Achievements\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#meritlist-article1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"meritlist-article1\">Session 8</button></div>\n<article id=\"meritlist-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#merit-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"meritlist-article1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Session 8: Advertising Special Professional Skills</h2>\n<section>\n<ul>\n<li>Advertising marketing, finance planning</li>\n<li>Organization Manager</li>\n<li>Advertising and marketing research</li>\n<li>Dutiful environment and ethics in advertising</li>\n<li>Direct marketing moves and principles</li>\n<li>Ad design</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/250/bammc', 'user_defined', 26, 'B.A.M.M.C.', 'Explore the comprehensive B.A.M.M.C. course structure at Sathaye College covering communication, journalism, advertising, media studies, design, and digital production across eight dynamic sessions.', '', 'BAMMC', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, '');
INSERT INTO `tbl_master_pages` (`tmp_id`, `tmp_pane_name`, `tmp_page_content`, `tmp_new_page_content`, `tmp_menu_target`, `tmp_menu_link`, `tmp_page_type`, `page_group_id`, `tmp_meta_title`, `tmp_meta_description`, `tmp_meta_keywords`, `tmp_page_title`, `tmp_col_width`, `tmp_page_menu_type_bit`, `user_id`, `tmp_added_date`, `approve_bit`, `rejected_reason`) VALUES
(251, 'Junior', '<div class=\"script-holder\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div id=\"pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"pills-first\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"pills-first-tab\">\n<div class=\"vtabs admissionsTabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3  tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-1\" aria-controls=\"first1-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Arts</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1\" aria-controls=\"first1\" aria-selected=\"true\">Science</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"second-tab3\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#second3\" aria-controls=\"second3\" aria-selected=\"false\">Commerce</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"second-tab4\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#second4\" aria-controls=\"second4\" aria-selected=\"false\">+2 Vocational Course</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9  tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"first1-1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\">Arts</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1-1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1-1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Arts</h2>\n<section>\n<div id=\"accordionFlushExample\" class=\"accordion accordion-flush\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingOne\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseOne\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseOne\">F.Y.J.C. (XI)</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseOne\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingOne\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Compulsory Subjects</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>English</li>\n<li>Marathi or Hindi (choose any 1)</li>\n<li>History / Mathematics and Statistics ( choose any 1) (Students opted ALGEBRA at the 10th board exam are NOT eligible)</li>\n<li>Sanskrit / French/German / Geography (choose any 1)</li>\n<li>Logic / Psychology ( Psychology as per merit and availability of the seats.)</li>\n<li>Logic or Sanskrit or French or German or Maths or Hindi</li>\n<li>Economics</li>\n<li>Environment Education and Water Security Compulsory (Graded Examination)</li>\n<li>Health &amp; Physical Education Compulsory (Graded examination)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Arts students cannot opt for Logic and Maths together.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"accordionFlushExample\" class=\"accordion accordion-flush\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingTwo\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseTwo\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseTwo\"> S.Y.J.C. (XII)</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseTwo\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingTwo\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p class=\"pt-3\">Students of the S.Y.J.C. Class in Arts are required to offer the same combination of subjects as offered by them in the F.Y.J.C. class.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\" tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"first-article1\">Science</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"first-tab1\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Science</h2>\n<section>\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingfour\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapsefour\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapsefour\">F.Y.J.C. (XI) </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapsefour\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingfour\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Compulsory Subjects</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>English</li>\n<li>Marathi / Hindi / Sanskrit / French/German ( choose any 1)</li>\n<li>Physics</li>\n<li>Chemistry</li>\n<li>Mathematics &amp; Statistics / Psychology (choose any 1) - (Psychology as per merit and availability of the seats.)</li>\n<li>Biology</li>\n<li>Environment education and water security. Compulsory(Graded examination)</li>\n<li>Health &amp; Physical Education Compulsory (Graded examination)</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>F.Y.J.C. Science (+2-Vocational): [Bifocal - Vocational]</strong></p>\n<p align=\"justify\">This college conducts Vocational Courses in Electronics and Computer Science at + 2 Stage. (Electronics: 90 seats, Computer Science: 50 seats.)</p>\n<p align=\"justify\">In the case of Electronics, the first 50 students on merit (as per rules prescribed by the Government from time to time) will not have to pay any additional fees. The next 40 students will have to pay Rs. 26,220/- per annum as additional fees for this subject.</p>\n<p align=\"justify\">All students selected for Computer Science will have to pay Rs. 26,220/- as additional fees for this subject. The additional fee is to be paid only when the student is finally selected for these subjects.</p>\n<p align=\"justify\">All students selected for Electronics &amp; Computer Science need to pay Rs.1,200/- per annum as development Fees and Rs.20/- for vocational fees. Provision for teaching the vocational subjects (i) Electrical Maintenance (EM) (ii) Mechanical Maintenance (MM) (iii) Scooter and Motor Cycle Servicing (SMCS) will be made as per instructions received from the Government.</p>\n<p align=\"justify\">Students who successfully complete the Bifocal Vocational Courses are eligible for admission to the higher class F.Y.B.Sc. at the university level and also for Engineering.</p>\n<p align=\"justify\">All Science students desirous of joining Vocational Courses will apply on a separate form available at the time of admission. The list of students selected for the Course will be notified in due course.</p>\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Benefits Of Bifocal Vocational Courses</strong></p>\n<p>The students who want to opt for Engineering can apply for Bifocal Vocational Courses.</p>\n<p>Vocational Course includes the following 5 Subjects:</p>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Electronics</li>\n<li>Computer Science (C.S.)</li>\n<li>Mechanical Maintenance (M.M.)</li>\n<li>Electrical Maintenance (E.M.)</li>\n<li>Scooter Motor and Cycle Servicing (SMCS)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>All the above subjects carry 200 Marks.</p>\n<p>After opting for any of the above subjects, one language and one optional subject is exempted.</p>\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Benefits Of Vocational Courses</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>One of the most and biggest advantage is that the student will get sufficient essential knowledge about the Electronics, Computer Science, E.M., M.M., SMCS around us with which we deal in our daily life.</li>\n<li>The subject is 100% beneficial for the student of B.E., Polytechnic, B.Sc in future.</li>\n<li>Whatever may be the branch 40-50% of the syllabus will reappear in the 1st year of Engineering in subjects like physics and electrical technology.</li>\n<li>As most of the basic concepts are covered, it will be helpful for constructing any module or unit related to electronics for the project in the final year of Engineering or B.Sc.</li>\n<li>As this subject is not for maintenance and repairing purpose, but students interested in this subjects may be able to detect the faults in the household or general electronics.</li>\n<li>The syllabus is structured in a way that helps learn about both the aspects - Hardware and Software. It is the first formal education course on Computers and it certainly lays the foundation for the future.</li>\n<li>The College imparts bifocal vocational courses viz. Computer Science, Electronics. The arrangement of the bifocal vocational courses viz. Electrical Maintenance, Mechanical Maintenance, and Scooter Motor Cycle Servicing are conducted jointly and are held at Govt. Technical High School, Irla, Vile Parle (West).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Subjects to be offered by a student seeking admission to Bifocal-Vocational</p>\n<ol type=\"A\">\n<li><strong>Compulsory Subjects:</strong>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>English</li>\n<li>Chemistry</li>\n<li>Physics</li>\n<li>Mathematics &amp; Statistics</li>\n<li>Electronics/Computer Science / EM / MM / SMCS - Paper I and II</li>\n<li>Environment Education and Water security. Compulsory(Graded Examination)</li>\n<li>Health &amp; Physical Education Compulsory (Graded Examination)</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingfive\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapsefive\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapsefive\">S.Y.J.C. (XII)</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapsefive\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingfive\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p>Students of the S.Y.J.C. Class in Science are required to offer the same combination of subjects as offered by them in the F.Y.J.C. class.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">Commerce</button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab3\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Commerce</h2>\n<section>\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingseven\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseseven\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseseven\">F.Y.J.C. (XI)</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseseven\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingseven\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Compulsory Subjects</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>English</li>\n<li>Marathi or Hindi or Sanskrit or German or French</li>\n<li>Environment Education</li>\n<li>Economics</li>\n<li>Mathematics &amp; Statistics or Secretarial Practice (S.P.)</li>\n<li>Organization of Commerce</li>\n<li>Book-keeping &amp; Accountancy</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Certificate Subjects (Anyone)&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>NCC</li>\n<li>NSS</li>\n<li>Health &amp; Physical Education</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"font-18 text-theme-colored text-capitalize mb-10 mt-0\"><strong>Note: </strong>It Is Advisable That Students Getting Less Than 50 Marks In Mathematics In The S.S.C. Examination Do Not Opt For Subject Mathematics But Opt For Secretarial Practice</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingeight\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseeight\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseeight\">S.Y.J.C. (XII)</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseeight\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingeight\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p>Students of the S.Y.J.C. Class in Commerce are required to offer the same combination of subjects as offered by them in the F.Y.J.C. class. However, students may offer Secretarial Practice in place of Mathematics &amp; Statistics</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"second4\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#fee-article1\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"fee-article1\">Commerce</button></div>\n<article id=\"fee-article1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs1\" aria-labelledby=\"second-tab4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">+ 2 Vocational Course</h2>\n<section>\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingten\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseten\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseten\">H.S.C. Vocational Courses</button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseten\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingten\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Aim of the Course&nbsp;</strong><br />The main aim of the course is to divert a sizeable number of students from the University Arena and Provide them with the necessary useful skills for being self-employed. The students completing these Vocational courses will also be eligible to continue their higher education beyond 12th Class ie. in the B.A. &amp; B.Com. degree course of the University. These students will be considered for F.Y.B.A./F.Y.B.Com. only if the seats are available after granting admission to H.S.C. Pass Students of this college (Arts/Com. Streams) and admission will be granted on a merit basis. It is hoped that the students successfully completing these new Vocational courses will be able to undergo apprenticeship training on a stipend in order to secure jobs. Technical group HSC pass out will get direct admission to 2nd-year Diploma Engg.</p>\n<p><strong>Courses&nbsp;</strong><br />The students are allowed to offer the following Central Government-sponsored minimum competency-based +2 vocational courses.<br />Electronics Technology(25 seats)<br />Maintenance &amp; Repairs of Electrical Domestic Appliances(25 seats)<br />Accountancy and Auditing(25 seats)<br />Banking(25 seats)<br />Office Management(25 seats)</p>\n<p><strong>Course Content : STD.XI &amp; STD.XII&nbsp;</strong><br />A student has to offer 7 papers carrying 100 marks and of 3 hours duration. The 7 papers are as follows :<br />(1) English<br />(2) Marathi/Hindi<br />(3) General Foundation Course.<br />(4) Environment Education and<br />(5),(6),(7) Vocational Papers I, II, and III including practicals.<br />Total 55 periods per week, each period being of 40 minutes, are assigned. Each paper of the vocational course carries 12 periods and each of the language papers carries 5 periods. Syllabi are prepared by the Maharashtra State Board of Secondary and Higher Secondary Education.</p>\n<p><strong>Examination: STD. XI &amp; STD. XII&nbsp;</strong><br />Examination at the end of the First Year (XI Std.) will be conducted by the College. Examination at the end of the Second Year(XII Std.)will be conducted by the Maharashtra State Board of Secondary and Higher Secondary Education. Successful candidates will be awarded a certificate showing marks obtained in each paper and practicals and the aggregate will be 600marks. These certificates, it is hoped, will enable the candidates to secure jobs or apprenticeship training.</p>\n<p><strong>Admissions:</strong> Admission will be strictly on merit decided on the aggregate marks secured by the student at the S.S.C. Examination. The student will get all the facilities available to other students of Sathaye College(Junior College). The Students shall abide by all rules and regulations of Sathaye College (Junior College).</p>\n<p><strong>College terms, Concession, Reservation of seats to B.C.Students etc. Same as for other students of Std.XI and Std. XII.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/251/junior', 'user_defined', 0, 'Junior', 'find the all Junior college courses', '', 'Junior', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
