(256, 'Add On Courses', '<div class=\"script-holder\">\n<script>\n$(\'body\').addClass(\'admission-page addoncourse-page\');\n$(\'.about-page\').addClass(\'paragraph-margin\');\n</script>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row online-forms-page\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/math-1123/home\">Mathematics for Competitive Examination</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/add-on-course-mathematics-for-/home\">Foundations for Undergraduate Mathematics</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/film-and-philosophy/home\">Film &amp; Philosophy</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/addoncourserm/home\">Research Methodology</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/add-on-phy-dept-sathayecollege\">Laboratory Equipment Repairs</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/horticulture-and-gardening/home\">Horticulture and Gardening</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-course-in-commerce/home\">Share Market- Technical and Fundamental Analysis</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/bengalilanguage/home\">Certificate Course in Bengali Language</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/statistics-add-on-course-1/home\">Statistical Data Analysis using MS Excel-Basic</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/exploring-mind-through-dance/home\">Exploring Mind through Dance and Movement</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/basic-data-science/home\">Basic Data Science</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/modicourse/home\">Diploma in the proficiency of Modi Transliteration-Translation, <br />Calligraphy, Research and Teaching techniques</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/diploma-in-indian-archaeology/home\">Diploma in Indian Archaeology</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/introduction-to-intangible-her/home\">Certificate Course in Introduction to Intangible Heritage</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/certificate-course-in-german/home\">Certificate Course In German</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/sathaye-ipr-add-on-course/home\">Introduction to Intellectual Property Rights</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-coursesbms/home\">Office Application And Advanced Excel</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/sathayecollegedeptofenglish/home\">Public Speaking And Communication</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/addoncoursebasiceconometrics/home\">Basic Econometrics</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/digitalcartographyandsurvey/home\">Modern Surveying Techniques And Advanced Digital Cartography</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/botany-mushroom-cultivation-/home\">Mushroom cultivation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/entrepreneurship-in-education/home\">Entrepreneurship in Education</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/descriptive-statistics-using-p/home\">Descriptive Statistics Using Python</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12\">\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-course-ii-statistics/home\">Statistical Data Analysis Using MS Excel - Advanced</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/adoncourse/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Film Appreciation</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/massmediaaddoncourse/home\">Mass Media Add-on Courses</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/certificatecourseinportuguesel/home\">Certificate course in Portuguese language, history and <br />Lusophone studies</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/jainartarchitecture/home\">Certificate Course in Jain Art and Archaeology</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/buddhistrock-cutmonasteriesinm/home\">Certificate Course in Buddhist Rock-cut Monasteries in Maharashtra</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/certificate-course-in-french/home\">Certificate Course In French</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/zoologyaddoncourse/home\">Fish Rearing and Care</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/professional-ethics/home\">Professional Ethics</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/certificate-course-ps/home\">Preparatory course in Competitive Examinations</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/addoncoursebasicmathematicsand/home\">Basic Mathematics and Statistics for Economic Analysis</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/geospatial-technology/home\">Geospatial Technology - GIS, GPS and RST</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/botany-herbarium/home\">Plant Identification And Herbarium Techniques: Preparation, <br />Plant identification</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-courses-for-sanskrit/home?authuser=5\">Learning Sanskrit as a second language</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/tally-erp-/home\">Basic Accounting through Tally ERP.9 / Tally Prime</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/genderandlaw/home\">Gender and Law</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-hindi/home\">Career in Hindi language</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/archives-management/home\">Diploma in Archives Management: Theory and Practice</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/ancient-indian-culture/home\">Certificate Course In Ancient Indian Culture</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/buddhiststudies/home\">Certificate Course in Buddhist Art &amp; Archaeology</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/certificate-course-in-spanish/home\">Certificate Course In Spanish</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/food-nutrition-and-dietetics/home\">Food Nutrition and Dietetics</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/256/add-on-courses', 'user_defined', 0, 'Add On Courses', 'Explore a diverse range of certificate, diploma, and add-on courses at Sathaye College, including Data Science, Foreign Languages, Film Studies, IPR, Tally, GIS, Heritage Studies, and more for career and academic enrichment.', '', 'Add On Courses', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(257, 'News & Events', '<div class=\"container img-card\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/18-feb-2023-Industrial-Visit.jpg\" width=\"350\" height=\"280\" /></div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">18 Feb <br />2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Industrial Visit: Dr. BSKKV Dapoli University</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">The Statistics Department of Sathaye College (Autonomous) arranged an industrial visit to the Dr . Balasaheb Sawant Konkan Krishi Vidyapeeth, Dapoli, Dist. Ratnagiri (Agricultural University), for all the T.Y.B.Sc. S tatistics students. The trip was arranged on 16th, 17th and 18th of February, 2023. Head of Department Mr. Sanjay Karande and Ms. Vasanti Todakar guided the students throughout the journey. On 16th February, teachers and students gathered at the CSMT railway station and boarded the train to Khed at 7:00 am. On reaching Khed, the group boarded the tour bus and reached their accommodation Kisan Bhavan at university guest house, Dapoli at 12.30 pm. After lunch, the students were taken to the DBSKKV Agricultural University. Firstly, at the Solar Energy Park of the institute, the students were guided by Mr. Hemant sir about the renewable energy sources and solar energy projects like solar dryer, solar parabola heater, solar cooker and many others. After the guided tour at the Energy Park, the students visited the Agricultural Statistics department, Experimental Learning Programme field of the college. At the farm, the students learnt about the statistical techniques used in farming like the practical uses of ANOVA such as Randomized Block Design used in watermelon farming to test the fertilizers, etc. The day came to an end with fun games and activities planned by the students after having a hearty dinner. On the second day of the visit, the group explored the various tourist spots that Konkan has to offer. The day began with a wholesome breakfast followed by the visit to the River Vashishti. The class took the blessings of Chandika Devi at Dabhol and then visited Parshuram Bhumi which is famous for its 21 feet tall statue of Lord Parshuram. The group spent a memorable evening at the Harnai Beach..</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/3-feb-2023-Career-In-Actuary.jpg\" width=\"350\" height=\"280\" /></div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">03 Feb<br />2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Guest Lecture: &ldquo;Career In Actuary&rdquo;</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">On 3rd February 2023, the Department of Statistics had organized a guest lecture on Careers in Actuary. The guest speaker Mr. Nachiket Kulkarni, CM1 expert (from Finstast academy) was heartily welcomed and introduced by Mr. Partha Lalit, a student of T.Y.B.Sc. Statistics. In the lecture he showed us the PPT and explained it to us. The PPT was about what actuarial science actually is and it\'s scope in real world. Which are the Institutes which conduct these exams, the passing percentage, etc. He told us why one should choose this career. At the end, vote of thanks was given by Mr. Partha Lalit, a student of statistics and as per the feedback received from the participants it was a very good learning experience.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/21-jan-2023-Statomania-Uncertainty-to-Certainty.jpg\" width=\"350\" height=\"280\" /></div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">21 Jan <br />2023</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Intercollegiate competitions: &ldquo;Statomania-Uncertainty to Certainty&rdquo;</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">On 21st January 2023, at Sathaye College (Autonomous) the Department of Statistics had organised a fest called Statomania. The word \'Statomania\' has been articulated from two words Statistics and Mania which means crazy for Statistics. The fest (intercollegiate competitions) was organised under the guidance of Shri. Sanjay Karande, Head, Department of Statistics. At 9:30 a.m. Dr. Ullhas Dixit sir, former head, Department of Statistics at Mumbai University, inaugurated the event and shared a few words of wisdom. The principle of Sathaye College (Autonomous) Dr. Madhav Rajwade, VP. Dr. D. M. Nerkar and VP. Smt. Pramodini Sawant marked their presence at the inauguration. Inaguration ceremony was hosted by. Raksha Khadapkar, student of F. Y. B. Sc. Statistics. The fest was fun packed with enjoyable games related to Applications of Statistics and was held from 10:00 a.m. to 4:00 p.m. Following is the list of games conducted :-</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Murder mystery</li>\n<li>Dream team: The Auction</li>\n<li>Chakravyuh</li>\n<li>Instagram reels</li>\n<li>Stand comedy</li>\n<li>Teen patti</li>\n<li>Ball in the bag</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">Many students from other streams and other colleges participated and enjoyed the games. The fest was successfully planned and executed under the guidance of the teachers of Statistics Department and the FY, SY and TY Statistics students eagerly volunteered in the execution of the same. Valedictory function was held at 3 p.m. All the Statistics Department teachers and students as well as the participants of the respective games were present. This function was hosted by Preksha Mehta F.Y. B. Sc. Statistics Student.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div id=\"carouselExampleCaptions\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-bs-ride=\"carousel\">\n<div class=\"carousel-indicators\"><button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-bs-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\" aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Slide 1\"></button> <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" aria-label=\"Slide 2\"></button> <button type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" aria-label=\"Slide 3\"></button></div>\n<div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n<div class=\"carousel-item active\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-30-at-4.55.30-PM.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"...\" />\n<div class=\"carousel-caption d-none d-md-block\">\n<h5>First slide label</h5>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">18<br />Jan</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-30-at-4.55.27-PM.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"...\" />\n<div class=\"carousel-caption d-none d-md-block\">\n<h5>Second slide label</h5>\n<p>Some representative placeholder content for the second slide.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">18<br />Jan</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"carousel-item\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WhatsApp-Image-2024-01-30-at-4.55.28-PM.jpeg\" class=\"d-block w-100\" alt=\"...\" />\n<div class=\"carousel-caption d-none d-md-block\">\n<h5>Third slide label</h5>\n<p>Some representative placeholder content for the third slide.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">18 Jan<br />2023</p>\n</div>\n<button class=\"carousel-control-prev\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\"> <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Previous</span> </button> <button class=\"carousel-control-next\" type=\"button\" data-bs-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-bs-slide=\"next\"> <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"visually-hidden\">Next</span> </button></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Zoological Excursion Photographs</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">Zoological excursion of FYBSC students was arranged on 18th January 2023 to Rajiv Gandhi Zoological Park , Kartaj , Pune . Total 34 Students Participated in the excursion. 3 teachers accompanied the students during this zoological excursion.<strong> Name of the teachers</strong>: shri. Jitendra Shedge, Shri. Nikhil Yadav, Smt Amruta Pharande</p>\n</div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/national-conference.jpeg\" /></div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">10 Dec <br />2022</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Interdisciplinary National Conference</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">The Department of Geography, Political Science, Philosophy, Sociology and IQAC of Sathaye College (Autonomous) in collaboration with the ICSSR, Western Regional Centre successfully hosted the two-day Interdisciplinary National Conference on the theme of Contemporary Issues and Concerns in Globalization, Nationalism and Geo-Politics on 9th and 10th December 2022 at Sathaye College, Vile Parle (E) Mumbai. The two-day Conference witnessed a welcome presence of dignitaries across various Departments in Mumbai University, eminent scholars, speakers and subject-experts along with an array of carefully selected, well-researched and well-presented papers across the related disciplines, concluding it into a huge success towards its end. Besides the inaugural and valedictory sessions, the Conference hosted three successful paper presentation sessions, plenary sessions and Invited Speaker&rsquo;s Talk including the post-presentation discussions with question-answer sessions. The Conference offered opportunities to the participating audiences to fruitfully interact with the scholars, academicians &amp; experts, who deliberated upon the topics concerned with concepts of globalization, nationalism and geo-politics in the contemporary times.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-3 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"card-img\"><img class=\"img-fluid\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/theater-festival.jpg\" /></div>\n<div class=\"card-img-overlay\">\n<p class=\"event-date-overlay\">20 Aug<br />2022</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9 col-md-9 col-sm-12\">\n<h1><strong>Visit To Theater Festival</strong></h1>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"news-text-line\">Department of Sanskrit of Sathaye College Autonomous had visited K.J. Somaiya college with FY and SY students, to attend the Sanskrit theatre festival called &lsquo;रंगपर्व&rsquo; on 20 th August 2022. The festival showcased three Sanskrit plays. One of them namely &lsquo;कर्णभार&rsquo; is in the syllabus of FYBA. watching of the play which was written in 2 nd century B.C. was very enriching, enjoyable as well as a learning experience for the students.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><hr /></div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/257/news--events', 'user_defined', 0, 'News & Events', 'Stay updated with the latest news, academic events, conferences, industrial visits, and cultural activities at Sathaye College (Autonomous), Mumbai.', '', 'News & Events', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
