ection>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', 'same_window', 'page/294/dbt-star-college', 'user_defined', 0, 'DBT STAR COLLEGE SCHEME', 'Discover how PTVA’s Sathaye College (Autonomous), under the DBT Star College Scheme, fosters hands-on undergraduate science education through enhanced lab infrastructure and interdisciplinary research across Botany, Chemistry, Physics, Microbiology, and Zoology departments.', '', 'DBT star college', 1, NULL, 2, '1970-01-02', 0, ''),
