(383, 'Self Financing Course', '<div id=\"pills-tabContent\" class=\"tab-content\">\n<div id=\"pills-first\" class=\"tab-pane fade show active\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"pills-first-tab\">\n<div class=\"vtabs admissionsTabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3 tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-1\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-1\" aria-controls=\"first1-1\" aria-selected=\"true\">B.Sc. Information Technology</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-2\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-2\" aria-controls=\"first1-2\" aria-selected=\"false\">B.Com. (Management Studies)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-3\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-3\" aria-controls=\"first1-3\" aria-selected=\"false\">B.A.M.M.C.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-4\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-4\" aria-controls=\"first1-4\" aria-selected=\"false\">B.Com. (Accounting and Finance)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-5\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-5\" aria-controls=\"first1-5\" aria-selected=\"false\">B.Com. (Logistics and Supply Chain Management)</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"first-tab1-6\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#first1-6\" aria-controls=\"first1-6\" aria-selected=\"false\">B. Com.(Sports Management)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9 tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\"><!-- Repeat this block for each tab-pane -->\n<div id=\"first1-1\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-1\" aria-expanded=\"true\">B.Sc. IT</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-1\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse show pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">B.Sc. Information Technology</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Candidate for being eligible for admission to the degree course in Bachelor of Science Information Technology (B.Sc. I.T.) needs to have passed the XII standard examination of the Maharashtra Board of Higher Secondary Education or its equivalent with Mathematics as one of the subject and secured not less than 45% marks in aggregate, and 40% marks in aggregate in case of Reserved category candidate, at one and the same sitting.<br />OR<br />A candidate who has passed the Diploma in Computer Engineering/ Computer Science / Computer Technology / Electrical Electronics and Allied branches, Mechanical and Allied branches, Civil and Allied branches of Engineering are eligible the admission to the First Year of B.Sc. (I.T.) degree course. However, the Diploma should be recognized by the Board of Technical Education or any other recognized Government body. Minimum Marks required is 45% aggregate for open category candidates and 40% aggregate for reserved category candidates.<br />AND<br />Students with Post HSC-Diploma in Computer Engineering / Computer Science/ Computer Technology will be eligible for direct admission to Second year B.Sc. (I.T.). However, the Diploma should be recognized by the Board of Technical Education or any other recognized Government body. The Subject of Mathematics at Post HSC - Diploma is Compulsory.<br />No Common Entrance Test will be conducted.<br />Admission will be on the basis of merit. (Mathematics Marks)</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">SEATS ARE RESERVED FOR BACKWARD CLASS STUDENTS AS PER GOVERNMENT RULES:<br />Of the total number of seats, 50% are reserved for Reserved Category students. Students belonging to the Backward Classes are required to submit the Caste Certificate issued by the Competent Authority in the State of Maharashtra.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"accordionFlushExample\" class=\"accordion accordion-flush mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingOne\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseOne\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseOne\"> B.Sc. IT NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseOne\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingOne\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 120</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1746691840-NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BScIT.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">B.Sc. IT NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<!-- Course 2 to 7 --> <!-- Copy-paste the structure above, just change IDs accordingly -->\n<div id=\"first1-2\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-2\">B.Com. Management Studies</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-2\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">B.Com. Management Studies</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>RULES CONCERNING ADMISSION :</strong><br /># Students who have appeared for the H.S.C. examination or its equivalent or Diploma in any Engineering branches with two years or three years or four years duration after the S.S.C. conducted by the Board of Technical Education, the Maharashtra States or equivalent examination.<br /># A Candidate for being eligible for admission to the degree course in Bachelor of Commerce Management Studies (B.Com. M.S.)needs to have passed the XII standard examination of the Maharashtra Board of Higher Secondary Education or its equivalent and secured not less than 45% marks in aggregate, and 40% marks in aggregate in case of Reserved category candidate, at one and the same sitting.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>SEATS ARE RESERVED FOR BACKWARD CLASS STUDENTS AS PER GOVT. RULES</strong><br />Out of total Seats, 50% of Seats are reserved for Reserved Category Students as per Govt. Rules. Students belonging to the Backward Classes are required to submit the Caste Certificate issued by the Competent Authority in the State of Maharashtra.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingTwo\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseTwo\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseTwo\"> B.Com. Mgt. Std. NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseTwo\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingTwo\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 120</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BMS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">B.Com. Management Studies NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1-3\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-3\">B.A.M.M.C.</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-3\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Bachelor Of Arts Mass Media Communication (Marathi/English)</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Students who have appeared for Higher Secondary School Examination (12th) or after SSC who have completed Diploma in any other Engineering Branch, two or three or four years equivalent course of Maharashtra Board of Technical Education Students can take admission in this course.</li>\n<li>Students seeking admission to the Bachelor of Mass Media course should have passed the Maharashtra Board Higher Secondary Examination, 12th.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingThree\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseThree\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseThree\"> B.A.M.M.C. NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseThree\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingThree\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 60 (English Medium)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 60 (Marathi Medium)</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BAMMC.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BAMMC NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1-4\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-4\">B.Com. Acc and Fin</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-4\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">B.Com. Accounting and Finance</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>RULES CONCERNING ADMISSION :</strong><br /># Students who have appeared for the H.S.C. examination or its equivalent or Diploma in any Engineering branches with two years or three years or four years duration after the S.S.C. conducted by the Board of Technical Education, the Maharashtra States or equivalent examination.<br /># A Candidate for being eligible for admission to the degree course in Bachelor of Accounting and Finance (B.Com. A .&amp; F.) needs to have passed the XII standard examination of the Maharashtra Board of Higher Secondary Education or its equivalent and secured not less than 45% marks in aggregate, and 40% marks in aggregate in case of Reserved category candidate, at one and the same sitting.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>SEATS ARE RESERVED FOR BACKWARD CLASS STUDENTS AS PER GOVT. RULES</strong><br />Out of total Seats, 50% of Seats are reserved for Reserved Category Students as per Govt. Rules. Students belonging to the Backward Classes are required to submit the Caste Certificate issued by the Competent Authority in the State of Maharashtra.</li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingFour\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseFour\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseFour\"> B.Com. Acc and Fin NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseFour\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingFour\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 120</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BAF.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BAF NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1-5\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-5\">B.Com. Logistics and Supply Chain Management</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-5\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">B.Com. Logistics and Supply Chain Management</h2>\n<p><a title=\"For more information click here\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/department/67/BCom-Logistics-and-Supply-Chain-Management#!/bcom-logistics-and-supply-chain-management?sectionId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">For more information click here</a></p>\n<section>\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingFive\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseFive\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseFive\"> BLSCM NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseFive\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingFive\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 60</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BCom(Logistics).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BLSCM NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"first1-6\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#first-article1-6\">B.Com. Sports Management</button></div>\n<article id=\"first-article1-6\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse pb-4\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">B.Com Sports Management</h2>\n<p><a title=\"For more information click here\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/department/65/B-Com-Sports-Management#!/b-com-sports-management?sectionId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">For more information click here</a></p>\n<section>\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion mt-3\">\n<div class=\"accordion-item\">\n<h2 id=\"flush-headingSix\" class=\"inner-accordion-header\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#flush-collapseSix\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"flush-collapseSix\"> B.Com. Sps. Mgt. NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure </button></h2>\n<div id=\"flush-collapseSix\" class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"flush-headingSix\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordionFlushExample\">\n<p><strong>Intake Capacity - 60</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BCOM(Sports-Management).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">B.Com. Sports Management NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/383/self-financing-course', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Self Financing Course', 1, NULL, 353, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(384, 'WDC- Women Development Cell', '<div class=\"vtabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-custom-20 tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"about-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left\" aria-controls=\"about-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">About</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"commitee-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#commitee-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Commitee</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"teaching-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#teaching-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Event Gallery</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"photo-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#photo-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Photo Gallery</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"upcoming-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable \" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming-left\" aria-controls=\"upcoming-left\" aria-selected=\"true\">Upcoming Events</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-custom-80 tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"about-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"about-left-article\"> About </button></div>\n<article id=\"about-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"about-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">About</h2>\n<section>\n<p><strong><a title=\"Women Development Cell 2026-27\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WDC-COMMITTEE-26-27.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Women Development Cell 2026-27</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Following Professors will constitute the Women Development Cell for the Academic Year 2025-2026.</strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Dr. M.R. Rajwade - President</strong><br /><strong>Dr. (Smt.) J.S. Gaikwad - Secretary</strong><br />Smt. S.A. Pethe<br />Shri. A.L. Vartak</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Dr. (Smt.) P.S. Kamble</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">Dr. (Smt.) S.M. Jagtap</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p><strong>ACTIVITIES DURING THE YEAR 2015-16</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">5 Volunteers participated in the Women Empowerment program organized by Hansraj B.Ed. College on 13th and 14th August, 2015.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 21st August, 2015, Smt. Girija Gupte, Head Sociology Department delivered a lecture cum presentation on \"Women\'s Problems and their Empowerment\".</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 22nd August, 2015, Smt. Bharati Unni, Smt. Sunita Jeswani and Smt. Jayshree Gaikwad participated in a Leadership Seminar conducted at Ramkrishna Mission.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 3rd September, 2015, Smt. Anupriya Sathe, programme manager of Population First Ladli devliered a lecture cum presentation on \"Gender Sensitization\" followed by an interactive session</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 26th November, 2015, Volunteers of Women Development Cell participated in the Rally organized by \'Anti Dowry Movement, Mumbai\' Ashatai Kulkarni explained the objectives of the Anri Dowry Movement and need for the Rally. Shri Dilip Pethe (PTVA Trustee member) spoke on the evil of giving or accepting Dowry. Principal Dr. Smt. Kavita Rege administered the Anri Dowry Pledge to all the participants.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 28th November, 2015, Volunteers participated in the Inter-Collegiate street play Competition organized by Anti Dowry Movement and won the second prize. The plays were judged by Shri. Pradeep Bhide and Shri. Avadut Paralkar.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 7th December, 2015, an Iranian film \'Daireh\' meaning \'Circle\' was screened for the volunteers. This was followed by an interactive session between the volunteers and team of teachers Prof. Girija Gupte, Prof. Ketan Bhosale, Prof. Swati Netravalkar and Prof. Bharati Unni.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 8th December, 2015, Smt. Ashatai Kulkarni, General Secretary of Anti Dowry Movement, Mumbai delivered a lecture on \'Dowry Act 1960\' and various legal aspects related to Dowry.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">During the UTSAV festival 2015, all issues related to Women and their Empowerment were displayed with the help of Posters, Rangoli, Paper cuttings and Slogans.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">From 4th to 8th January, 2016, a workshop titled \"Journey Towards Dignity\" was organized for gender sensitization, by WDC in collaboration with PUKAR and \'Stree Bal Shakti, Mumbai\'.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"commitee-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#commitee-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"commitee-left-article\">Commitee</button></div>\n<article id=\"commitee-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"commitee-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Commitee</h2>\n<p><a title=\"Women Development Cell 2025-26\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WDC-2025-26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Women Development Cell 2025-26</a></p>\n<section>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4\"><a class=\"p-3 text-white rounded d-block text-center button-nep\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Women-Development-Cell.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Women Development Cell 2024-25</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"teaching-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#teaching-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left-article\">Event Gallery</button></div>\n<article id=\"teaching-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"teaching-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Event Gallery</h2>\n<p><a title=\"Report: A Discussion Session on Relationship / Pre-Marriage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/wdc-final-Report-2026-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Report: A Discussion Session on Relationship / Pre-Marriage</a></p>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"photo-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#photo-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left-article\">Photo Gallery</button></div>\n<article id=\"photo-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"photo-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Photo Gallery</h2>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upcoming-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item \" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming-left-article\">Upcoming Events</button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Upcoming Events</h2>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/384/wdc-women-development-cell', 'user_defined', 0, 'WDC- Women Development Cell', 'Learn about the Women Development Cell (WDC) – its vision, committee members including President and Principal, event highlights, and upcoming initiatives.', '', 'WDC Women Development Cell', 1, NULL, 353, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
(385, 'Gymkhana', '<div class=\"vtabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-custom-20 tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"about-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left\" aria-controls=\"about-left\" aria-selected=\"true\">About</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"commitee-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#commitee-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Commitee</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"teaching-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#teaching-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Event Gallery</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"photo-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#photo-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Photo Gallery</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"upcoming-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming-left\" aria-controls=\"upcoming-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Upcoming Events</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-custom-80 tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\">\n<div id=\"about-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"About of Department\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"about-left-article\"> About </button></div>\n<article id=\"about-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"about-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">About</h2>\n<section>\n<p><strong>The college gymkhana has sports facilities as follows :</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>5 carom boards</li>\n<li>4 chess board</li>\n<li>One Table Tennis Table</li>\n<li>Mini Gymnasium which has facilities for weight training, Power Lifting Boxing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>The college gymkhana has sports facilities as follows :</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Two Volleyball courts</li>\n<li>Two Kabbadi fields</li>\n<li>One Kho kho field</li>\n<li>One Basket Ball court</li>\n<li>One mini soccer field</li>\n<li>One cricket Field of the parent body with 3 turf wickets and 3 concrete wickets.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"commitee-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#commitee-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"commitee-left-article\">Commitee</button></div>\n<article id=\"commitee-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"commitee-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Commitee</h2>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"teaching-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#teaching-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left-article\">Event Gallery</button></div>\n<article id=\"teaching-left-articl