tps://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g6.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g6.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"firstImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g7.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g7.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"firstImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g8.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g8.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a> <a class=\"firstImage\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g9.jpg\" data-title=\"Campus\" data-lightbox=\"2\"> <img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/g9.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" /> </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upcoming-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming-left-article\">Upcoming Events</button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Upcoming Events</h2>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/385/gymkhana', 'user_defined', 0, 'Gymkhana', 'Discover Gymkhana activities, committee members, photo galleries, and upcoming sports events all in one place.', '', 'Gymkhana', 1, NULL, 0, '1970-01-02', 1, '');
