px;\" width=\"123\">\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>&nbsp;6</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160px; height: 50px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>January 2025</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 68px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 469px; height: 68px;\" width=\"473\">\n<p>Study of medicinal plant from Sathaye College&nbsp; campus, Vile Parle (East), Mumbai, Maharastra&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 96px; height: 68px;\" width=\"76\">\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;TYBSc</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94px; height: 68px;\" width=\"123\">\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;6</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160px; height: 68px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>January 2025</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 68px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 469px; height: 68px;\" width=\"473\">\n<p>Geotagging and mapping of vegetation on the Sathye college campus, Vile Parle (East ) Mumbai, Maharastra&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 96px; height: 68px;\" width=\"76\">\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;FYBSc</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94px; height: 68px;\" width=\"123\">\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;12</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160px; height: 68px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>February 2025</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 50px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 469px; height: 50px;\">\n<p>Comparative study of amylase activity in raw and boiled potato</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 96px; height: 50px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp; TYBSc (MJ)</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94px; height: 50px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>02</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160px; height: 50px;\">\n<p>August&nbsp; 2025</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 469px;\">\n<p>Green synthesis of nanoparticles using AgNO3</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 96px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">TYBSc (MN)</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 94px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>01</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 160px;\"