(412, 'Chemistry', '<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/page/294/dbt-star-college\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\" type=\"button\"> Back To DBT Star</button></a></p>\n<div class=\"vtabs\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-3 col-custom-20 tabsName-holder\">\n<ul class=\"nav nav-tabs left-tabs\" role=\"tablist\">\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"about-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable active\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left\" aria-controls=\"about-left\" aria-selected=\"true\">New Experiments Planned</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\"><!-- use the title attribute to show a tooltip with the full long name\n                             in case the tab is trucated-->\n<div id=\"teaching-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#teaching-left\" aria-controls=\"teaching-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Minor Research Projects</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\"><!-- use the title attribute to show a tooltip with the full long name\n                             in case the tab is trucated-->\n<div id=\"research-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#research-left\" aria-controls=\"research-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Interdisciplinary Activites</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"achievements-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#achievements-left\" aria-controls=\"achievements-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Guest / Expert Lectures</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\"><!-- use the title attribute to show a tooltip with the full long name\n                                           in case the tab is trucated-->\n<div id=\"syllabus-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#syllabus-left\" aria-controls=\"syllabus-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Faculty Development Programs( Teaching / NonTEaching )</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"outcome-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#outcome-left\" aria-controls=\"outcome-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Outreach Activities</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"out-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#out-left\" aria-controls=\"out-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Photo Gallery</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"nav-item\" role=\"presentation\">\n<div id=\"come-left-tab\" class=\"nav-link tab-clickable\" role=\"tab\" data-bs-toggle=\"tab\" data-bs-target=\"#come-left\" aria-controls=\"come-left\" aria-selected=\"false\">Reports</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-9 col-custom-80 tabsContent-holder\">\n<div id=\"accordion-left-tabs\" class=\"tab-content accordion\"><!-- Individual tab panels --> <!-- tab-pane must be a child of tab-content -->\n<div id=\"about-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item active show\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"NAAC Vision, Mission And Core Value\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#about-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"about-left-article\"> New Experiments Planned </button></div>\n<article id=\"about-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"about-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">New Experiments Planned&nbsp;</h2>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 77.3087%; height: 136px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 5.30074%; height: 17px;\">Sr No</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.85412%; height: 17px;\">Class</td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0043%; height: 17px;\">Title of Experiment</td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.7681%; height: 17px;\">No of Beneficiaries</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 224px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 5.30074%; height: 92px;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.85412%; height: 92px;\">FYBSc&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0043%; height: 92px;\">\n<p>1. To determine the concentration of a given sample of KMnO<sub>4</sub> by colorimetric measurement</p>\n<p>2. To determine the dissociation constant of a weak acid (K<sub>a</sub>) using Henderson&rsquo;s equation pH metrically..</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.7681%; height: 92px; text-align: center;\"><strong>90</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 5.30074%; height: 10px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.85412%; height: 10px;\">SYBSC</td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0043%; height: 10px;\">1. To determine the order of iodination of acetone by colorimetry.\n<p>2. To determine the concentration of a metal ion using a UV-Visible spectrophotometer</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.7681%; height: 10px; text-align: center;\"><strong>40</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 17px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 5.30074%; height: 17px;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.85412%; height: 17px;\">TYBSC</td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.0043%; height: 17px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Soil Analysis: To determine the amount of potassium present in the given soil sample by using a flame photometer.</li>\n<li>To separate components of an organic mixture using a vacuum pump by chemical method, and analysis of the separated components by TLC.</li>\n<li>To determine the nitrogen content from the organic or inorganic samples.&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 16.7681%; height: 17px; text-align: center;\"><strong>68</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"teaching-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accor