>Dr. (Smt.) S.M. Achrekar</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">In-charge, Extended Curricular Engagements</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">10</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\">Prof. Dr. K. S. Bhosale</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">In-charge, Governance &amp; Administration</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">11</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW234582585 BCX0\">Smt. S.A. Pethe</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">In-charge, Student Outcomes&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">12</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\">Dr. (Smt.) S.P. Jadhav</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">In-charge, Research &amp; Innovation Outcomes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">13</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\">Dr. (Smt.) P. S. Kamble</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">In-charge, Sustainability Outcomes (including Green Initiatives</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">14</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\">Shri. Sandeep Raut</td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">Alumni</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">15</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 36px;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW85851749 BCX0\">Kum</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW85851749 BCX0\">. Rashi Poojari</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 36px;\">Student -TYBA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.043%; text-align: center; height: 18px;\">16</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.9619%; height: 18px;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW85851749 BCX0\">Prof. Dr. G.K. Tenkale</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 45.6556%; height: 18px;\">Coordinator - IQAC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"criteria10-2020\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"criteria10-2020-left\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Minutes Of Meeting</h2>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<section class=\"ng-binding\">\n<div class=\"script-holder\">&nbsp;</div>\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IQAC-MINUTES-2023.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of IQAC Meeting 2023</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Minutes-of-IQAC-Meeting-October-2021.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of IQAC Meeting October 2021</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Minutes-of-IQAC-Meeting-April-2020.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of IQAC Meeting April 2020</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IQAC-Minutes-Of-Meeting-8-7-23.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of meeting 8<sup>th</sup> August 2023</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Minutes-pf-Meeting-7th-Oct.-2022-(3).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes pf Meeting 7th Oct. 2022</a>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/MEETING-18th-August-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of meeting 18th-August-2022</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Minutes-of-the-meeting-of-IQAC-committee-held-on-17th-June-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of meeting 17th-June-2022</a></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Minutes-of-the-meeting-held-on-26th-may-2022.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minutes of meeting 26th-May-2022</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"criteria11-2020\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"criteria11-2020-left\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">RAR</h2>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Supplimentary-RAR.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RAR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Sathaye-College-RAR-third-cycle-2017.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RAR Third Cycle</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"criteria12-2020\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"criteria12-2020-left\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">SSS</h2>\n<div class=\"card-body\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"criteria13-2020\" class=\"tab-pane fade\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"criteria13-2020-left\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Institutional Development Plan</h2>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IDP-2024-2034.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Institutional Development Plan</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/418/iqac', 'user_defined', 4, 'IQAC Notices', 'IQAC Notices', '', 'IQAC', 1, NULL, 353, '1970-01-02', 1, ''),
