Grievance Redressal Committee</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upcoming9-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming9-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming9-left-article\"> Anti-Ragging Committee </button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming9-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming9-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Anti-Ragging Committee</h2>\n<p><strong><a title=\"Anti-Ragging Committee 2026-27\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/anti-ragging-commitee-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anti-Ragging Committee 2026-27</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Following teachers will constitute the Anti-Ragging Committee for the Academic Year 2025-2026.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"width: 95.7557%; height: 50px;\" width=\"100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 8.38513%; height: 10px;\"><strong>Sr. No.</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0208%; height: 10px;\"><strong>Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.4907%; height: 10px;\"><strong>Designation</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.38513%; height: 10px;\">1</td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0208%; height: 10px;\">Principal Dr. M. R. Rajwade&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.4907%; height: 10px;\">President</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.38513%; height: 10px;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 30.0208%; height: 10px;\">Smt. S.A. Pethe&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 61.4907%; height: 10px;\">Secretary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 8.38513%; height: 10px;\">3</td>\n<td s