-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internal Complaint Committee 2026-27 </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Notice-No-207-Internal-Complaints-Committee-2025-26.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Internal Complaints Committee 2025-26</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upcoming2-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming2-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming2-left-article\"> SC/ST &amp; Minority Cell </button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming2-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming2-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">SC/ST &amp; Minority Cell</h2>\n<section></section>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upcoming12-left\" class=\"tab-pane fade accordion-item\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n<div class=\"accordion-header\" role=\"tab\"><button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" title=\"Teaching Staff\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-target=\"#upcoming12-left-article\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming12-left-article\">Placement &amp; Entrepreneurship Cell </button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming12-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming12-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Placement &amp; Entrepreneurship Cell</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a title=\"Career Guidance and Placement Cell 2026-27\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/career-guidance-and-placement-cell-26-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Career Guidance and Placement Cell 2026-27</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/