icle\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"upcoming23-left-article\"> Examination Grievance Redressal Cell </button></div>\n<article id=\"upcoming23-left-article\" class=\"accordion-body accordion-collapse collapse\" data-bs-parent=\"#accordion-left-tabs\" aria-labelledby=\"upcoming23-left-tab\">\n<h2 class=\"sub-head\">Examination Grievance Redressal Cell</h2>\n<section>\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Examination-Grievance-Redressal-Cell-(EGRC).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notice No. E 68 Examination Grievance Redressal Cell (EGRC)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Notice-No---E--62.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Notice No. E- 62</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Examination-Grievances-cell---Page-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Examination Grievances Cell</a></li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/463/statutory-bodies', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'Statutory Bodies', 1, NULL, 353, '2025-10-18', 1, ''),
