(472, 'About ASTRA', '<h2><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>About ASTRA</strong></span><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;:</strong></span></h2>\n<p>Sathaye College has long celebrated the creativity, talent and dynamism of its students through a vibrant tradition of intra-and intercollegiate festivals.</p>\n<p>This year, carrying forward that legacy while also reaching for new horizons, we present its unified grand intercollegiate fest &lsquo;Astra&rsquo;, uniting the spirit of creativity, competition and collaboration under one vibrant banner. By bringing together the diverse strengths of its associations from literary arts to performing arts, fine arts to sports, Astra is where talent meets opportunity and dreams take flight.</p>\n<p>It&rsquo;s more than a festival! It&rsquo;s a leap beyond horizons, a celebration of hope, unity and limitless&nbsp;possibilities.</p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Theme: MYTH</strong></span><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;:</strong></span></h2>\n<p>ASTRA celebrates the timeless power of myth- where gods, heroes, and legends come alive through culture, art, literature, sports, gaming, and performance. Rooted in the Vedas, Puranas, Indian Mythology and so on, the festival reimagines ancient stories in a modern spirit, turning every event into a bridge between tradition and today&rsquo;s youth.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">From enchanted worlds like Hogwarts to the mysteries of mermaids, vampires, and werewolves, from Robin Hood&rsquo;s valor to Disney&rsquo;s fairy-tales, from witches to Thor&rsquo;s hammer- ASTRA shows how myths shape every culture, making imagination the ultimate stage of inter-college creativity.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Beyond India, ASTRA draws from Norse, Greek, Roman, Celtic, Egyptian, and other mythologies.</p>\n<h2><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For More Details </strong></span><span style=\"background-color: #fbeeb8; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;:</strong></span></h2>\n<div class=\"row online-forms-page\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wVTJitsI4jmkqJN4Bvay5BE5JpbQke2i/view?usp=sharing\">Event Brochure</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/13lJQH8KdJJh0U5p6XbyLIcHKHn8Xvf4q/view?usp=sharing\">Rule Booklet:</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://forms.gle/X7hJuV3Q8ryYti7Y9\">To Register:</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uw9KVO9noG8J-oPG7gHDRSaaxnM6Vd0y/view?usp=sharing\">Sponsorship Brochure</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/astrafest.sathaye?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&amp;igsh=ZDNlZDc0MzIxNw==\">Follow Us on: </a></p>\n</div>', '', 'same_window', 'page/472/about-astra', 'user_defined', 0, '', '', '', 'About ASTRA', 1, NULL, 2, '2025-11-29', 1, ''),
