ckground-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">OE (Open Elective): Knowledge and Curriculum Studies</span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 57px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 16.0972%; height: 57px; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; S.Y.B.A.<span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><br /></span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 83.8016%; height: 57px;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">SEM III</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.3; padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MAJOR 1: Educational Psychology</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MAJOR 2: Value Education&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MINOR: Value Education</strong></span><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>VSC (Vocational Skill Courses): Teaching and Learning Resources</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;SEM IV</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MAJOR 1: &nbsp;Guidance and Counseling&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: #000000;\">MAJOR 2: Knowledge and Curriculum</span><br />MINOR: Knowledge and Curriculum</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">Syllabus Link:</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17kAt1pawajeabxehbLO41X3-34r_zgiQ/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/17kAt1pawajeabxehbLO41X3-34r_zgiQ/view?usp=drive_link</a></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"></span></strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 188px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 16.0972%; height: 188px; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>T.Y.B.A.&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 83.8016%; height: 188px;\">\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; SEM V</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px; line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MAJOR 1: Educational Research&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MAJOR 2: Teacher Education Part I&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>IKS (Indian Knowledge System): Ancient Indian Education&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>MINOR: Teacher Education Part I&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nb