(644, 16, 20, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"gallery\">\n                    <div class=\"stack\"><a class=\"first-image\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615294-p5.jpg\" data-title=\"Sathaye College Education Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\">\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615294-p5.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" />\n                            </a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615294-p3.jpg\" data-title=\"Sathaye College Education Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615294-p2.jpg\" data-title=\"Sathaye College Education Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615294-p4.jpg\" data-title=\"Sathaye College Education Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a></div>\n                    <div class=\"desc pt-3\">Sathaye College Education Department (2023-24)\n                    </div>\n                </div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(645, 1, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<p>The Department was established on 20th June 1959. It carries a long legacy of Popular English Teachers who have continued to mould the students of Literature into excellent professionals including creative writers, Researchers, Media Person, Teachers and Trainers. At present, Dr. Kosambi Satyajit R is heading the Department along with Assistant Professor Dr. Panchshiela V. Mahale.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Department offers major degree in Literature. The students can persue their major degree in the subject for the graduation. The department is keenly interested to promote the interest&nbsp; among the students for Engliish Language and Literature . The department is popular in students for organizing workshops, seminars, and conferences on different literary and linguistic contents. It has a student activity platform naming \"English Literary Association\"; under which the various inter collegiate competitions and activities are planned and organized by students and teachers.</p>', '<p>The Department was established on 20th June 1959. It carries a long legacy of Popular English Teachers who have continued to mould the students of Literature into excellent professionals including creative writers, Researchers, Media Person, Teachers and Trainers. At present, Dr. Kosambi Satyajit R is heading the Department along with Assistant Professor Dr. Panchshiela V. Mahale.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Department offers major degree in Literature. The students can persue their major degree in the subject for the graduation. The department is keenly interested to promote the interest&nbsp; among the students for Engliish Language and Literature . The department is popular in students for organizing workshops, seminars, and conferences on different literary and linguistic contents. It has a student activity platform naming \"English Literary Association\"; under which the various inter collegiate competitions and activities are planned and organized by students and teachers.</p>', '1', 0, 0, '', 257, '2026-10-14', 0),
(647, 3, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/skosambi-.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Dr. Satyajit Kosambi</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">HOD</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Satyajit-Kosambi---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Panchshiela-V.-Mahale.jpeg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Dr. Panchashiela Mahale</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Panchashiela-Mahale---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 192, '2025-09-23', 0),
(648, 4, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p></p>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"width: 94.3321%; height: 96px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 57px;\">\n<th style=\"width: 18.2568%; height: 10px;\" scope=\"row\">Name</th>\n<th style=\"width: 81.642%; height: 10px;\">Details</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 32px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.2568%; height: 32px;\" scope=\"row\">Graduation&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"width: 81.642%; height: 32px;\">&nbsp;Graduation in English Literature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 54px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 18.2568%; height: 54px;\" scope=\"row\">Certificate Course in Comprehensive Introduction to Phonetics</td>\n<td style=\"width: 81.642%; text-align: justify; height: 54px;\">A course in Comprehensive Introduction to Phonetics will provide the students with practical skills that are useful for a wide range of linguistic accuracy. We&nbsp; train students for basic linguistic skills and develop creative and critical ways to deal with linguistic studies.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 192, '2025-09-23', 0),
(649, 5, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1t090TZ-n5ySwjUQTQKfJSuOtLwYi5TlM/view?usp=sharing\">FYBA</a></p>\n<p>Major Paper in English Literature:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Introduction to Prose &amp; Fiction - I &amp; II</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Minor Paper in English Literature:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Introduction to Prose &amp; Fiction - I &amp; II</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>VSC Paper:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Translation Studies I &amp; II</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>FYBCOM: Under AEC</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Business Communication</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oDGVkrrxPBuZgvZpmNmhYPcVzyGjY6FN/view?usp=sharing\">SYBA</a>: </strong></p>\n<p>Major Paper in English Literature:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Introduction to Poetry - I &amp; II</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Introduction to Drama - I &amp; II</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Minor paper in English Literature:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Introduction to Drama</strong> - <strong>I-II</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>VSC in English Literature:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Art of Creative Writing - I</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>AEC in English:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Communication Skills in English - I &amp;I I</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TYBA: </strong></p>\n<p>Major Papers in English Literature :&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/NEP-1.0-TYBA-Syllabus-25-26-Sem-V-and-VI.pdf\" title=\"TYBA Syllabus\">TYBA-Syllabus-25-26-Sem-V-and-VI.pdf</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 192, '2025-09-23', 0),
