(765, 1, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><strong>Brief History of Sanskrit Department;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Department of Sanskrit at Sathaye College, established in 1959, has been a beacon of classical learning and cultural heritage. Rooted in India&rsquo;s ancient wisdom, the department is committed to preserving, studying, and promoting Sanskrit as a living, evolving language. We offer a dynamic undergraduate program covering Vedic literature, classical poetry and drama, grammar (Vyākaraṇa), Indian philosophy (Darśana), and the application of Sanskrit in modern interdisciplinary studies. Our curriculum is a blend of traditional śāstra-based knowledge and innovative academic practices. Our department is known for its active academic culture&mdash;hosting guest lectures, cultural fests, intercollegiate competitions, and Sanskrit Day celebrations. We believe in making Sanskrit a vibrant part of student life. With a passionate and experienced faculty, the Department of Sanskrit invites you to join us in exploring the timeless treasures of Sanskrit and applying its insights to modern life.</p>\n<p class=\"text-theme-colored\"><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Academic Activities:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">To increase the interest and involvement of the students.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Home assignments and Projects are given.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Students are encouraged personally for making Presentations on various related topics about Sanskrit.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">An innovative approach: Students are invited to meet and talk exclusively in the Sanskrit language (once a month).</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">This brings in a lot of fun, helps to enrich their Sanskrit vocabulary and it improves interpersonal communication.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">To elaborate on it with references. This arouses interest in self-study.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">One Verse a week! This interesting and small activity makes them think on their own. One verse is given to the students per week and they are expected to elaborate it in the class.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>Important News:</strong></span></p>\n<p>We are pleased to announce the newly introduced Sanskrit courses at the <strong>TYBA </strong>(Third Year B.A.) level and the <strong>Ability Enhancement Course (AEC)</strong>. These additions aim to deepen students&rsquo; understanding of the language while making Sanskrit accessible and enriching for learners from all disciplines.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Past Faculty of the Department:</span></strong></p>\n<p>First Head of the Department: Pro. S.S.Sukhtankar(1959-1965)</p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Prof. S.S.Sukhtankar(1959-1965)</li>\n<li>Prof. Upadhye-(1959-1990)</li>\n<li>Prof. Geete-(1960-1991)</li>\n<li>Prof. Nabar-(1965-1989)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><strong>Present Faculty of the Department:</strong></span></p>\n<ul class=\"list theme-colored\">\n<li>Associate Prof. Dr. Swati H. Belsare, Head, Department of Sanskrit (1991)</li>\n<li>Ms. Prerana Mestry (Assistant Professor)</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 266, '2026-04-21', 0),
(767, 3, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/swatib.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Dr. Swati Belsare</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">HOD.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Swati-Belsare---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(768, 4, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 83.5512%; height: 126px; border-color: #000000; border-style: double;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 10px; background-color: #fefad7;\">\n<td style=\"width: 17.0437%; height: 10px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fbeeb8; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Course</span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.8551%; height: 10px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fbeeb8; text-align: center;\">\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Details</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 37px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 17.0437%; height: 37px; background-color: #fbeeb8; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>F.Y.B.A.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.8551%; height: 37px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER I</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR - Sanskrit Literature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Sanskrit Literature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">VSC - Sanskrit Grammar &amp; Conversation&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER II</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR - Sanskrit Literature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Sanskrit Literature</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">VSC - Sanskrit Grammar &amp; Conversation&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 57px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 17.0437%; height: 57px; background-color: #fbeeb8; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>S.Y.B.A.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.8551%; height: 57px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER III</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR (Paper I) - Ancient Indian Philosophy &amp; Poetics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR (Paper II) - Sanskrit Literature &amp; Indian Culture</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Sanskrit Literature &amp; Indian Culture</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">VSC - Sanskrit Grammar &amp; Writing Skill</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER IV</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR (Paper I) - Ancient Indian Philosophy &amp; Poetics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR (Paper II) - Sanskrit Literature &amp; Indian Culture</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Sanskrit Literature &amp; Indian Culture</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 17.0437%; height: 22px; background-color: #fbeeb8; text-align: center; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>T.Y.B.A.</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.8551%; height: 22px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER V</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR 1 - Vedic &amp; Philosophical Literature - 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR 2 - Classical &amp; Modern Sanskrit Literature - 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">IKS - Scientific Literature in Ancient India</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Classical &amp; Modern Sanskrit Literature - 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">ELECTIVE 1A - Ancient Indian State Craft - 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">ELECTIVE 1B - Introduction to Ayurveda - 1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">VSC - Sanskrit Grammar &amp; Computational Linguistics&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">FP - Field Project in Sanskrit</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER VI</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR 1 - Vedic &amp; Philosophical Literature - 2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR 2 - Classical &amp; Modern Sanskrit Literature - 2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MAJOR 3 - NLP Chunking Basics</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">MINOR - Classical &amp; Modern Sanskrit Literature - 2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">ELECTIVE 1A - Ancient Indian State Craft - 2</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">ELECTIVE 1B - Introduction to Ayurveda - 2&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">OJT - On Job Training in Sanskrit</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 83.5502%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.1549%; height: 37px; background-color: #fbeeb8; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>F.Y.B.A. </strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&amp; </strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>F.Y.B.Sc.</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>(AEC)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.7439%; height: 37px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER I</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">AEC - Fundamentals of Sanskrit</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER II</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">AEC - Basic Sanskrit Linguistics</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 83.5502%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.4886%; height: 37px; background-color: #fbeeb8; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>S.Y.B.Com.</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&amp;</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>SFC</strong></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>(AEC)</strong></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 82.4102%; height: 37px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER I</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">AEC - Applied Sanskrit - 1</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">SEMESTER II</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">AEC - Applied Sanskrit - 2</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 98.7918%;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 15.0574%; height: 37px; background-color: #fbeeb8; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; text-align: center;\" scope=\"row\">\n<h3><span style=\"color: #34495e; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>ADD-ON CERTIFICATE COURSE</strong></span></h3>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 84.8414%; height: 37px; border-color: #000000; border-style: solid; background-color: #fdfee0;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14pt;\">COURSE TITLE:</span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">LEARNING SANSKRIT AS&nbsp; A SECOND LANGUAGE</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', '1', 0, 1, '', 266, '2026-04-21', 0),
(769, 5, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<h3><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>F.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (Major, Minor, VSC)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FY-23-24-combined-Sem-I-&amp;-II.pdf\">Syllabus of F.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 2020) - 2023-2024</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FYBA-Major,-VSC-NEP-rivised-syllabus-2024.pdf\">Syllabus of F.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 2020) - 2024-2025</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Syllabus of F.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 1.1)\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FYBA-Sanskrit-Major,-VSC-NEP-Revised-CO,-PO-2026.pdf\">Syllabus of F.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 1.1)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">S.Y.B.A. Sanskrit&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>(Major, Minor, VSC)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBA-Major,-Minor-&amp;-VSC-syllabi-2024-25.pdf\">Syllabus of S.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 2020) - 2024-2025</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">T.Y.B.A. Sanskrit </span></strong><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>(Major, Minor, VSC)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776157475-TYBA-SYLLABUS-25-26-COMBINE-FILE-final.pdf\">Syllabus of T.Y.B.A. Sanskrit (NEP 2020) - 2025-2026</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>F.Y.B.A. &amp; </strong></span><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>F.Y.B.Sc. (</strong></span><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>AEC Sanskrit)</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FYBA-Syllabus-NEP-AEC-SEM-I---Sem-II-25-26.pdf\">Syllabus of F.Y.B.A / F.Y.B.Sc. Ability Enhancement Course (NEP 2020) - 2025-2026</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>S.Y.B.Com. &amp; SFC (AEC </strong></span><strong><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\">Sanskrit)</span></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Syllabus will be uploaded soon.</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 266, '2026-10-14', 0),
