(795, 1, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">PTVA&rsquo;s Sathaye College, one of the prominent colleges in mumbai. Mass Media Department was established in the year 2010. The department offers Under graduate (UG) Program, BAMMC (Bachelor of Arts in Multimedia and Mass Communication) in English and Marathi medium as well. The department also offers Post Graduate (PG) Programs namely, MACJ (Master of Arts in Communication &amp; Journalism) and MAEMA (Master of Arts in Entertainment, Media &amp; Advertising) with top notch media faculty. These courses are bilingual, conducted both in English &amp; Marathi.&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The current age is of media and communication, the industry has it&rsquo;s own challenges and opportunities for those with the ability to multitask. Our Mass Media Department is constantly striving to fulfill this.&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Department focuses on classroom curriculum and hands-on learning, Extra curricular activities outside the classroom to fulfill the&nbsp; requirement of media studies.&nbsp;Our students are offered- * Internships&nbsp; * On job training&nbsp; * Opportunity to attend News talk shows&nbsp; * Participation in campus talk shows</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">All these opportunities prepares the students to work professionally in the industry.&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The students of Mass Media Department have secured places in mainstream print media (Lokmat, Loksatta, Maharashtra Times, Sakal, Pudari, Tarun Bharat), Electronic media (Star Pravash, Zee Marathi, Sun Marathi, Sony Marathi, Colors Marathi) Digital media and advertising industry.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(797, 3, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/gajendra-deoda.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Gajendra Deoda</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">HOD</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Gajendra-Deoda---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/rashika.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Ms. Rasika R. Sawant</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Rasika-R.-Sawant---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 165, '2025-09-23', 0),
