(809, 16, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"gallery\">\n                    <div class=\"stack\"><a class=\"first-image\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m5.jpg\" data-title=\"Mass-Media Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\">\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m5.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" />\n                            </a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m4.jpg\" data-title=\"Mass-Media Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m3.jpg\" data-title=\"Mass-Media Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m2.jpg\" data-title=\"Mass-Media Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718615825-m1.jpg\" data-title=\"Mass-Media Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a></div>\n                    <div class=\"desc pt-3\">Mass-Media Department (2023-24)\n                    </div>\n                </div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(810, 1, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The Department of Accountancy was established in 1986. The department comes under the Faculty of Commerce. This department runs a programme for undergraduate students offering the Degree of &ldquo;Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com.) specialised in Financial Accounting &amp; Auditing&rdquo;. This subject specialisation is most popular among the students and in University of Mumbai having over 230000 students. In our college, around 1600 students are registered for pursuing B.Com with specialisation in Financial Accounting &amp; Auditing and Accounting(NEP).</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The department is constituted of Three Assistant Professors. Assistant Professors Dr. Priya Gaurav Kulkarni (Ph.D, MCom, SET) is the Head of the Department is also a Member of the Board of Studies in Accountancy at various colleges.&nbsp;Another faculty member Dr. Monika Prakash Bhosale [Mcom, SET, M.Phil, MBA (Finance), PhD (Commerce and Management) from University of Mumbai].&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The department actively encourages and motivates students to pursue professional qualifications such as Chartered Accountancy (CA), Cost and Management Accountancy (CMA), Company Secretaryship (CS), and Chartered Financial Analyst (CFA), as well as postgraduate programmes such as MBA and other master\'s degree programmes offered by reputed business schools and universities in India and abroad.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The department places considerable emphasis on practical learning and skill development. Students are encouraged to gain hands-on experience in accounting software, particularly <strong>TallyPrime</strong>, to strengthen their practical accounting skills and enhance their professional competence. Through its academic initiatives and practical training, the department aims to equip students with the knowledge, skills, and confidence required for higher education, professional qualifications, and successful careers in the fields of accounting, finance.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 278, '2026-10-21', 0),
