(825, 1, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>The Department of Business Law was started in the year 1986. It is a single-member department. It caters to all students of Second Year B.Com. On average there are about 500 students taking the course every year.It is an integral part of the undergraduate commerce program, fostering a comprehensive understanding of the legal principles and frameworks that underpin the business environment. As an academic discipline, Business Law equips students with critical legal knowledge essential for navigating the complexities of the modern commercial world. This department is committed to delivering an innovative and practical curriculum designed to shape competent, ethically aware professionals who can thrive in diverse business settings.</p>\n<p>In the Second Year of the Commerce Undergraduate Degree Course, the Department of Business Law offers a meticulously structured curriculum spanning two semesters.It&nbsp;focuses on foundational legal frameworks, including the Indian Contract Act and the Company Act. These modules provide students with insights into the principles of contract formation, performance, breach, and remedies while delving into corporate laws governing the formation, management, and dissolution of companies.Also&nbsp;builds on this foundation by introducing students to the Negotiable Instruments Act, which emphasizes the legal aspects of promissory notes, bills of exchange, and cheques. Additionally, the module on Intellectual Property Rights (IPR) explores the protection of creations of the mind, such as inventions, literary and artistic works, and symbols, which play a critical role in fostering innovation and entrepreneurship in a competitive business landscape.</p>\n<p>The Department of Business Law enhances students\' legal literacy, making them capable of analyzing and applying legal principles to contemporary business issues. Interactive teaching methodologies, case studies, and industry exposure ensure that learners are equipped with the analytical and problem-solving skills necessary to navigate the ever-evolving commercial landscape.We are committed to nurturing future business leaders, entrepreneurs, and legal professionals by delivering an enriching and dynamic academic experience. Join us in exploring the synergy of law and commerce, and unlock the potential to excel in a challenging yet rewarding professional domain.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 214, '2025-09-23', 0),
(827, 3, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"container department-faculty\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 staff-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"faculty-detail \"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Gaurang-Sandip-University-DP.png\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Gaurang Rajwadkar</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor &amp; Head of Dept</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Gaurang-Rajwadkar---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
