(855, 1, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">The University of Mumbai introduced the Bachelor of Management Studies (B.M.S) program in 1999, and at our Sathaye College we started offering this course from the Academic year 2003-2004. Since then, our Department of Management Studies has been successfully delivering the program.</span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">B.M.S is a three-year full-time degree course divided into six semesters, with two semesters per year. The curriculum encompasses a wide range of subjects, covering both general management and specialized topics in Finance and Marketing in there Second &amp; Third Year. Currently, our department offers specializations in Finance and Marketing exclusively. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Our college has adopted the National Education Policy 2020 (NEP 2020) in the year 2022-2023. Under NEP we offer BCOM Management Studies (Bcom MS) to the students as course for graduation.</span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Our department has consistently focused on securing campus placements for our final year students. As a result, our T.Y.B.M.S. students have been successfully placed in renowned companies through our campus recruitment efforts.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Also we organise Department Festival known as <strong>Synergy</strong> from past many years. Through this festival we try to embibe in students the sense of belongingness and dedication of efforts towards the department and college. Also we organise Industrial Visits for the students yo give them practical approach towards the learning.</span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Furthermore, we actively organize guest lectures by industry professionals on relevant and contemporary subjects. These guest lectures provide valuable insights to our students and keep them updated with the latest industry trends.</span></p>\n<p><br /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">In summary, the Department of Management Studies at our college has been dedicated to delivering the B.M.S program since its inception and Bcom MS as of now. We strive to provide quality education, facilitate campus placements, and enhance industry exposure through guest lectures, ensuring our students are well-prepared for their future careers.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 404, '2025-09-23', 0),
(857, 3, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/PHOTO-2023.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Mr. Hilary Gaurea</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Hiraj-Sawant---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/PhotoShot.jpeg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Mr. Hiraj Sawant</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Hiraj-Sawant---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/WhatsApp-Image.jpeg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Mr. Aniket Gawade</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Aniket-Gawade---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Manjiri-Bhosle.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Ms. Manjiri Bhosle</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">B.F.M. Coordinator</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Ms.-Manjiri-Bhosle---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(858, 4, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">FY B.com Management Studies</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Sem I</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>Majors:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduction to Financial Accounting (IFA)</li>\n<li>Principles of Management.</li>\n<li>Mathematical &amp; Statistical Techniques</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Minors:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business Economics</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Open Elective:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stress Management</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>VSC:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Business Law</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Sem II</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Major:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Principles of Marketing</li>\n<li>Cost Accounting</li>\n<li>Foundation of Human Skills.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Minor:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Introduction to Auditing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Open Elective:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Event Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>VSC:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Industrial Law</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Sem III</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Major:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span>Business Planning &amp; Entreprenurial Management.</li>\n<li>Production &amp; Total quality Management.</li>\n<li>Production &amp; Innovation Management.</li>\n<li>Accounting for Managerial Decisions</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Minor (Either A or B):</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Finance Specialization: </strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Equity Debt Markets</li>\n<li>Corporate Finance</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Marketing Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Social Marketing</li>\n<li>Advertising</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>VSC:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Entrepreneurship &amp; MSME\'s</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Open Elective:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stock Market Operations</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SEM IV:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Majors:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategic Management.</li>\n<li>Business Research Methods.</li>\n<li>Business ethics &amp; Corporate Governace</li>\n<li>Business Economics</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Minors (Either A or B):</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>A. Finance Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategic Cost Mangement</li>\n<li>Corporate Restructuring</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>B. Marketing Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rural Marketing</li>\n<li>Integrated Marketing Communication</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Open Elective:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Collective Bargaining &amp; Negotiation Skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b><u>SEM V:</u></b></p>\n<p><b><u>Majors:</u></b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management.</li>\n<li>Financial Planning &amp; Portfolio Management.</li>\n<li>Innovative Fnancial Services.</li>\n<li>Corporate Communication &amp; Public Relations.</li>\n<li>E-Commerce &amp; Digital Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Minors (Either A or B):</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>A. Finance Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span>Strategic Financial Management.</li>\n<li>International Finance</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>B. Marketing Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sales &amp; Distribution Management.</li>\n<li>Services Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Electives:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span>Organizational Behaviour &amp; Human Resources Management.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>IKS:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Corporate Chanakya</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>VSC:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Indian Ethos In Management</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>SEM VI:</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Majors:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Operations Research.</li>\n<li>Direct Tax</li>\n<li>Risk Management.</li>\n<li>Retail Management.</li>\n<li>International Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Minors (Either A or B):</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>A. Finance Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Commodity &amp; Derivatives Market.</li>\n<li>Cost Accounting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>B. Marketing Specialization:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Brand Management</li>\n<li>Media Planning &amp; Management</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Electives:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"></span>Finance for HR professionals &amp; compensation management.</li>\n<li>Export Import Marketing</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong></strong></span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 404, '2025-09-23', 0),
