r</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Mr.-Ajesh-D.-Hadal---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/satishs.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Dr. Sandeep P. Shinde</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Dr.-Sandeep-P.-Shinde---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><br />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\"></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 190, '2025-09-23', 0),
(888, 4, 37, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>F.Y. B.Sc. (Major and Minor)</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM I</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Physical and Analytical Chemistry-1</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Inorganic and Organic Chemistry-1&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Chemistry Practical-1&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Open Elective: </strong>Chemistry in Daily Life</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM II</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Physical and Analytical Chemistry-2&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Inorganic and Organic Chemistry-2&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Basic Chemistry Practical-2</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Open Elective: </strong>Environmental Chemistry-I</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>S.Y. B. Sc.:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM III: Major&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Progressive Physical and Analytical Chemistry &ndash; I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Progressive Inorganic and Organic Chemistry-I&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Major Course Practicals - I&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">VSC: Qualitative Analysis&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">FP: Field Project&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM III: Minor</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">General Principles in Chemistry-1&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Practicals on General Principles in Chemistry-1</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM IV: Major</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Progressive Physical and Analytical Chemistry-II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Progressive Inorganic and Organic Chemistry-II&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Major Course Practicals - II&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">VSC: Quantitative Analysis&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Community engagement programme</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM IV: Minor</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1. General Principles in Chemistry &ndash; I&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2. Practicals: General Principles in Chemistry II&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>T.Y. B. Sc.:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM V: Major&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Physical Chemistry-I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Inorganic Chemistry-I&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Organic Chemistry-I&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Practical based on GBS5CHEMJ0226&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Practical based on GBS5CHEMJ0326&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;IKS&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Elective: I- </strong>Analytical Chemistry-I <strong>or </strong><strong>Elective: II- </strong>Dyes and Drugs-I&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Elective Practical: I- </strong>Practical based on GBS5CHEEL0126, <strong>Elective Practical: II- </strong>Practical based on GBS5CHEEL0226&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>VSC: </strong>Industrial Chemistry and its Applications-I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Filed Project&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>SEM VI: Major&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Physical Chemistry-II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;Inorganic Chemistry-II&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Organic Chemistry-II&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Coordination Chemistry &amp; Instrumental Techniques&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Practical based on GBS6CHEMJ0226&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Practical based on GBS6CHEMJ0326&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Elective: I- </strong>Analytical Chemistry-II <strong>or </strong><strong>Elective: II- </strong>Dyes and Drugs-II&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Elective Practical: I- </strong>Practical based on GBS6CHEEL0126, <strong>Elective Practical: II- </strong>Practical based on GBS6CHEEL0226&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>VSC: </strong>Industrial Chemistry and its Applications-II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">On JOB Training&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 292, '2026-10-17', 0),
