tics Syllabus 2023-24</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_45RuNJmpVKZ5HX9spqhk5xVwZs-Yfvq/view?usp=sharing\">TYBSc Mathematics Syllabus 24-25</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Cdz69TXp-BHYt4CZuk3aO4ktx9xpAxsQ/view?usp=sharing\">TYBSc Mathematics Applied Component Syllabus 24-25</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/6.9-R-Syllabus-T.Y.B.Sc._B.A._Mathematics-(1).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TYBSc Mathematics Syllabus 2023-24[As per University Syllabus]</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/4.52-AC-T.-Y.-B.-Sc-Mathematics-syllabus-2018-19.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TYBSc Mathematics Applied Component Syllabus 2023-24[As per University Syllabus]</a></li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 376, '2026-07-02', 0),
