(915, 1, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Welcome to the Department of Microbiology at Sathaye College (Autonomous), a distinguished institution established in 1981 under the visionary leadership of Smt B S Kudva. Rooted in a rich legacy of excellence, our department offers comprehensive undergraduate and postgraduate (MSc and PhD) degree programs in Microbiology.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Our faculty team, including Dr. Shilpa Jadhav, Dr. Amita Kocharekar, Mr. Nitin Naik, Ms. Yashica Bisht, and Ms. Sarrah Kanchwala, Ms. Iqra Sayyad brings together a wealth of experience and expertise. They are committed to nurturing academic success and fostering a vibrant learning environment for our students.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Equipped with state-of-the-art facilities for practical experiments and research, our department ensures hands-on training and access to a dedicated departmental library and scientific journals. This infrastructure supports our mission to blend academic rigor with practical application, preparing our students to excel in diverse fields such as biotechnology, pharmaceuticals, agriculture, and environmental sciences.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">At the heart of our academic calendar are engaging events like Microfiesta, initiated in 2014 to stimulate students\' creativity through scientific model-making competitions. From industrial visits to internships and workshops on cutting-edge topics like Bioinformatics and Molecular Biology Techniques, our curriculum is designed to provide holistic learning experiences aligned with NEP 2020.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">We are delighted by the accomplishments of our students, who have earned recognition at the national level and actively participated in prestigious research conclaves. Recent highlights include a virtual workshop on Mushroom Cultivation and Bioentrepreneurship, and our Students\' commendable performance in the Fledgling Research Conclave.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Join us in exploring the captivating world of microorganisms and contributing to scientific discovery and societal impact. Whether you\'re embarking on your educational journey or seeking advanced research opportunities, the Department of Microbiology at Sathaye College is dedicated to nurturing future leaders in microbiology &amp; emerging field of life Sciences such as Bioinformatics.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Explore, discover, and innovate with us. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Welcome to a community driven by curiosity, passion, and a commitment to excellence in Microbiological education and research.</span></p>', '<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Welcome to the Department of Microbiology at Sathaye College (Autonomous), a distinguished institution established in 1981 under the visionary leadership of Smt B S Kudva. Rooted in a rich legacy of excellence, our department offers comprehensive undergraduate and postgraduate (MSc and PhD) degree programs in Microbiology.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Our faculty team, including Dr. Shilpa Jadhav, Dr. Amita Kocharekar, Mr. Nitin Naik, Ms. Yashica Bisht, and Ms. Sarrah Kanchwala, Ms. Iqra Sayyad brings together a wealth of experience and expertise. They are committed to nurturing academic success and fostering a vibrant learning environment for our students.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Equipped with state-of-the-art facilities for practical experiments and research, our department ensures hands-on training and access to a dedicated departmental library and scientific journals. This infrastructure supports our mission to blend academic rigor with practical application, preparing our students to excel in diverse fields such as biotechnology, pharmaceuticals, agriculture, and environmental sciences.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">At the heart of our academic calendar are engaging events like Microfiesta, initiated in 2014 to stimulate students\' creativity through scientific model-making competitions. From industrial visits to internships and workshops on cutting-edge topics like Bioinformatics and Molecular Biology Techniques, our curriculum is designed to provide holistic learning experiences aligned with NEP 2020.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">We are delighted by the accomplishments of our students, who have earned recognition at the national level and actively participated in prestigious research conclaves. Recent highlights include a virtual workshop on Mushroom Cultivation and Bioentrepreneurship, and our Students\' commendable performance in the Fledgling Research Conclave.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Join us in exploring the captivating world of microorganisms and contributing to scientific discovery and societal impact. Whether you\'re embarking on your educational journey or seeking advanced research opportunities, the Department of Microbiology at Sathaye College is dedicated to nurturing future leaders in microbiology &amp; emerging field of life Sciences such as Bioinformatics.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Explore, discover, and innovate with us. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; color: #000000; font-size: 14pt;\">Welcome to a community driven by curiosity, passion, and a commitment to excellence in Microbiological education and research.</span></p>', '1', 0, 0, '', 2, '2026-08-20', 0),
(917, 3, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Shipa.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" width=\"154\" height=\"177\" style=\"border-style: none;\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><strong>Dr. Shilpa Jadhav,&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><strong>Assistant Professor,</strong></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><strong>Head, Department of Microbiology</strong></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1719990024-Dr.-Shilpa-Jadhav---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1719989746-Amita.jpg\" width=\"151\" height=\"198\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\">\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><strong>Dr. Amita Kocharekar</strong></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><strong>Assistant Professor</strong></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1719990024-Dr.-Amita-Kocharekar---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1745293956-IMG-20241230-WA0018.jpg\" width=\"153\" height=\"197\" /><br />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\">\n<div class=\"