(959, 16, 41, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"gallery\">\n                    <div class=\"stack\"><a class=\"first-image\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718616244-st4.jpg\" data-title=\"Statistics Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\">\n                                <img src=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718616244-st4.jpg\" alt=\"Image Alt\" />\n                            </a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718616244-st3.jpg\" data-title=\"Statistics Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718616244-st2.jpg\" data-title=\"Statistics Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a><a class=\"\" href=\"http://localhost/sathaye-college/Admin/uploads/copy-1718616244-st1.jpg\" data-title=\"Statistics Department\" data-lightbox=\"g3\"></a></div>\n                    <div class=\"desc pt-3\">Statistics Department (2023-24)\n                    </div>\n                </div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(975, 1, 43, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Bachelor of Science in Information Technology [B.Sc(IT)] was introduced by the University of&nbsp; Mumbai in the year 2001. Our college commenced the course right from its inception and formed the B.Sc(IT) Department(2001) and has since been successfully running the course for 20 years now.<br />The college also started a full-time MSc Information Technology course from the year 2004.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />Starting from the academic year 2022-23 the Department of Information Technology has introduced the new course MSc Data Science.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Taking into account the current trend, the department has introduced two add-on courses: Basic Data Science, Descriptive Statistics using Python</p>\n<p>The Department of Information Technology has always worked towards securing Campus Recruitment for students. In accordance to that, the students have participated in numerous Pool&nbsp; Campus Drive programs conducted across different colleges through out the years. Quite a few of our students are placed in renowned companies like Capgemini, L &amp; T Infotech, Wipro, TCS, and Infosys.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 330, '2025-11-05', 0),
