(1073, 57, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<h1><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Club Philosophy</strong></span></h1>\n<p>Club philosophy is a platform for philosophical discussion among interested students in an informal and student-friendly atmosphere. It aims to provide students with a platform for discussing important philosophical questions in daily life.</p>\n<p>The club Philosophy conduct events and other activities that foster the connection between philosophy, everyday life, and other academic subjects.</p>\n<p>This is a platform where students can share the unexplored dimensions of this beautiful subject they are learning.</p>\n<p>Club Philosophy offers many interesting discussion forums, activities, seminars, and workshops to strengthen your interest in this subject. &nbsp;</p>\n<p>We would love to have your participation in club philosophy.</p>\n<p>To join the Club, please click the link.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EGp7jnb47mRGtJDfZR8dVO\">https://chat.whatsapp.com/EGp7jnb47mRGtJDfZR8dVO</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2026-02-23', 0),
