(1086, 57, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<h3><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Association </strong></span></h3>\n<p data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"535\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"129\">1. Microbiologists Society, India (MBSI)</strong></span><br data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"132\" /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The Department of Microbiology is proudly associated with the Microbiologists Society, India (MBSI), a premier professional organization dedicated to advancing microbiology and allied sciences. This collaboration provides students and faculty with exposure to recent scientific developments, research opportunities, and participation in national and international conferences, seminars, and workshops.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"627\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The department also hosts an active <strong data-start=\"573\" data-end=\"594\">MBSI Student Unit</strong>, which encourages students to:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"929\">\n<li data-section-id=\"o7prtw\" data-start=\"628\" data-end=\"709\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Participate in scientific events, competitions, and national-level activities</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"pdr088\" data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"768\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Present research papers and posters at academic forums</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10ihwbh\" data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"829\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Attend expert lectures, workshops, and training programs</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"c9ccgl\" data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"929\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Build professional networks and enhance career opportunities in microbiology and related fields</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"931\" data-end=\"934\" />\n<p data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1277\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"1006\">2. Indian Women Scientists&rsquo; Association (IWSA), Vashi, Navi Mumbai</strong></span><br data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1009\" /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">In collaboration with the Indian Women Scientists&rsquo; Association, supported by the Board of Research in Nuclear Sciences (BRNS&ndash;DAE), the department organizes popular science lectures aimed at promoting scientific awareness and encouraging student engagement in research.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1282\" />\n<p data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1625\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1354\">3. Center for Research, Consultancy and Technical Services (CRCTS), </strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Karmaveer Bhaurao Patil College, Vashi</span></strong><br data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1398\" /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">The department collaborates with CRCTS for conducting hands-on workshops on <strong data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1509\">Advanced Microscopic Techniques</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1514\" data-end=\"1560\">Automated Microbial Identification Systems</strong>, providing practical exposure to modern laboratory technologies.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1630\" />\n<p data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1937\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1632\" data-end=\"1670\">4. OneCert International Pvt. Ltd. </strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">(Approved Training Partner under FoSTaC, FSSAI)</span></strong><br data-start=\"1720\" data-end=\"1723\" /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Through this association, training programs are conducted on <strong data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1818\">International Auditing Systems</strong> and <strong data-start=\"1823\" data-end=\"1857\">Food Safety Management Systems</strong>, enhancing students&rsquo; knowledge and skills in food safety and quality assurance.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 305, '2026-04-15', 0),
(1087, 57, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"484\" class=\"\">The Department of Physics at Sathaye College (Autonomous) has forged valuable <strong data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"188\">associations</strong> with leading academic institutions, research organizations, and industries to provide students with a diverse range of learning experiences and opportunities. These collaborations enrich the department&rsquo;s academic framework and support our commitment to fostering holistic education and research.</p>\n<ol data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"3049\">\n<li data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"772\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"772\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"510\">S.P.P.U. and TIFR</strong>: Collaboration with the Department of Physics, Savitribai Phule Pune University (SPPU) and Tata Institute of Fundamental Research (TIFR) for MSc practical courses in semesters I and II, offering hands-on experience in advanced physics research and applications.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"1049\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"1049\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"777\" data-end=\"786\">HBCSE</strong>: Partnership with the Homi Bhabha Centre for Science Education (HBCSE) under the guidance of Dr. Shirish Pathare to develop undergraduate-level experiments. These were included in the practical sessions for MSc students as part of their foundation projects (FP).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1271\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1271\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"70\" data-end=\"90\">AMS Team and OJT</strong>: The University of Mumbai has recently launched a <strong data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"203\">Carbon Dating Accelerator Mass Spectrometry (AMS) facility</strong>, and our faculty member, <strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"253\">Dr. Abhijeet Bhogale</strong>, is a member of the <strong data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"291\">research team</strong>. <strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"314\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Dr. M. R. Rajwade</strong>, our Principal, is a member of the <strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"414\">Management Board of the Mumbai University Accelerator Center</strong>. Collaborative efforts with the AMS team provide On-the-Job Training (OJT) opportunities for our MSc students, allowing them to gain valuable practical experience and insight into the industry.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1273\" data-end=\"1511\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1511\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1323\">Institute of Welding and Testing Technology</strong>: Collaboration with the Institute of Welding and Testing Technology to offer OJT opportunities for Second-Year BSc (SYBSc) students, enhancing their practical skills in specialized areas.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1513\" data-end=\"1760\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1760\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1538\">Narayana Institute</strong>: Association with the Narayana Institute, where our department shares infrastructure and provides expert guidance to students preparing for the Physics Olympiad, ensuring the students receive top-tier educational support.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1762\" data-end=\"2038\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"2038\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1793\">Marathi Vidnyan Parishad</strong>: Collaboration for the \"शनिवारी विज्ञानवारी\" project with Prajakta Industries, Pune, under which SYBSc Physics students demonstrated physics experiments in schools. This project also contributed to their FP and CEP for the III and IV semesters.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2308\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2308\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2071\">SciPhy Outreach Activity</strong>: An ongoing outreach initiative, SciPhy, where current and former students visit schools in the vicinity to demonstrate physics experiments and explain the science behind them, thus engaging the next generation of scientists since 2022.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2524\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2524\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2313\" data-end=\"2349\">Willson College Astronomy Course</strong>: Since 2012, our students have participated in the Certificate Course in Astronomy at Willson College, gaining valuable knowledge and certification in the field of astronomy.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2526\" data-end=\"2745\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2745\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2529\" data-end=\"2546\">PTVAIM\'s COEI</strong>: Collaboration with the Centre for Entrepreneurship and Innovation (COEI) at PTVA Institute of Management for 3D printing of experimental apparatuses, enhancing the hands-on experience for students.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"3049\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"3049\" class=\"\"><strong data-start=\"2751\" data-end=\"2788\">IAPT Summer Schools and Workshops</strong>: Our students also participate in the <strong data-start=\"2827\" data-end=\"2876\">Indian Association of Physics Teachers (IAPT)</strong> organized <strong data-start=\"2887\" data-end=\"2919\">summer schools and workshops</strong>, where they gain exposure to advanced topics, interact with experts, and enhance their understanding of various physics concepts.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 211, '2025-09-23', 0),
