(1160, 127, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"color: #ba372a;\"><strong>Connect with us on Social Media</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #34495e;\"><em><strong>Stay inspired, stay connected!</strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Follow our department for daily doses of Sanskrit, Student highlights and event updates:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"text-break\"><strong>Instagram:</strong> <em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DHa2mrfogFR/?igsh=NTNwaWxzd241dDA=\" title=\"Sanskrit Department - Sathaye College (Autonomous)\">https://www.instagram.com/p/DHa2mrfogFR/?igsh=NTNwaWxzd241dDA=</a></em></li>\n<li class=\"text-break\"><strong>Facebook:</strong> <em><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/p/167rp3Gtv1/\">https://www.facebook.com/share/p/167rp3Gtv1/</a></em></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 451, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1161, 127, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Instagram Profile of Sociology&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"text-break\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/socio_sathaye?igsh=MWVmY2o5NHd6dXhybg==\" title=\"Instagram profile of Sociology\">https://www.instagram.com/socio_sathaye?igsh=MWVmY2o5NHd6dXhybg==</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 451, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1162, 127, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Sathaye College BMMC Social Media Highlights</strong></p>\n<p>Stay connected with the vibrant happenings of Sathaye College\'s Bachelor of Mass Media and Communication <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/darpan.mediaclub/\">(BAMMC)</a> department through our active social media presence! Our Facebook page <strong>\"Darpan - The Media Club\"</strong>, serves as a dynamic hub for all things BAMMC things.</p>\n<p>Here, you\'ll find a lively stream of updates showcasing the diverse activities and achievements of our students and faculty. Expect regular posts featuring:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Event Buzz:</strong> Be the first to know about upcoming workshops, seminars, guest lectures, and departmental events that enrich the learning experience.</li>\n<li><strong>Student Spotlight:</strong> Celebrate the talent and hard work of our students through features on their projects, assignments, and extracurricular endeavors.</li>\n<li><strong>Faculty Insights:</strong> Get updates and perspectives from our experienced faculty members on the latest trends and developments in the media industry.</li>\n<li><strong>Visual Stories:</strong> Immerse yourself in the BMMC experience through engaging photos and videos capturing the energy and creativity within our department.</li>\n<li><strong>Industry Connections:</strong> Stay informed about relevant media news, opportunities, and insights shared by the department.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Our Facebook page aims to build a strong community, fostering interaction among students, alumni, and faculty. We encourage you to engage with our content by liking, commenting, and sharing your thoughts. We strive to be responsive and create a platform where the BMMC community can connect and thrive.</p>\n<p>Through our consistent and engaging content, we aim to provide a glimpse into the dynamic world of mass media and communication at Sathaye College. Follow us on Facebook at <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/darpan.mediaclub/\">https://www.facebook.com/darpan.mediaclub/</a> to stay updated and be a part of the BMMC journey!</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 165, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1163, 127, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '0', 0, 1, '', 224, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1164, 127, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '0', 0, 1, '', 214, '2025-09-23', 0),
