(1168, 127, 37, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776397522-image.png\" /><a title=\"International Conference: Best Poster Presentation at Pacific University- Udaipur on 8-9 October 2025 on Green synthesis of AgNPs and NiNPs from plant extract of Rauvolfia Serpentina, Microbial activity and catalytic properties by Blesshyrose Biju, Vishaka S. Gupta, Anamika S. Verma, Manohar V Lokhande*\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776397522-image.png\">https://sathayecollege<img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Fledling-research2025.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IMG-20260220-WA0160.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/20241205_100115AM_43_ByGPSMapCamera_GMT_+05_30.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Industrial-Visit-Jaipur-1.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Industrial-Visit-Buddi-Masnali.jpg\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Industrial-Visit-Jaipur.jpg\" /></a></p>\n<p><a title=\"International Conference: Best Poster Presentation at Pacific University- Udaipur on 8-9 October 2025 on Green synthesis of AgNPs and NiNPs from plant extract of Rauvolfia Serpentina, Microbial activity and catalytic properties by Blesshyrose Biju, Vishaka S. Gupta, Anamika S. Verma, Manohar V Lokhande*\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776397522-image.png\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/image.jpeg\" />.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776397522-image.png</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/MU.Ac.In.jpeg\" /></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 292, '2026-04-17', 0),
