(1241, 1, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"ng-scope\">\n<section class=\"ng-binding\">\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">The Department of Botany was established in the year 1982 with the objective of promoting quality education and research in Plant Sciences. Since its inception, the department has been committed to academic excellence, environmental awareness, and scientific temper among students.</p>\n<p>In the early years, the department offered undergraduate courses with a focus on classical branches such as Plant Taxonomy, Plant Anatomy, Plant Physiology, and Cryptogamic Botany. Over time, the curriculum was upgraded in accordance with university guidelines and national education policies, incorporating modern subjects such as Molecular Biology, Biotechnology, Phytochemistry, Environmental Botany, and Sustainable Horticulture.</p>\n<p>The department has steadily developed its infrastructure, including:</p>\n<p>&bull; A well-equipped laboratory</p>\n<p>&bull; College garden campus and medicinal plant section</p>\n<p>&bull; Herbarium with preserved specimens</p>\n<p>&bull; Museum with plant models and charts</p>\n<p>&bull; ICT-enabled teaching facilities</p>\n<p>Over the decades, the department has been guided by dedicated Heads of Department and faculty members who contributed significantly to teaching, research, curriculum development, and institutional administration.</p>\n<p>The department has organized:</p>\n<p>&bull; Workshops , Exhibitions , Industrial visits and field visits</p>\n<p>&bull; Environmental awareness programs</p>\n<p>&bull; Extension activities and community outreach</p>\n<p>&bull; Garden development and campus biodiversity initiatives</p>\n<p>Research contributions of the faculty include publications in reputed journals, participation in conferences, minor/major research projects, and guidance to undergraduate research students.</p>\n<p>Aligned with the vision of higher education reforms and policies like National Education Policy 2020, the department continues to modernize its curriculum with skill-based, interdisciplinary, and experiential learning approaches.</p>\n<p>Today, the Department of Botany stands as a center for:</p>\n<p>&bull; Academic excellence</p>\n<p>&bull; Environmental consciousness</p>\n<p>&bull; Research orientation</p>\n<p>&bull; Student-centric learning</p>\n<p>The department remains committed to nurturing future botanists, environmentalists, researchers, and socially responsible citizens.</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tox tox-tinymce\" role=\"application\" aria-disabled=\"false\">\n<div class=\"tox-editor-container\">\n<div class=\"tox-editor-header\" data-alloy-vertical-dir=\"toptobottom\">\n<div class=\"tox-menubar\" role=\"menubar\" data-alloy-tabstop=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"tox-toolbar-overlord\">\n<div class=\"tox-toolbar\" role=\"group\" aria-disabled=\"false\">\n<div class=\"tox-toolbar__group\" tabindex=\"-1\" title=\"\" role=\"toolbar\" data-alloy-tabstop=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 333, '2026-06-07', 0),
(1243, 3, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/jaishreeg-.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Jayashree Gaikwad</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Associate Professor &amp; HOD.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Jayashree-Gaikwad---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/leela-.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Leela Chauhan</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Associate Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3 \"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Leela-Chauhan---Sathaye-College.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a>&nbsp;</small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Suresh-Sir.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" width=\"256\" height=\"314\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Suresh Kale</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">Assistant Professor</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/suresh.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/deep