(1250, 1, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>GYMKHANA:</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>The College Gymkhana has a Gymkhana managing committee of which the Principal is the ex-officio President, The Gymkhana is Chaired by the Gymkhana Chairperson, who is nominated by the Principal. The Chairperson is usually a senior member of the teaching staff. The Gymkhana Committee consist of The Sports Director of the college and other teaching staff members, The Sports Director plans and conducts all the activities of the Gymkhana and the Chairperson overlooks and helps to conduct these activities along with other staff members of the college. During \'UTSAV\', the Annual Sports Day a separate sports day committee is formed which includes student leaders to assist the various Competitions.</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>The Gymkhana aims at encouraging students to participate in sports, and at enhancing their sporting / athletic caliber.</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>List of Games offered at Inter collegiate Competitions 1) Cricket 2) chess 3) carrom 4) Cycling</span></p>\n<p><span>5) Aquatics (Swimming) 6) Water Polo 7) Badminton 8) Ball Badminton 9) Table Tennis 10)</span></p>\n<p><span>Tennis 11) Squash 12) Cross Country 13) Marathon 14) Half Marathon 15) Athletics 16)</span></p>\n<p><span>Football 17) Basketball 18) Handball 19) Volleyball 20) Baseball 21) Softball 22) Hockey 23)</span></p>\n<p><span>Rugby 24) Kho -Kho 25) Kabaddi 26) Boxing 27) Judo 28) Taekwondo 29 Wrestling 30)</span></p>\n<p><span>Fencing 31) Power Lifting 32) Weightlifting 33) Best Physique 34) Gymnastics 35)</span></p>\n<p><span>Mallakhambh 36) yogasana 37) Shooting 38) 39) Archery</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Gymkhana Timing</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>00 am to 9.00am for selected team practices</span></li>\n<li><span>00am to 12 pm for all students.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Gymkhana has</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Table Tennis -one table</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Carrom- 6 Boards</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Chess- 6 Boards</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Mini Gymnasium where power lifting, weight lifting, Boxing practice can be done.</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>College also has a Basketball court- where other games like Tennis and outdoor badminton can be played. College also has a Multi-Sport Turf with</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Two Volleyball courts</li>\n<li><span>Two kabaddi ground</span></li>\n<li><span>One kho kho ground</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Where we can play Football, Hockey, Handball, Ball Badminton, Baseball &amp; Soft ball as well. Our college parent body PTVA has their own Cricket academy where college cricket team practice takes place from 10 oct to 31st march on every Monday, Wednesday and 2 &amp; fourth Friday. From 9.00 am to 10.30am.</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Gymkhana conducts various tournaments and selection trials for all games within the college and selected students participate in various Inter-collegiate and other competitions. Students who are selected to represent college in inter collegiate competitions, get appropriate sports gear, equipment as well as allowance for all the matches from the college, after participation in inter collegiate competitions, they also get participation certificate. Those players who bring laurels to the college in these standard lnter- Collegiate</span></p>\n<p><span>,lnter-Zonal,lnter-University, Kreeda Mahotsav (an Inter -State ,Inter University Competitions, an initiative of Governor of Maharashtra), Khelo India Competitions, District, State, National, International Competitions are felicitated by the college during prize distribution ceremony, these students also get tution fee waiver and track suit/kit bag from the college.</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>The Gymkhana provides a sports corner deck for reading sports literature like sports star and newspapers, in case player gets hurt then First Aid box, wheel chair and camp cot is available in Gymkhana for players.</span></p>\n<p><span>Students participating in the Sports Events at Inter-University Or are finalists in any inter collegiate tournament organized by University of Mumbai Zone II competitions in teams or individual events are entitled to a maximum of 10 grace marks at their first attempt in the examinations, as laid down under 0.229-B. They are also entitled for additional two credits for participation/organization of sports activities according to NEP. Gymkhana also organize cricket matches for Alumni which comprises teams from Management &amp; Alumni, Teaching and non-Teaching staff members, and current cricket team.</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>For following games Gymkhana organizes matches for Teaching and Non-Teaching staff members</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cricket</li>\n<li>Basketball</li>\n<li>Volleyball</li>\n<li><span>Throw ball</span></li>\n<li>Chess</li>\n<li>Carrom</li>\n<li>Table Tennis</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Gymkhana also support sporting events from</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Rotaract club of Sathaye college</span></li>\n<li>Synergy</li>\n<li><span>Madhyama Mahotsav</span></li>\n<li><span>Byte </span></li>\n<li>Trigiovonia</li>\n<li></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span>Gymkhana has a well-equipped First Aid Box, wheel chair and a camp cot</span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><br /><br /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 228, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1252, 3, 50, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/avartak-.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Mr. Abhitsen Vartak</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">HOD</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Abhiten.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
