(1329, 67, 19, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-3\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/adv.jpg\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" style=\"float: left;\" /></div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-9\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">On 4th September , 2024, NSS Advisory Meeting was conducted in the Conference Room of PTVA&rsquo;s Sathaye College (Autonomous). This meeting is an overall review on the work of NSS in the previous academic year and introduction to&nbsp; the activities that will be conducted in the present academic year.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The meeting was graced by the presence of our Principal Dr. Madhav Rajwade Sir. Also, NSS Ex-volunteers, teaching staff and representative members from various NGOs were present. Also, the Principal of &lsquo;Zilla Parishad School, Sakwar&rsquo; which is adopted by the NSS Unit, was present. After discussing the activities, other members also presented their views. The meeting was concluded successfully.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1728303339-Advisory-meeting---4_9_24---NSS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Documents</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr />', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
