(1648, 54, 27, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Hindi association organizes various programs every year. On the day of Guru Pournima, the association inaugurates Hindi Sahitya Parishad. It also organizes Teacher&rsquo;s day on every 5th September of the year. The association organizes a program to celebrate &lsquo;Hindi Diwas&rsquo; on every 14th September of the year. It organizes various such programs also in the month of December during College&rsquo;s &lsquo;Utsav&rsquo; festival. Besides these regular programs, the Hindi association also organizes national and international seminars and workshops.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
