(1668, 54, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"417\">The Dance Association is one of the most vibrant and energetic cultural bodies of the college, bringing together passion, creativity, and artistic excellence through <strong>Dance and Fashion Shows</strong>. It serves as a dynamic platform for students to explore their talent, express themselves through movement, and grow as performers.</p>\n<p data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"755\">The association actively participates in a wide range of intercollegiate competitions, consistently showcasing remarkable performances and achieving notable success. With a strong emphasis on teamwork, discipline, and innovation, it has built a reputation for delivering powerful and well-coordinated performances across various stages.</p>\n<p data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"1137\">Blending tradition with modernity, the Dance Association celebrates the diversity of dance by presenting a wide spectrum of styles-from rich Indian folk forms like Santhal, Ponung, and Hojagiri to contemporary and Bollywood-inspired choreography. It also takes pride in representing the college at prestigious cultural platforms, reflecting both artistic skill and cultural depth.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1723\">Beyond competitions, the association plays a key role in shaping the college&rsquo;s cultural life. Its performances during the Annual Day are a major highlight, featuring thoughtfully curated themes, vibrant choreography, and large-scale participation.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1723\">The Dance Association also conceptualizes and curates fashion shows that transcend mere aesthetics-where fashion becomes a language of ideas, weaving rich philosophical concepts into fabric, form, and expression. Each showcase transforms the stage into a narrative space, where style meets substance and creativity finds deeper meaning.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1983\">With enthusiastic participation from students across all years, the Dance Association fosters confidence, teamwork, and a spirit of collaboration. It creates an inclusive environment where both experienced dancers and newcomers can learn, perform, and shine.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2128\">Driven by passion and united by rhythm, the Dance Association continues to inspire, innovate, and elevate the cultural identity of the college.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1669, 64, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Reports 23-24: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUqBXOmlac4kYIwpvjhihqVMtsu0E1te/view?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUqBXOmlac4kYIwpvjhihqVMtsu0E1te/view?usp=drive_link</a></p>\n<p>Reports 24-25: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uTmbPGoabRWX83RC8AHu-56V8Wp403RV/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=112834653138316931984&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uTmbPGoabRWX83RC8AHu-56V8Wp403RV/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=112834653138316931984&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p>Reports 25-26: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdChtLk7PKTicsnjZlq2ertpc0xgLZaG/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=112834653138316931984&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1JdChtLk7PKTicsnjZlq2ertpc0xgLZaG/edit?usp=drive_link&amp;ouid=112834653138316931984&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
