(1698, 54, 37, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Nature Club&nbsp; (DC) has always been an association that takes pride in not just participating in events but also firmly believes in spreading awareness about nature conservation and reduction of carbon footprint. The students are groomed to be responsible and environmentally conscious. The students have exhibited models and lectures on sustainable development, natural or man-made disasters, types of pollutions including light pollution, and even the recent Delhi smog. Bird houses made by the students have been placed at strategic locations in the garden.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The students attend workshops and go on nature trails.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
