(1766, 1, 59, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Sathaye College was established in 1959, and the Marathi Department came into existence in 1960.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The Marathi section of the college is 55 years old and has excellent original and ancient texts and reference texts sections.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A total of 10 Marathi study papers are taught from the first year to the third year.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dr. V.D. Kulkarni, Dr. Sada K-Hade, Pvt. Dingbar Padhye, Pvt. Urmila Ganu, Pvt. V.R. Jog was a veteran in the field of Marathi literature and criticism working in the Marathi department.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>So far, the Marathi Department has organized workshops, seminars and programs on various topics.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>A playful atmosphere between teachers and students in the department.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The number of students in the department is satisfactory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Many alumni of the department are shining in the fields of journalism, drama, film, education, literature.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Dr. Pragya Pawar, Dr. Aruna Dubhashi, Ashwini Shende, Bharti Malvankar, Aarti Kadam, Kishore Shinde are alumni of the department.</p>\n</li>\n<li>In the competitive examinations of Maharashtra Public Service Commission (MPSC) and Central Public Service Commission (UPSC), the preparation of 100 marks textbook of Marathi subject was done due to the subject of Marathi literature.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/\">NEP VIDEO</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 275, '2026-04-25', 0),
(1768, 3, 59, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<section ng-bind-html=\"section.dsi_content | unsafe\" class=\"ng-binding\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-4 col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"staff-card\"><img class=\"staff-card-img-top\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1710402097-sameer.jpg\" alt=\"Card image cap\" />\n<div class=\"staff-card-body\">\n<p class=\"staff-card-title pt-3\">Mr. Sameer Jadhav</p>\n<p class=\"staff-card-text\">HOD.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"staff-card-footer mt-3\"><small class=\"text-muted\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Sameer.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Profile</a></small></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr /></section>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1769, 4, 59, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul style=\"list-style-type: square;\">\n<li>\n<h5 class=\"\">F.Y. B.A. 2026-27&nbsp;</h5>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAJOR MINOR -</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SEM I - नाटक: सैद्धांतिक आणि उपयोजन</p>\n<p>SEM II - प्रवासवर्णन: सैद्धांतिक आणि उपयोजन</p>\n<p>VSC: संगणकावर मराठीचा वापर आणि AI TOOLS चा वापर&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SYLLABUS LINK:<a title=\"FYBA SYLLABYUS \" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vTLDG-NsY9X551o98u5AlG2YTCC1_1h9/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1vTLDG-NsY9X551o98u5AlG2YTCC1_1h9/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5 class=\"fw-bold\">F.Y.B.A. / F.Y.B.Sc. 2024-2025-2026-2027</h5>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">A.E.C. मराठी - <a title=\"लेखन कौशल्ये\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FYBA-AEC-(1).pdf\">लेखन कौशल्ये</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"fw-bold\">S.Y. B.Com &amp; SFC&nbsp;2025-2026-2027</h5>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">A.E.C. - <a title=\"कार्यालयीन लेखन कौशल्ये मराठी\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Sy-Bcom-AEC-Marathi-(1).pdf\">कार्यालयीन लेखन कौशल्ये मराठी</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"fw-bold\">S.Y.B.A. 2025-26-27&nbsp;</h5>\n<ul class=\"list-group bootstrap-list-color\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">Field Project - <a title=\"क्षेत्रभेट\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SY-Field-Project.pdf\">क्षेत्रभेट</a></li>\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">MAJOR &amp; MINOR -</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SEM III:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>१. कथनसाहित्य</li>\n<li>२. मुलाखत तंत्र आणि व्यावसायभिमुख लेखन</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SEM IV:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>३. चित्रपट रसास्वाद</li>\n<li>४. भाषा आणि बोली अभ्यास</li>\n</ul>\n<p>SYLLABUS LINK: <a title=\"MAJOR &amp; MINOR चित्रपट रसास्वाद, भाषा आणि बोली अभ्यास, मुलाखत तंत्र आणि व्यवसायभिमुख लेखन, कथन साहित्य\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SYBA-NEW-24-25.pdf\"> MAJOR &amp; MINOR चित्रपट रसास्वाद, भाषा आणि बोली अभ्यास, मुलाखत तंत्र आणि व्यवसायभिमुख लेखन, कथन साहित्य </a></p>\n<ul class=\"list-group bootstrap-list-color\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">V.S.C. - <a title=\"मुद्रितशोधन आणि संपादन, संकलन\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Sem-4-Nep-Syllebus-(3)-VSC-SEM-III.pdf\">मुद्रितशोधन आणि संपादन, संकलन</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 class=\"fw-bold\">T.Y.B.A. मराठी</h5>\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">TYBA 24-25 - <a title=\"SYLLABUS 24-25\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBA-SYLLABUS-24-25.pdf\">SYLLABUS 24-25</a></li>\n<li class=\"list-group-item\">TYBA 25-26-27 - <a title=\"SYLLABUS 25-26\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/TYBA_NEW_25-26.docx.pdf\">SYLLABUS 25-26</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>M.A. MARATHI SEM I AND II 2026-27<a title=\"MA MARATHI \" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/14QWB-nFpcgLw8VxIYAq_tsc32xzG2GQ4/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/14QWB-nFpcgLw8VxIYAq_tsc32xzG2GQ4/view?usp=sharing</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 275, '2026-04-25', 0),
