(1855, 88, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span>The Departmental Library of the Commerce Department serves as a significant academic resource, supporting the teaching, learning, and research needs of students and faculty. The Departmental library is a rich collection of textbooks, reference books, journals, project reports, and periodicals related to various fields of commerce, such as entrepreneurship, finance, marketing, management,human resources, etc. Students and faculty members are encouraged to utilize the departmental library for assignments, research projects, and exam preparation. Regular updates and new additions ensure that the library remains current with emerging trends and knowledge in the field of commerce.</span></p>', '0', 0, 1, '', 392, '2025-09-23', 0),
