(1873, 54, 47, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<h2>Entrepreneurship Development Cell (EDC)</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Entrepreneurship Development Cell (EDC) of Sathaye College was established in November 2020. Since its establishment, continuous efforts have been made to achieve its objectives and foster an entrepreneurial culture among students.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Various activities are organised by the EDC, including talks by influential personalities from industry, entrepreneurship workshops, business competitions and other skill-development programmes. Students are also encouraged to participate in intercollegiate business competitions and entrepreneurial activities. In addition, efforts are made to facilitate internship opportunities for students associated with the EDC.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">It is believed that students must be provided with opportunities to discover the entrepreneur within themselves and explore their potential. With this objective, markets and stall exhibitions have been organised on the college campus. As an extension of this initiative, a weekly Monday Market activity titled <strong>&ldquo;EDC Caf&eacute;&rdquo;</strong> has been introduced. Under this initiative, four groups of students are permitted to set up stalls between 9:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m. every Monday, subject to approval by the EDC team. Products and services can be offered to students and teachers of both the Degree and Junior College.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Through this activity, a sense of responsibility is developed among students, while opportunities are also created for them to establish and expand their professional and social networks. Hands-on experience is provided in areas such as marketing, market research, communication, product and service development, product design, accounting, customer acquisition and customer service.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Innovation becomes possible when creative ideas and effective solutions are identified. However, extensive research and access to appropriate facilities, technology and laboratories are required to transform these ideas into practical solutions. As a science college, Sathaye College has well-equipped basic laboratories. Recognising the need for advanced research facilities, a <strong>Central Research Facility (CRF)</strong> was established by the College in 2022. The CRF is equipped with instruments required for the characterisation of materials.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">A Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) has also been signed with our sister institution, <strong>PTVA&rsquo;s Institute of Management</strong>, for the formation of an Institution&rsquo;s Innovation Council (IIC) and for access to its incubation centre, the <strong>Centre for Entrepreneurship and Innovation (COEI)</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sathaye College is committed to handholding early-stage start-ups and supporting them in developing their products&mdash;from the idea stage to the funding stage. Through its EDC and in collaboration with the incubation centre, COEI, the College aims to provide the necessary resources, training, mentorship and investment opportunities required to transform innovative ideas into successful ventures.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(1874, 64, 47, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2020-21\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2020-21.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2020-21</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2021-22\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1786886224-EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2021-22.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2021-22</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2022-23\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1786886224-EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2022-23.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2022-23</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2023-24\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1786886223-EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2023-24.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2023-24</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2024-25\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1786886475-EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2024-25.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2024-25</a></p>\n<p><a title=\"EDC Activities Reports 2025-26\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1786886475-EDC-Activities-Reports-for-2025-26.pdf\">EDC Activities Reports 2025-26</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
