(1904, 89, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Plantae an intercollegiate event conducted on 19 and 20th December,&nbsp; 2023- 2024</b></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;Plantae, an intercollegiate event under Utsav 2023 was held by the Department of Botany on 19 th and 20 Dec 2023. In this events following&nbsp; programs were conducted&nbsp;</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Competitions: Flower arrangement, BioRangoli, Biojewellery, mobile photography, Quiz competition, Elocution and Essay competition.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Workshops: Gajra making and resin art</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Treasure hunt&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Games&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">More than 150 participants from were part of above competitions which is volunteered by more than 100 students&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The event was aimed at inculcating creativity, enthusiasm, inquisitiveness in participants together with generating a team spirit and group activities management amongst the volunteers of the event.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Many new ideas, skills and techniques in the respective sections of events were shared among participants coming from different colleges and streams as well. The students volunteers learnt and experienced event collaborations and coordinator with other volunteers and participants .&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eVpdcGxn6B5BKnbv_FYbD6DUV-qLho2c/view?usp=sharing\">Plantae Photo</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/index.php/&lt;https:/www.sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/plantae9.jpg&gt;\" alt=\"View image\" /></span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
