(1918, 90, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Graduates of the Department of Philosophy have pursued diverse academic and professional paths, demonstrating how philosophical training equips students with strong analytical, communication, and critical thinking skills. Many alumni have continued higher studies in fields such as <strong>Law, Management, Philosophy, and Tourism</strong>, while others are working across a range of professional sectors.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Sapna Sawant</strong> &ndash; Legal Consultant (LL.M.)</li>\n<li><strong>Ritisha Chavan (2020)</strong> &ndash; HR Executive at Saint Gobain; MBA (HR)</li>\n<li><strong>Aditya Abhyanakr (2021)</strong> &ndash; Tour Guide at Veena World; partner in family-owned tourism business (M.A. in Travel &amp; Tourism)</li>\n<li><strong>Sanskriti Sahni (2022)</strong> &ndash; HR/Admin at Sun Industrial Services, Nagpur; M.A. in Philosophy and pursuing MBA</li>\n<li><strong>Pujjal Sharatraj Poojari (2023)</strong> &ndash; Pursuing LL.B.; working as a private tutor</li>\n<li><strong>Punyashri Shetty (2023)</strong> &ndash; Pursuing MBA</li>\n<li><strong>Priyanka Bawale (2023)</strong> &ndash; Pursuing Animation; working in Administration at Vodafone, Goregaon</li>\n<li><strong>Sanika Kap (2023)</strong> &ndash; MBA in Marketing</li>\n<li><strong>Sakshi Limaye (2024)</strong> &ndash; Content Creation and Production Intern at Viral Fission; pursuing MBA</li>\n<li><strong>Kimaya Gonbare (2024)</strong> &ndash; Freelance Sports Photographer; M.A. in Philosophy</li>\n<li><strong>Sanjana Sathe (2024)</strong> &ndash; Sports Analyst at Hudl India, Goregaon</li>\n<li><strong>Riddhi Tamhankar (2024)</strong> &ndash; Pursuing MBA</li>\n<li><strong>Nishita Ghodinde (2024)</strong> &ndash; Cosmetologist at Ekta Beauty Salon, Goregaon (family-owned business)</li>\n<li><strong>Samruddhi Tapase (2024)</strong> &ndash; HR Executive at HGS Business Services Pvt. Ltd.; pursuing MBA (HR)</li>\n<li><strong>Nishant Anchan (2025)</strong> &ndash; Karate and Kickboxing Coach; Assistant Coach at Guru Harkishan High School and associated with Body Temple Yoga Studio; pursuing M.A. in Philosophy</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '0', 0, 1, '', 262, '2026-02-23', 0),
