(1926, 90, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IMG-20241026-WA0008.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IMG-20241026-WA0009.jpg\" width=\"400\" height=\"179\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>Our college hosted its Alumni Meet on 26<sup>th</sup> October, 2024 at the college campus, bringing together former students from various batches for a memorable day of reconnection and celebration. The event aimed to foster enduring ties between the alumni and their alma mater, while also providing a platform for networking, sharing achievements, and reliving cherished memories.</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 391, '2025-09-23', 0),
