>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2014</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MSc from Mumbai University</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing PhD in USA</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>9</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Aparna Venkateshwaran</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2014</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MS in Astrophysics at University of Glasgow</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Studied Astrophysics at Rheinische Friedrich-Wilhelms-Universitat Bonn</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Graduate assistant at Max Plank Institute for Radio Astronomy</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>10</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Tanvi Doiphode</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2015</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MSc from Mumbai University</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Teacher for Grade 11 and 12 in Abu Dhabi</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing PhD in education from Manipal University, Malaysia</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>11</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Rahul Negi</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2015</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Topper at College for BSc Exam</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PGDP in packaging from IIP, Mumbai</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Working as a Senior packaging technologist at Bizongo</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>12</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Rohit Tiwari</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2015</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Worked in Central Armed Police Force</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Now works in Forensic Department</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>13</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Khan Marufa</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2016</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B.Sc., B.Ed.</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Currently pursuing M.A. (Edu.)</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Works as a teacher</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>14</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Nikita. H. Manore</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2016</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PGD in on RFID and Integration with Automation System</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; M.Sc. Physics</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>15</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Trunali Shah</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2017</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing for Ph.D. in Physics (Space physics) At Indian Institute of Geomagnetism (IIGM), Khandeshwar, Mumbai.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>16</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Shweta Ashok Yadav</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2017</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; M. Sc.</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing B. Ed.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>17</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Faraz Sharif</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2018</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Topper at college in BSc Exam</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; PGDP in packaging from IIP, Mumbai</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>18</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Akash Suryawanshi</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2018</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; M.Sc. Physics</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing Research in Material Science</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>19</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Mayuresh Kanagal</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2020</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Topper at college in BSc Exam</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Recipient of Scientific and Research Aptitude Prize, Sathaye College</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing M. Sc. In Physics</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>20</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Vinit Pawaskar</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2020</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing MSc in University of Mumbai</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing BSc in Programming and Data Science (IIT Madras)</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Working on project in Computational Astronomy</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>21</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Vaibhav Dhage</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2021</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Topper in college at BSc Exam</p>\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing MSc in RJ College in Computational Mathematics</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>22</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Bhushan Kharare</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2021</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>&bull;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing Masters (Data Science)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>23</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Mayuresh Kanagal</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2020</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>Pursuing PhD in Tata Institute of Fundamental Research (TIFR) from August 2023</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>24</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Vinit Pawaskar</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2020</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>Stood first in PG diploma in Data Science at C-DAC Pune now working at C-DAC Banglore</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>25</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Malvika Naik</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2022</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Topper of BSc in physics</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Pursuing M.Sc. in astrophysics</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Master\'s Research on modified gravity and quasi-normal modes</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>26</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Gargi Lokegaonkar</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2023</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>Pursuing MSc astrophysics from KU Leuven, Belgium</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>27</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Swarangee Saraf</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2023</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>Pursuing MSc from University of Bonn, Germany</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>28</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Jugat Shringare</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2024</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>Pursuing Masters in Advanced Engineering Materials, University of Manchester, England</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\" width=\"84\">\n<p>29</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\" width=\"151\">\n<p>Malvika Naik</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\" width=\"57\">\n<p>2024</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\" width=\"397\">\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Worked as a Science Educator in Science Laboratory at Nehru Planetarium, Mumbai</p>\n<p>●&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2nd Prize winner of IAPT\'S National Photo Essay Competition in Physics on topic &lsquo;Black hole soft hairs&rsquo;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\">\n<p>&nbsp;30</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\">\n<p>Ayush Shenoy&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\">\n<p>2024&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><a style=\"color: #236fa1;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dbv4dhboXNz/?igsh=OWxjNnZxZjBpcnZl\">https://www.instagram.com/p/Dbv4dhboXNz/?igsh=OWxjNnZxZjBpcnZl</a></span></p>\n<p>Congratulations to our Ex-B.Sc. Physics student, Ayush Shenoy, on securing admission to the Ph.D. programme at S. N. Bose National Centre for Basic Sciences, Kolkata, after successfully clearing JEST and the institute&rsquo;s interview. He will be working in Theoretical Condensed Matter Physics under the guidance of Dr. Arijit Haldar.</p>\n<p>Earlier, he completed his M.Sc. Physics at Savitribai Phule Pune University, specializing in Advanced Quantum Mechanics, and carried out a research project at IISER Pune under Prof. Prasenjit Ghosh.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 80px;\">\n<p>32</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 148px;\">\n<p>Kajol Paithankar</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 55px;\">\n<p>2014</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 392px;\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><a style=\"color: #236fa1;\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C-TIYa-tCrS/?igsh=MXZ5cWF1bXdjdTBldA==\">https://www.instagram.com/p/C-TIYa-tCrS/?igsh=MXZ5cWF1bXdjdTBldA==</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">After graduation from Sathaye Colege, Kajol pursued M.Sc. Physics fromMumbai University. During the course she realised her passion about Mathematical Physics. After M.Sc. she got an opportunity to work as a project assistant. Working on a research problem boosted her confidence. Later she cleared entrance exams like GATE with rank 121, JEST with rank 122 and CSIR-UGC NET JRF with rank 139!&nbsp;<br />Now she is currently persuing PhD at Indian Institute of Astrophysics, Bengaluru where she is a part of Theory group and she is woring in teh field of black hole physics.</span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2026-08-14', 0),
