(1980, 91, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<h3 class=\"LC20lb MBeuO DKV0Md\" data-sider-select-id=\"78379fa5-265b-4739-b016-c7a091a78967\" style=\"line-height: 1.3;\">C<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">areers in Botany</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">After completing BSc. degree, one can get employed in non-scientific sectors in addition to scientific sectors.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">After graduation, students can find a lot of career opportunities in both the public&nbsp; and private sectors</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">After completing graduation, students can appear for various competitive examinations like Indian forest services and Indian administrative services conducted by UPSC/MPSC.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students can also go for higher education courses like M.Sc. in Botany, Biotechnology, etc.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students can obtain specializations in plant breeding, plant pathology, agronomy, and horticulture</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Teaching field of botany is a very challenging and rewarding career opportunity for botany students.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students can also choose fields like an ecologist, taxonomist, conservationist, and forest department as forester.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">After completing the course, students can join marketing or administration of plant-related industries like pharmaceutical companies, seed companies, biotechnology firms biological supply houses, etc.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Botanists can also choose careers in herbariums, botanical gardens, and sanctuaries.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students who have an interest in chemistry subject may become plant physiologists, plant biochemists, molecular biologists, or chemotaxonomies.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students who have interests in cryptogams can also choose biotechnology, biochemistry, mycology, and phycology.</span></li>\n<li style=\"line-height: 1.3;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Students can seek out careers in research laboratories, Government corporations, the banking and finance sector, and so on. Apart from this, science graduates can also find jobs in IT industry, business, BPO, marketing, technical writing, and so on.</span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
