(2038, 94, 19, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Research by Faculty Members</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dr. Pratibha S. Kamble Head of the Department of Economics </strong></p>\n<p><strong>List of Publications </strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\"Paid and Unpaid Work of Dalit Women in Mumbai and Pune\" in proceeding of international on changing contours of women\'s paid and unpaid work held on 12-13th July, 2018 jointly organize by School of Management and Labour Studies and School of Development Studies, Tata Institute of Social Science, Mumbai.</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Government Policies for Development of Women Entrepreneurship&rdquo; in proceeding of International Conference on Opportunities and Challenges for Women Entrepreneurship in India by&nbsp; Rishabh Publishing House ,Mumbai, pp.164-168, ISBN 978-93-83072-43-9, August 2014.</li>\n<li>B.R.Ambedkar&rsquo;s Thoughts on Collective Farming and Its Relevance to current farming in India, in proceeding of International UGC sponsored Conference on The Theories of Identity in Human Rights and Dr.B.R.Ambedkar&rsquo;s Thoughts, Adhar Publication, Amravati, ISBN 978-82588-06-1, 2013. pp-466-468.</li>\n<li>Babasaheb Ambedkars Thoughts on Agriculture its relvance in contemporary Indian economy with respect to marathwad.</li>\n<li>Government Policies For Development of Women Entrepreneurship Dalit Entrepreneurs: Their Inclusion in Main Stream Economy.</li>\n<li>Opportunities and Challenges for Women Entrepreneurs in India.</li>\n<li>Marginalization and The Politics of Identity: Issue and Challenges.</li>\n<li>Changing contours of women&rsquo;s paid and unpaid work.</li>\n<li>Comparative Analysis of Agriculture trade in Maharashtra and Gujrat, Madhya Bharti &ndash;Humanities and Social Science, ISSN- 0947-0066.</li>\n<li>The role of Microfinance, institutions and empowering women entrepreneurship in India, Shodhsamhita, ISSN- 2277-7067.</li>\n<li>The evualation of economic implicationof renewable energyadoptation in India&rsquo;s Energy Sector, Madhya Bharti, ISSN 0974-0066.</li>\n<li>B. R Ambedkar views towards farmer and their economy, The Journal of Oriental research madras, ISSN-022-3301.</li>\n<li>The influence of financial development and governance quality on entrepreneurship and economic inequalities, Shodhsamhta, ISSN - 2277-7067</li>\n<li>Drinking water and rest room facilities in HP university, Shimla campus,&nbsp;International Journal of Research.<br />ISSN 2231-6124,Vol 5(2), Jan-Jun 2016, Impact factor : 4.001.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Research Paper Presentation</strong></p>\n<p><strong>INTERNATIONAL</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>&ldquo;Government Policies for Development of Women Entrepreneurship&rdquo; at Gandhi Shikshan Bhavan&rsquo;s, Smt. Surajba College of Education, Juhu, Mumbai on the One Day International Conference on Opportunities and Challenges for Women Entrepreneurship in India&nbsp; on 23<sup> </sup>August 2014.</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Dr. B.R.Ambedkar&rsquo;s Thoughts on Collective Farming and Its Relevance to current Farming in India&rdquo; at Ramkrushna Mahavidyalaya, Darapur, Amravati on the two day Interdisciplinary International Conference on&nbsp; on The Theories of Identity in Human Rights and Dr.B.R.Ambedkar&rsquo;s Thoughts held on 11-12 January 2013.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; NATIONAL</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Presented \"Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Thoughts on Agriculture and its Relevance in contemporary Indian Economy\" at University of Mumbai during the Mahatma Jyotirao phule and Bharatratna held on 13th April, 2018.</li>\n<li>Presented \"Dr. B. R. Ambedkar and Dalit Feminism\" at University of Mumbai during Mahatma Jyotirao Phule and Bharatratna, Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Jayanti Saptah Symposium on Emancipation of Women held on 13th April, 2017.</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Dalit Entrepeneurs : Their Inclusion in Main Stream Economy&rdquo; at Kirti M.D.College, Dadar, Mumbai on One-Day Interdisciplinary National Conference on Marginalization and the Politics of Identity: Issues and Challenges&rdquo; held on 10 February 2015.</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Does Social Media Promote Changes for Eunuchs&rdquo; at Ramniranjan Jhunjhunwala College, Ghatkopar, Mumbai on the two day national seminar on Voices of the Marginalized on 17-18 January 2013.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Research Project</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Kamble has contributed significantly to research. She was awarded a Minor Research Project by the Babasaheb Ambedkar Research and Training Institute (BARTI), Pune.</li>\n<li>She has also been associated with important research projects at Tata Institute of Social Sciences and the University of Mumbai. Her areas of research interest include Dalit Entrepreneurship, Agricultural Economics, Gender Studies, and Inclusive Economic Development.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Attended Seminar, Conference and Workshop</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Participated in the One Day Workshop on the 21st Aavishkar Inter Collegiate/Institute/Department Research Convention 2026&ndash;27, organised by the University of Mumbai on 22 July 2026.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Attended the Seminar On &lsquo;Recent Techniques In Applied Statistics&rsquo; Held On Department Of Statistics, University Of Mumbai On 5 March 2016.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Participated in the two day Zonal Workshop on &ldquo;Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace Act 2013, and related issues jointly organized by Women Development Cell, University of Mumbai and K.P.B. Hinduja College of Commerce on 7-8 September 2015.</li>\n<li>Participated as the Discussant in the International conference on &ldquo;Critical Race Theory and Critical Dalit Studies: Understating Segregation. Exclusion Intersectionality and the Narratives of Struggle&rdquo; organized by Dr.Ambedkar Centre for Social Justice, Phule-Ambedkar Chair, University of Mumbai and Indiana University, USA on 25-26 June 2015.</li>\n<li>Participated in the Seminar on &ldquo;Status of Social Science Research in Western India: Critical Engagement and Future Direction&rdquo; from 14-16 November, 2014.</li>\n<li>Participated in the Two-Day Workshop on &ldquo;Capacity Building on Gender Sensitization&rdquo; focusing on violence against Women, organized by Women Development Cell, University of Mumbai on 12 and 13 July 2013.</li>\n<li>Participated in two days conference on &ldquo;Wealth of India&rdquo; organized by NISSECT at Town Hall, Thane on 23 and 24 March, 2013.</li>\n<li>Participated in the National seminar organized by the IQAC of R.A.Podar College of Commerce and Economics on 7-8 September, 2012.</li>\n<li>Attended Census 2011 data dissemination workshop conducted by SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Santacruz, Mumbai on 25 March, 2013.</li>\n<li>Worked as Organizing Committee Member and attended the lecture by Helen Pennant, Director, Cambridge Commonwealth, European and International Trust, on the University of Cambridge via The Cambridge Trust: Scholarship Opportunities at Department of History, University of Mumbai on 15 September 2015.</li>\n<li>Worked as Organizing Committee Member of UGC sponsored One Day National Conference organised by Department of Political Science, Economics, Geography and Sociology, at Sathaye College, Mumbai on Contemporary Debate on Urbanization, on 5 August, 2015<strong>.</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Mr. O. I. Vasave (Assistant Professor)</strong></p>\n<p><strong>List of Publications</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>आर्थिक साक्षरतेसाठी आदिवासी महिलांचे सक्षमीकरण : संधी आणि आव्हाने RESEARCH JOURNEY&rsquo; International E- Research Journal, Vol. 13, Issue -1 : Multidisciplinary Issue, Impact Factor : 6.625 (SJIF), Peer Reviewed Journal &nbsp; &nbsp;E-ISSN : &nbsp; &nbsp;2348-7143 Jan.-March 2026</li>\n<li>आदिवासी महिलांचा कृषी कार्यातील सहभागाचा अभ्यास : विशेष संदर्भ नंदुरबार जिल्हा, : Shikshan Sanshodhan, ISSN (0) 2581- 6241 Publish in Volume 7 Issue 12 December 2024</li>\n<li>Opportunities and challenges of Agro-tourism in India, &lsquo; Research Journy&rsquo; International E-Research Journal E-ISSN 2348-7143&nbsp; Year 2024-25 (Published 22.11.2024)</li>\n<li>Impact of Globalization on India&rsquo;s Agriculture<br />International Research Fellows Association&rsquo;s RESEARCH JOURNEY, International E-Research Journal, E-ISSN : 2348-7143 February - 2024</li>\n<li>आदिवासी महिला आणि कृषी क्षेत्रातील योगदान An International Multidisciplinary Half Yearly Research Journal IDEAL ISSN 2319 - 359X September - February 2023 - 24</li>\n<li>Opportunities and challenges of Agro-tourism in India International Journal of Commerce and Economics Volume 6 Issue 4, 2024 Page No. 6-8 ISSN 2664-7540, 22- November -2024</li>\n<li>आदिवासी समाजातील महिलांचा सामाजिक व आर्थिक समस्यांचा अभ्यास An International Multidisciplinary Quarterly Research Journal AJANTA ISSN 2277 - 5730 October - December 2023</li>\n<li>आदिवासी समाजातील महिलांचा सामाजिक आणि आर्थिक समस्यांचा अभ्यास published in an international multi disciplinary quarterly resar journal issn Volume XII, 2023</li>\n<li>Globalization and its Impact on Tribal, Vidyavarta International Journal, Special Issue, ISSN -2319-9318, Oct. To Dec. 2021</li>\n<li>Dr. Babasaheb Ambelkar thoughts and Indian government policies on economic empowerment of Indian women and their outcome in the present context, &lsquo;RESEARCH JOURNY&rsquo; International Multidisciplinary E- Research Journal, Page Nos. 12-16, Special Issue &ndash; 235 (D),&nbsp; ISBN2348-7143, February 2020,</li>\n<li>Issues in Indian Agriculture Marketing, Journal of Information and Computational Science, ISSN &ndash; 1548-7741, 2020</li>\n<li>आदिवासी समाजाच्या आर्थिक समस्या व काही उपाययोजना : एक अभ्यास Current Global Reviewer, Page No. 82-85,&nbsp; ISSN/ISBN No.2319-8648, 10 February 2018</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;Paper Presentation</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Issues in Indian Agriculture Marketing, Journal of Information and Computational Science, ISSN &ndash; 1548-7741, 2020</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Attended Seminar, Conference and Workshop</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Attended National Conference on &ldquo;Emerging Trends in Mathematics, Statistics and Applications&rdquo; on 28th April 2026 (10.30 a.m. to 4.30 p.m.) organized by the Departments of Mathematics &amp; Statistics of N.S.S. College of Commerce &amp; Economics, Mumbai and Sheth NKTT College, Thane, Maharashtra. We appreciate her active participation.</li>\n<li>Participated in the One-Day National E-Conference on &lsquo;Global Challenges and Multidisciplinary Approaches in the Contemporary World&rsquo; (GCMACW 2026), organized by Dr. Shantilal Dhanji Devsey Arts, Commerce and Science College, Wada, Palghar, on 15th April 2026.</li>\n<li>Participated in Faculty Development Programme on \'Flipped Learning\' organized by Sathaye College (Autonomous) from 16th January to 6th March, 2025.</li>\n<li>Participated in one day state level conference on \"Intellectual Property Rights\" organised by Internal Quality Assurance Cell PTVA\'S Sathaye College</li>\n<li>Participated in the National seminar on \"Tribes in transition: Issues and Challenges in the Era of Globalisation organised by the department of Sociology University of Mumbai vidyanagari Santacruz East MumbaI on 19th and 20th&nbsp; January 2017.</li>\n<li>Worked as Organizing Committee Member of UGC sponsored One Day National Conference organised by Department of Political Science, Economics, Geography and Sociology, at Sathaye College, Mumbai on Contemporary Debate on Urbanization, on 5 August, 2015.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Ms. Mahima Solanki</p>\n<ol>\n<li>&nbsp;National Backward Classes Finance and Development Corporation - A Step For the Upliftment of Backward Classes (Nashik) - Presented a paper at a One day National Conference on &ldquo;Recent Researches: Trends, Theories, Application And Social Relevance&rdquo;, sponsored by RUSA (2023)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Field Project : Department of Economics Students&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1R0bUyB4puCfa8ynibFrWVz6WGgsuykBd/view?usp=sharinghttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1R0bUyB4puCfa8ynibFrWVz6WGgsuykBd/view?usp=sharing\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\">Field Project 2024-25</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cljN5BDq5uJrll5LlNmSL4HUAi_Bp49i/view?usp=sharing\">Field Project 2025-26</a></span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 248, '2026-08-13', 0),
