(2259, 96, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Workshops &amp; Training Programmes<br />One day National online workshop on &lsquo;Blended Learning&rsquo; organized by Department of<br />Educational Technology SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai.<br />Attended national workshops on E-Content Development, focusing on the creation of digital<br />learning resources and instructional materials.<br />Participated in workshops on experiential teaching and innovative pedagogical tools,<br />enhancing classroom engagement strategies.<br />Completed training on Google Forms and online assessment tools, enabling efficient<br />evaluation practices.<br />Attended workshops on school psychology, life skills, mental health, and well-being,<br />supporting holistic student development.</p>\r\n<p>E. Webinars &amp; Seminar Participation<br />Participated in numerous national and international webinars on themes such as:<br />o Dynamics of Online Education: Policy and Practice<br />o Post-COVID Educational Transformation and Future of Higher Education<br />o Challenges and Opportunities in Teacher Education<br />o Environmental Sustainability and Education</p>\r\n<p>Engaged in a webinar series on knowledge generation and qualitative education research, enhancing research orientation.<br />Attended sessions on academic writing, research paper publication, and emerging<br />educational trends.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 254, '2025-09-23', 0),
