(2300, 71, 258, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Educational Qualification: BA, MA NET in Geography, B Ed, M Ed, MPhil NET in Education, PhD pursuing</li>\n<li>Teaching Experience: 11 Years UG (Geography, NSS Studies and Environmental Studies), 4 Years D. Ed. / B Ed (Geography, Environmental Education, Child and Experimental Psychology, Educational Evaluation, Educational Technology and Educational Management), 5 Years CBSE, ICSE and IB School (Social Studies).</li>\n<li>Research: Worked for International Project as Research Assistant, Cartographic Work, and Principal Investigator of 2 Minor Research Projects funded by University of Mumbai and ICSSR.</li>\n<li>Published Chapters in 9 Books, Published 11 Research Papers in UGC care listed and peer reviewed journals at national and international level.</li>\n<li>Conducted many workshops on Modern Surveying Techniques, Environment Awareness and Conservation Techniques, Travel and Tourism Management as well as Alternative Strategies and Techniques of Teaching Geography.</li>\n<li>Attended many orientation programmes, workshops, seminars and conferences as well as invited as a resource person for orientation programmes, workshops, seminars and conferences. Also actively participated as an organizer of conferences and editor of research journal publication.</li>\n<li>Completed 3 capacity building training offline programs (Winter Schools) of DST-IGET and NMRMS, Government of India, 2 Refresher and 1 Orientation Program of UGC as well as online 16 Courses from IIRS, ISRO Dehradun related to Geospatial Technology (GIS, GPS and RST).</li>\n<li>Specialization and Working as a Consultant of Digital Cartography, Data Analysis and Research Activities. Also Governing Body Member of BGA, Life Member of INCA and AVEHI etc.</li>\n<li>Working as a NSS program officer and organized many activities of social and environment awareness.</li>\n<li>Working as Assistant Professor and Head, Department of Geography, Sathaye College, Vile Parle, Mumbai &ndash; 400057</li>\n<li>Appointed as a Chairperson, Board of Studies in Geography and EVS, Sathaye College and Member of Board of Studies in 4 Autonomous Colleges as well as member of syllabus committees in University of Mumbai.</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 258, '2025-09-23', 0),
