(2327, 73, 260, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Administrative Responsibilities</p>\n<p>As Assistant Professor, Mr. Awhad has been entrusted with various administrative duties, some of his key responsibilities include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In-charge, Drama Association for Degree College</li>\n<li>Secretary, Board of Studies for Geography at Sathaye College (Autonomous)</li>\n<li>Joint Secretary, National Institutional Ranking Framework Committee</li>\n<li>Member of Examination Department, Degree College</li>\n<li>Member of Career Guidance and Placement Cell</li>\n<li>Member of Admission Committee</li>\n<li>Member of Discipline Committee</li>\n<li>Member of College Prospectus Committee</li>\n<li>Member of NAAC Criterion I</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 260, '2025-09-23', 0),
