(2355, 75, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Teaching experience:</p>\n<p>BA Philosophy: 5 years (in September 2024)- Sathaye College (Autonomous)</p>\n<p>MA Philosophy: Visiting faculty from 2018 onwards- Department of Philosophy (University of Mumbai)</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2356, 76, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Invited as Guest speaker on \"Masculinities: Philosophical Reflections\" in Ramanarain Ruia College on the occasion of World Philosophy Day on 21st November 2024.&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2357, 77, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Invited as guest speaker for a Workshop on &lsquo;Workplace relationships, Stress management and Time management&rsquo; conducted for non-teaching staff in Wilson College on 30th April 2022.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Conducted workshop on \"Ethics in Workplace\" for non-teaching staff of Sathaye college (Autonomous) on the 12th and 13th of March 2021.</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2358, 78, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Presented paper entitled \" Revisiting Gandhian Idea of \'diginity of labour\' in the context of gendered division of labour\" in National Conference on Rethinking Mahatma Gandhi in Present Context Organized by: Sonopant Dandekar Arts, V. S. Apte Commerce &amp; M. H. Mehta Science College Palghar on 29th February 2020.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Presented paper entitled \"Medical professional&rsquo;s duty to treat v/s right to refrain from treatment: &nbsp;<br />Kantian deontological approach in the context of pandemics\" in Institutional Research Conclave (MCC college) on 29th January 2022.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Presented paper entitled \"Simone de\' Beauvoir\" at the Research Conclave on Women thinkers organised by Department of Philosophy, University of Mumbai from 16th October 2023 to 23rd October 2023.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2359, 79, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2360, 80, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Research advisor to Ms. Kimaya Gonbare, SYBA Philosophy student (2022-23) who won second prize for the research topic \"Concept of choice from the perspective of Determinism, Fatalism and Existentialism\" in the Inter-Institutional Research Conclave held on 28<sup>th</sup> February 2023&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2361, 81, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Presented paper entitled \" Revisiting Gandhian Idea of \'diginity of labour\' in the context of gendered division of labour\" in National Conference on Rethinking Mahatma Gandhi in Present Context Organized by: Sonopant Dandekar Arts, V. S. Apte Commerce &amp; M. H. Mehta Science College Palghar on 29th February 2020.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Presented paper entitled \"Medical professional&rsquo;s duty to treat v/s right to refrain from treatment: &nbsp;<br />Kantian deontological approach in the context of pandemics\" in Institutional Research Conclave (MCC college) on 29th January 2022.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2362, 95, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\r\n<li>Two chapters entitled \"Aristotle and Post Aristotle\" and \"Medieval Philosophy\" in the University of Mumbai IDOL, Philosophy textbook in the year 2022-23</li>\r\n<li>Chapter entitled \"Logic\" in the Indian Knowledge System textbook published by Sathaye College (Autonomous) in the year 2024-25</li>\r\n<li>Research Paper on \'Gayatri Chakravorty Spivak&rsquo;s Critique of Western Feminism and its Implication for the study of subaltern masculinities\' in international Journal of Advance and Applied Research.Publisher: P.R. Talekar.Vol-5 Issue 43.Year of Publication: December 2024. ISSN: 2347-7075.Impact factor 8.141. Page nos:39-42.</li>\r\n<li>research paper on \'Philosophy in Indian Aesthetics: Rasa, Indian Knowledge System and Film Philosophy\' Akshara Multidisciplinary Research Journal.Chief Editor: Prof. (Dr.) Anil Singh Vol-IV (C), Special Issue: 17 Year of publication: March 2025. E-ISSN: 2582-5429. impact factor-5.711.Page nos: 110-114</li>\r\n<li>Editor of the Value education course Book entitled \'Good Citizen\' as part of FYBA NEP Curriculum in Sathaye College.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2363, 96, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Completed online workshop on \"Sramana Tradition: Explorations, Reinterpretations and Contemporray Articulations\" from 13th March-18th March 2023.</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2364, 97, 262, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Research paper titled \" Revisiting Gandhian Idea of \'diginity of labour\' has been included in the conference proceedings in UGC CARE listed Journal Our Heritage (Arts &amp; Humanities Sr. No. 188)/ अक्षर वाङमय (Arts &amp; Humanities Sr. No. 03) organised on 29th February 2020.</li>\n<li>Research paper titled \"Therigatha: A feminist account of women&rsquo;s spiritual experience in Buddhism\" published in Bodhi International Journal of Research in Humanities, Arts and Science Vol.7 October 2022. E-ISSN 2456-5571</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2025-09-23', 0),
