(2537, 75, 276, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Teaching for the last 35 Years subject such as Financial Accounting, Cost Accounting, Management Accounting, Direct Taxes, Indirect Taxes, Financial Reporting&nbsp; for UG &amp; PG Students. Research Guide for PhD students for last 6 years.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 276, '2025-09-23', 0),
