(2636, 96, 283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1) April 5th, 2021 &ndash; April 10th, 2021: Participated as a participant in six days online workshop on<br />&ldquo;Research Methodology&rdquo; organised by C. K. Thakur A., C. and S. College, New Panvel.<br />2) May 29th, 2020: Participated as a participant in the international faculty development workshop<br />on &ldquo;E- Learning and Tools for Effective Teaching and Learning&rdquo; organised by Janvikas<br />Mandal&rsquo;s Degree College, Airoli.<br />3) May 4th, - May 10th, 2020: Participated as a participant in Online Seven Day National Workshop<br />on &ldquo;Research Methods and Techniques&rsquo;&rsquo; organised by Ramanand Arya D.A.V. College in<br />association with the University of Mumbai.<br />4) April 30th, - May 2nd, 2020: Participated as a participant in the three day national level Faculty<br />Development Program organised by BMM &amp; BAMMC department of Lala Lajpat Rai College of<br />Commerce &amp; Economics and University of Mumbai with North Strom Academy.<br />5) March 08th, 2019: Participated as a participant in One Day Intercollegiate Workshop on &ldquo;Health<br />Awareness and Women&rsquo;s Safety&rdquo; organized by Women Development Cell, B. N. N. College,<br />Bhiwandi.<br />6) October 06th, 2018: Participated as a participant in One Day National Workshop on &ldquo;Research<br />in Commerce and Management&rdquo; organized by department of Commerce, C. K. Thakur A., C.<br />and S. College, New Panvel.<br />7) May 10th, 2018: Participated as a participant in one day workshop on &ldquo;Revised Syllabus of T. Y.<br />B. Com. &ndash; Financial Accounting &amp; Auditing Semester V and VI&rdquo; organized by C. K. Thakur A. C. and S. College, New Panvel in Collaboration with Boatd of Studies &ndash; in- Accountancy,<br />University of Mumbai.<br />8) September 23rd and 24th, 2016: Participated as a participant in workshop on &ldquo;Empowerment<br />of Girls: Challenges of 21st Century&rdquo; organized by Women Development Cell, B. N. N.<br />College, Bhiwandi.<br />9) February 04th, 2016: Participated as a participant in workshop on &ldquo;Faculty Development<br />Programme&rdquo; organized by Dr Babasaheb Ambedkar School of Thoughts (BAST), University of<br />Mumbai, Kalina campus, Mumbai.<br />10) July 27th &amp; 28th, 2013: Participated as a participant in workshop on &ldquo;Accounting Software&rdquo;<br />organized by C. K. Thakur A., C. and S. College, New Panvel.&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 283, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2637, 97, 283, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>National &amp; Internaional - 13</p>\n<p>UGC CARE- 07</p>\n<p>UGC Peer Review- 06</p>\n<p>1) 2023: &ldquo;FINANCIAL PERFORMANCE OF MUNICIPAL FINANCE IN MAHARASHTRA: A<br />CASE STUDY OF KALYANDOMBIVLI MUNICIPAL CORPORATION Paper published in<br />UGC Care listed journal, Utkal Historical Research Journal UGC Care Approved, Peer Reviewed<br />and Referred Journal Vol.-36, No.1(III) 2023 (ISSN: 0976-2132)<br />2) June 2022 : &ldquo;PERFORMANCE EVALUATION OF WATER SERVICES DEPARTMENT<br />OFKALYAN DOMBIVLI MUNICIPAL CORPORATION&rdquo; Paper published in UGC Care listed<br />journal &ldquo;JOURNAL OF MANAGEMENT &amp; ENTREPRENEURSHIP volume 16 number 2<br />(IX)&rdquo; (ISSN : 2229-5348)<br />3) April, 11th , 2020 : Paper Presented on &ldquo;Financial Performance of Water Services<br />Department Of Kalyan &ndash; Dombivil Municipal Corporation&rdquo; In One Day Multidisciplinary<br />International Conference organized by IQAC of A. E. Kalsekar Degree College, Kausa, Thane.<br />Paper published in UGC Care listed journal &ldquo;Shodh Sanchar Bulletin published in Volume 10,<br />Issue 39: July - September 2020.&rdquo; (ISSN : 2229-3620)<br />4) March, 23rd, 2019: Paper published and Presented on &ldquo;Umbilical Cord Stem Cells<br />Preservation: A Boon of Healthy Lifespan&rdquo; &ndash; Lets create awareness! In One Day</p>\n<p>Multidisciplinary International Conference organized by IQAC of A. E. Kalsekar Degree<br />College, Kausa, Thane. (I. F.:7.36, ISSN No.: 2394-7780)<br />5) October 15th, 2016: Paper published and Presented on &ldquo;Virtual Markets: Digitalization and<br />Shift in Marketing Strategies in India&rdquo; in National Conference organized by B. N. N. College,<br />Bhiwandi. (I. F.:3.012, ISSN No.: 2348-1390)<br />6) February 17th, 2016: Paper published and Presented on &ldquo;Indian Education and Corporate<br />Social Responsibility&rdquo; in National Conference Sponsored by UGC organized by Department of<br />Accountancy, Pragati College of Arts &amp; Commerce, Dombivli (E). (I. F.:3.012, ISSN No.: 2348-<br />1390)<br />7) August 22nd &amp; 23th, 2013: Paper published and Presented on &ldquo;Case Study of Successful<br />Entrepreneurs in India&rdquo; in National Conference Sponsored by UGC organized by K. M.<br />Agrwal College A., C. &amp; S., Kalyan. (ISBN NO.: 81- 89217-08-9) (Women Entrepreneurs in<br />India Role and Challenges Ahead).&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 283, '2025-09-23', 0),
