(2750, 80, 292, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Seven students have been working from 2021 to date</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pooja P. Batawale</strong>, Synthesis and Characterization of Novel Schiff Base Complexes with Some Transition Metal Ions by Using Green Principles for Their Anti-Microbial Properties, from 2021. [ Final Synopsis Submitted June <strong>2026</strong> ]</p>\n<p><strong>Sushil Kumar Singh</strong>, Identification, Characterization, Validation of Reverse Phase Stability Indicating HPLC method for the determination of impurities and genotoxic impurities from some pharmaceutical bulk drugs (API) by using different modern analytical techniques from 2022. [ Final Synopsis Submitted, <strong>June, 2026]</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Priyanka S. Thakur</strong>, Synthesis, spectral studies of some transition metal ion complexes with nanosized organometallic Schiff bases and its antimicrobial studies from 2022. [ Final Synopsis Submitted June <strong>2026</strong> ]</p>\n<p><strong>Manisha G. Kapade</strong>, Synthesis, Spectral Studies, Characterization of Nanosized Schiff Base Complexes with Some Transition Metal Ions and their Anti-Microbial Studies from 2022. [Final Synopsis Submitted, June <strong>2026]</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Priyanka R. Kokate</strong>, Green synthesis, spectral, and antimicrobial studies of metallic nanoparticles mediated by some medicinal plant extracts and their catalytic properties from 2022. [ Final Synopsis Submitted June 2026 ]</p>\n<p><strong>Amol S. Gaikwad, </strong>Novel Analytical Method Development and Validation of Assay and Organic Impurity of Some of the Drugs in Pharmaceutical Dosage Forms by Using Modern Analytical Techniques From 2024</p>\n<p><strong>Uttara M Dalvi, S</strong>ynthesis, Spectral Analysis and Characterization of Nanosized Metal-Ligand Complexes for Their Biological Studies, from 2024.&rdquo;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 292, '2025-09-23', 0),
