(2794, 71, 296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Recognized Research Guide for M.Sc and Ph. D of University of Mumbai for the subject of Chemistry</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Worked as Assistant Coordinator for IGNOU Study Centre 1603 for 6 years</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Associated with National Testing Agency (NTA) in the capacity of observer for various entrance examinations (NEET, UGC/ CSIR - NET, UG-CET)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Worked as Panelist on Interview Panel of TISS for PG Course MHR and LM selections</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Invited as Resource person for Workshops on Intellectual Property Rights at Various Colleges in Mumbai region, Dapoli and University of Mumbai Ratnagiri Sub-centre</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Invited as Resource person for Workshop on Research Methodology at Institute of Science, Fort</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Invited as Resource person at UGC- Staff Academic College, University of Mumbai, For Refresher Courses in Chemistry 2014</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Invited as Resource person at UGC- Staff Academic College, University of Mumbai, For Refresher Courses in Chemistry 2010</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Qualified SET Examination conducted by University of Pune, September 2009</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Awarded S.R.F(Senior Research Fellowship) of UGC under UPE programme for Meritorious student in Sciences. (Green Technology from April 2011 to March 2012)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Awarded J.R.F(Junior Research Fellowship) of UGC under UPE programme for Meritorious student in Sciences (Green Technology Period :- From April 2009 to March 2011)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Awarded D.R.F(Departmental Research Fellowship) of Chemistry Department for the</strong> <strong>period of April 2008 to March 2009</strong></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 296, '2025-09-23', 0),
