(2800, 78, 296, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Synthesis and application of ionic liquid crystalline materials :green environmentalapproach Patkar College GoregaonJnan Vikas Mandal&rsquo;s Degree College</li>\n<li>Poster presentation on \"Comparative&nbsp;studies&nbsp;of steroidal derivatives&nbsp;exhibiting mesomorphism&nbsp;\" at&nbsp;International conference On New Horizons in Synthetic and Materials Chemistry-2015 (ICSMC-2015) 26th-28th November-2015, University of Mumbai, Mumbai.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Design and Synthesis of Ferrocenomesogens and Evaluation of them for Mesomorphic Behavior&rdquo; at International conference on New Horizons in Chemistry (ISNHC-2014) organized by VES College, Chembur, Mumbai-400071 from 8-9 December-2014</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Synthesis Of Fluorine containing Ionic Liquid Crystals&rdquo; at International conference on New Horizons in Chemistry (ISNHC-2014) organized by VES College, Chembur, Mumbai-400071 from 8-9 December-2014</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Preparation of Nilutamide and Triethylenemelamine by N-arylation&rdquo; at International conference on New Horizons in Chemistry (ISNHC-2014) organized by VES College, Chembur, Mumbai-400071 from 8-9 December-2014</li>\n<li>Presented a paper titled &ldquo;Design and Synthesis of Novel Ferrocenomesogens and Evaluation of Structural Differences for Mesomorphic Behavior&rdquo; at National Conference on Advances in Synthetic and Materials Chemistry 10/3/2014 and 11/3/2014 at Department of Chemistry , University of Mumbai.</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Synthesis of a novel ferrocenomesogen\" at &ldquo;19<sup>th</sup> National Conference on Liquid Crystals&rdquo; (19<sup>th</sup> NCLC) at Thapar University, Patiala, Punjab from 21<sup>st</sup> -23<sup>rd</sup> November 2012. [Poster No. 17]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Synthesis of a novel organ fluorine liquid crystalline compounds\" at &ldquo;19<sup>th</sup> National Conference on Liquid Crystals&rdquo; (19<sup>th</sup> NCLC) at Thapar University, Patiala, Punjab from 21<sup>st</sup> -23<sup>rd</sup> November 2012. [Poster No. 18]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Synthesis, characterization and evaluation of cholesteryl ester of &alpha;-amino acid for liquid crystalline property.\" at &ldquo;19<sup>th</sup> National Conference on Liquid Crystals&rdquo; (19<sup>th</sup> NCLC) at Thapar University, Patiala, Punjab from 21<sup>st</sup> -23<sup>rd</sup> November 2012. [Poster No. 90]</li>\n<li>&ldquo;Synthesis of a new and novel ferrocenomesogen\" at 18<sup>th</sup> National Conference on Liquid Crystals&rdquo; (18<sup>th</sup> NCLC) at NERIST, Itanagar, Arunachal Pradesh from 15<sup>th</sup> -17<sup>th</sup> November 2011.</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 296, '2025-09-23', 0),
