(2816, 81, 297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1.&nbsp;National conference on &ldquo;Frontiers of research in Chemistry(FRC-2013)&rdquo; by Department of Chemistry, Sadguru Gadage Maharaj Collge, on 26<sup>th</sup> and 27<sup>th</sup> December 2013.(Oral presentation).</p>\n<p>2. Seminar on &ldquo;Energy Options for India: Non-conventional sources of energy&rdquo; held at Mithibai College , Vile Parle (W), Mumbai in association with Chemical Research society of India (Mumbai Chapter) on 23<sup>rd</sup> August 2014.</p>\n<p>3. International Symposium on &ldquo;New horizons in Chemistry&rdquo; held at Department of chemistry, Vivekanand education societys College of Arts, Science and Commerce, Chembur on 8<sup>th</sup> -9<sup>th</sup> December 2014.</p>\n<p>4. &ldquo;27th Research Scholars Meet-2015(RSM-2015)&rdquo; jointly organized by Indian Chemical Society (Mumbai Branch) and Parle Tilak Vidyalaya associations , Sathaye College, Vile parle(E) , Mumbai on 20<sup>th</sup> -21<sup>st</sup> February 2015.(Member of Organizing Committee).</p>\n<p>5. International conference on advances in functional materials (ICAFM-2018) organized by Department of Physics, Electronic Science and Chemistry, KTHM College, Nashik In association with Savitribai Phule Pune University, Pune (poster Presentation) on 12-13 January 2018.</p>\n<p>6. International conference on Challenges in environmental management organized by Chikitsak Samuha&rsquo;s, Sir Sitaram Lady Shantabai Patkar College of Arts and Science and V. P. Varde College of Commerce and Economics, Goregaon(West), Mumbai(Poster presentation) on 24<sup>th</sup> January 2019.</p>\n<p>7. International Conference on Recent Advances in Physical and chemical sciences organized by S.T.U.S. Mandal&rsquo;s Sangola College, Sangola(Poster Presentation) on 22<sup>nd</sup> January 2020.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 297, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2817, 95, 297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\r\n<li>Impact of Covid-19 and challenges in today&rsquo;s educational system</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dr. Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; Re-Imagining Post-Covid Education Cheras publishing House &amp; TechGuru Education Services Group</p>\r\n<p>Page No. 111-118 ISBN: 978-81-950163-6-5 July 2021.</p>\r\n<p>2. Liquid-liquid extraction of Barium(II) using Cyanex 301 in Kerosene</p>\r\n<p>Pravin N. Kamble, Namdev S. Madane, Rupesh B. Kadame</p>\r\n<p>The International journal of analytical and experimental modal analysis Vol. 15, Issue 1,Page 8-21,&nbsp;ISSN NO: 0886-9367 January 2023.</p>\r\n<p>3. Comparative Sorption Study of Pb(II) using Poly[dibenzo-18-crown6] in L-valine and L-ascorbic acid</p>\r\n<p>Deepali S. Patil, Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>The International journal of analytical and experimental modal analysis Volume XV, Issue IX, Page 76-84,&nbsp;ISSN NO: 0886-9367 September 2023.</p>\r\n<p>4. Sorption Study of Pb(II) using Poly[dibenzo-18-crown-6] in L-leucine</p>\r\n<p>Deepali S. Patil, Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>Journal For Basic Sciences Volume 23, Issue 12, Page 532-541,&nbsp;ISSN NO : 1006-8341 2023.</p>\r\n<p>5. AI&rsquo;s Role in engineering Innovations for social Development</p>\r\n<p>S.Sripriya, Namdev Satyappa Madane, P. Prakash, V.S. Shaisundaram, S. Baskar</p>\r\n<p>Emerging Trends in Multidisciplinary Technology and Science</p>\r\n<p>SRR Publishing Research, Page No. 110 -125, ISBN No. 978-81-980792-5-1 December 2024.</p>\r\n<p>6. Synthesis and Characterization of Zinc Substituted Manganese Ferrite by Sol -Gel Auto- Combustion Method</p>\r\n<p>Deepali S. Patil, Ashwini V. Jadhav, Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>Studies in Science of Science Volume 43, Issue 09, &nbsp;Page 108-115 2025,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>ISSN: 1003-2053, September 2025.</p>\r\n<p>7. Chemistry of Natural water Bodies in Protected Areas</p>\r\n<p>Dr. Namdev Satyappa Madane</p>\r\n<p>VAN VISHWA: The Living World of Indian wild Life, Page no. 308-318,&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>VYD Publishers ISBN: 978-81-992962-1-3, 2025.</p>\r\n<p>8. Nano Technology Based Drug Delivery Apparatus for Hospitals</p>\r\n<p>Dr. Netaji Navnath Karale, Dr. Sjid Mansoori, Prof. Dr. Ranjana K. Jadhav, Dr. Madhav Shivaji Mane, Dr. Ashish Shivaji Sartape, Dr. Namdev Satyappa Madane</p>\r\n<p>Patent No.&nbsp;207140, The patent office Government of India 23rd April 2025.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 297, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2818, 96, 297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p></p>\n<ol>\n<li>One day workshop on &ldquo;Ethics, Drafts and Plagiarism in writing Research Articles&rdquo; held at Sadguru Gadage Maharaj Collge, Karad on 28<sup>th</sup> January 2013.</li>\n<li>One day Workshop on &ldquo;Laboratory Safety&rdquo; held at Ramnarain Ruia, college, Matunga , Mumbai-400019 on 15<sup>th</sup> February 2014.</li>\n<li>State level workshop on &ldquo;Hands on Training in Optical Spectroscopic Methods of Analysis&rdquo; by Ismail Yusuf College of Arts, Science and Commerce, Jogeshwari, Mumbai on 8<sup>th</sup> August 2015.</li>\n<li>One day workshop on &ldquo;Revised Syllabus of T.Y.B.Sc. (CBSGS)(CHEMISTRY)&rdquo; jointly organized by Department of Chemistry, K. C. College and Board of Studies in Chemistry, University of Mumbai on 5<sup>th</sup> March 2016.</li>\n<li>One day workshop on &ldquo; Recent Amendments in UGC Norms for the API under CAS&rdquo; organized by IQAC, K.J. Somaiya college of Arts and Commerce, Vidyavihar, Mumbai on 16<sup>th</sup> September 2017.</li>\n<li>Workshop on &ldquo;Revised syllabus for M.Sc. Sem I &amp; II organized by Department of Chemistry, Guru Nanak College of Arts, Science &amp; Commerce &amp; Baord of Studies In Chemistry, University of Mumbai on 3<sup>rd</sup> October 2017.</li>\n<li>National Conference on &ldquo;Advance Analytical Tools for Material Characterization&rdquo; (AATMC-2018) organized by Birla College of Arts, Science and Commerce, Kalyan on 28<sup>th</sup> February 2018.</li>\n<li>Workshop on &ldquo;Revised syllabus of Chemistry for B.Sc. Semester V &amp; VI (SBCGS) organized by University of Mumbai &amp; Department of Chemistry, Bhavan&rsquo;s College, Andheri (W), Mumbai on 25<sup>th</sup> July 2018.</li>\n<li>One day Orientation Programme for Academic Counsellors organized by Indira Gandhi National Open university, regional centre, Mumbai on 16<sup>th</sup> November 2019.</li>\n<li>One day workshop on &ldquo;Introduction to MOOC&rsquo;s and SWAYAM&rdquo; organized by Internal Quality assurance Cell-Sathaye college on 9<sup>th</sup> December 2019.</li>\n<li>Successfully completed Bisleri Manufacturing Plant Tour for S.Y.B.Sc. Students at Bisleri International Pvt. Ltd., Mumbai on 5<sup>th</sup> February 2020.</li>\n<li>Attended live session on &ldquo;MOOC: e-learning the road ahead&rdquo; organized by Mumbai University and College Teachers Association MUCTA on 18<sup>th</sup> April 2020.</li>\n<li>One Day workshop cum webinar on e-content development and Intellectual Property Rights organized by Sathaye College, Mumbai on 27<sup>th</sup> April 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in &ldquo;Online Awareness quiz on IPR and Plagiarism&rdquo; organized by Department of Mathematics and IQAC, Raje Ramrao Mahavidyalaya, Jath on 2<sup>nd</sup> may 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in the Online seven Day National workshop on &ldquo;Research Methods and Techniques&rdquo; organized by Ramanand Arya D.A.V. College, Bhandup, Mumbai in Association with the University of Mumbai on from 4<sup>th</sup> May to 10<sup>th</sup> may 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in FDP on &ldquo;Evolution from Offline to Online Teaching&rdquo; organized by Satish pradhan Dnyanasadhana College, Thane, Internal quality assurance cell and faculty development Programme Committee In association with Department of Information Technology University of Mumbai, Yashwantrao chavan Maharashtra Open University, Mumbai Regional Centre and Microsoft from 30<sup>th</sup> may 2020 to 3<sup>rd</sup> June 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in &ldquo;International Day of Yoga&rdquo; organized by Sathaye College NCC &amp; NSS Unit in Association with Internal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC), Satahye College, Mumbai on 21<sup>st</sup> June 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in the RUSA Sponsored National Webinar on &ldquo;Gender Sensitization&rdquo;, organized by IQAC and WDC, Chikitsak Samuha&rsquo;s , Sir Sitaram Lady Shantabai Patkar College of Arts and Science and V. P. Varde College of Commerce and Economics, Goregaon(West), Mumbai on 27<sup>th</sup> July 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in One day national webinar on &ldquo;Impact of Pandemics on Education&rdquo; organized by Department of Education in association with IQAC, Satahye College, Mumbai on 31<sup>st</sup> July 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in RUSA Sponsored State level Webinar on &ldquo;Academic and Administrative Audit&rdquo; organized by IQAC and Academic and Administrative Audit Committee on 30<sup>th</sup> April 2021.</li>\n<li>Participated in a National level lecture of Professor Jagdish Joshi(Director, Human Resource Development Centre, Gujarat University on &ldquo;Professional Development in Higher Education&rdquo; organized by SNDT College of arts &amp; SCB College of Commerce &amp; Science for Women, Nathibai Thakersey Road, Mumbai-400020 on 5<sup>th</sup> May 2020.</li>\n<li>Participated in National Webinar on &ldquo;Fundamentals of Applied Nanotechnology (Chemical Aspect)- By Prof. Deep Kushalani from tata institute of fundamental research (T.I.F.R.)&rdquo; organized by department of Chemistry, Vinayal Ganesh Vaze college of arts, Science and Commerce (Autonomous), Mumbai on 20<sup>th</sup> may 2021.</li>\n<li>Participated in the National Level Faculty development Programme on &ldquo;Research-based Pedagogical Tools (RBPT)&rdquo; organized under the aegis of RUSA by Sophia College (Autonomous), Mumbai in Collaboration with Centre of Excellence in science and Mathematics Education (CoESME) estiblished under Pandit Madan Mohan Malviya national Mission for Teachers and Teaching (PMMMNMTT) at Indian Institute of Science Education and research (IISER) Pune (Supported by MHRD, Govt. Of India) from 24<sup>th</sup> to 29<sup>th</sup> May 2021.</li>\n<li>Participated in the National Symposium on &ldquo;Scope and Prospects of Chemical Science&rdquo; organized by Department of Chemistry, SVKM&rsquo;s Mithibai college of Arts. Chauhan Institute of science &amp; Amrutben Jivanlal College of Commerce and Economics (Autonomous) from 26<sup>th</sup> to 31<sup>st</sup> July 2021.</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 297, '2025-09-23', 0),
(2819, 97, 297, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. Extraction Studies of Th(IV) using DB-18-C-6 in xylene</p>\r\n<p>N.S. Madane and B. S. Mohite</p>\r\n<p>Research Journal of Chemistry and Environment vol. 19(4), April 2015, 8-14.</p>\r\n<p>2. Building back: Measures and Ease of Covid-19 Sustainable Recovery</p>\r\n<p>Dr. Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p><em>Journal of Emerging Technologies and Innovative Research</em> Vol. 9, Issue 3, March 2022.</p>\r\n<p>3. Chromatographic Extraction of Palladium (II) Ions In multi-component Mixture Using Poly[Dibenzo-18-Crown-6] as Sorbent</p>\r\n<p>Rupesh Kadam, Shivaji Jadhav, Pravin kamble, Namdev Madane</p>\r\n<p><em>Journal of Emerging Technologies and Innovative Research</em> Vol. 9, Issue 4, April 2022.</p>\r\n<p>4. Analysis of heavy metals in plant samples and water parameters of rankala lake</p>\r\n<p>Dr. Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p><em>Journal of Emerging Technologies and Innovative Research</em> Vol. 9, Issue 7, July 2022.</p>\r\n<p>5. Development of Reliable Analytical Method for Extraction and Separation of Zinc(II) in Kerosene</p>\r\n<p>Namdev S. Madane, Rupesh B. Kadam, Pravin N. Kamble</p>\r\n<p>The International journal of analytical and experimental modal analysis</p>\r\n<p>Vol. 14, Issue 7, July 2022.</p>\r\n<p>6. Liquid-liquid extraction of Barium(II) using Cyanex 301 in Kerosene</p>\r\n<p>Pravin N. Kamble, Namdev S. Madane, Rupesh B. Kadam</p>\r\n<p>The International journal of analytical and experimental modal analysis Vol. 15, Issue 1, January 2023.</p>\r\n<p>7. Comparative Sorption Study of Pb(II) using Poly[dibenzo-18-crown6] in L-valine and L-ascorbic acid</p>\r\n<p>Deepali S. Patil, Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>The International journal of analytical and experimental modal analysis</p>\r\n<p>Volume XV, Issue IX, September/2023.</p>\r\n<p>8. Sorption Study of Pb(II) using Poly[dibenzo-18-crown-6] in L-leucine</p>\r\n<p>Deepali S. Patil, Namdev S. Madane</p>\r\n<p>Journal For Basic Sciences</p>\r\n<p>Volume 23, Issue 12, 