(2923, 97, 305, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Development of Food Adulteration Detection Kit</strong> was published in <em>Aarhat Multidisciplinary International Education Research Journal (AMIERJ)</em>, Volume 8, Pages 21-26 in 2019, with ISSN No. 2278-5655. It is a peer-reviewed, refereed journal with an impact factor of 6.236.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Rapid Detection Kit for Bacteriological Analysis of Wastewater Sample: Agartrix</strong> was published in <em>Aarhat Multidisciplinary International Education Research Journal (AMIERJ)</em>, Volume 8, Pages 150-154 in 2019, with ISSN No. 2278-5655. It is a peer-reviewed, refereed journal with an impact factor of 6.236.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Development of Soil Physical Characters Analysis Kit</strong> was published in <em>International Journal of Research Culture Society</em>, Volume 3 (6A), Pages 38-43 in 2019, with ISSN No. 2456-6683. It is a UGC-approved, peer-reviewed, indexed, refereed journal with an impact factor of 4.526.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Bacterial Synthesis of Biodegradable Polyhydroxyalkanoate</strong> was published in <em>International Journal of Multidisciplinary Education Research</em>, Volume 11, Pages 111-119 in 2022, with ISSN No. 2277-7881. It is a peer-reviewed, refereed international journal with an impact factor of 8.017.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Biochar Production Technologies and Wastewater Treatment</strong> was published in <em>Journal of Chemical, Biological and Physical Sciences</em>, Volume 12, Pages 241-248 in 2022, with ISSN No. 2249-1929. It is a peer-reviewed, refereed international journal with an impact factor of 2.307.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Study of Butterfly Diversity in Maharashtra Nature Park, India</strong> was published in <em>Journal of Xi\'an University of Architecture &amp; Technology</em>, Volume 14, Pages 509-514 in 2022, with ISSN No. 1006-7930. It is listed in UGC-care Group II Journals and Scopus, with an impact factor of 3.79.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 305, '2025-09-23', 0),
