(3027, 97, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Journals<br />1) Polypyrrole-silver nanocomposite: Synthesis and characterization<br />Sensors &amp;amp; Transducers, 2016, 202(7), 76-82.<br />2) Development of Room Temperature Operating NH 3 Gas Sensor Based on Free Standing<br />PPy- PVA Composite Films<br />International Journal of Science and Research, 2016, 5(6), 2582 -88.<br />DOI: 10.21275/v5i6.ART2016107<br />3) Fabrication of a Novel Flexible Room Temperature Hydrogen Sulfide (H 2 S) Gas Sensor<br />based on Polypyrrole Films<br />International Journal of Science and Research, 2016, 5(3), 106 -111.<br />DOI: 10.21275/v5i3.NOV161786<br />4) Preparation and electrical characterization of free standing PVA-PPy-FeCl 3<br />composite polymer films<br />Archives of Applied Science Research, 2015, 7 (10):17-24.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 313, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3028, 71, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Won <strong>First Prize of Rs. 10000/-</strong> in Faculty Segment of Wings2Vision 2021 &ndash; <strong>A Training Based Business Plan Competition</strong> organised by PTVAIM&rsquo;s Centre of Entrepreneurship and Innovation on <strong>28<sup>th</sup> February 2021</strong></li>\n<li>She was appointed as the <strong>In-Charge</strong> of PTVA\'s Institute of Management\'s Centre for Entrepreneurship and Innovation <strong>(COEI)</strong>, an Incubation Centre in <strong>June 2023</strong>, and successfully managed it for one and a half years before leaving this additional responsibility to focus on her new role as Head of the Department in September 2024.</li>\n<li><span>Sukruta Pethe is recently <strong>nominated by VC of University of Mumbai </strong>as a&nbsp;</span>Member of Internship/OJT Guidelines Draft Committee for Mumbai University Undergraduate Programme.</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3029, 73, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In addition to her teaching responsibilities, she has been actively involved in co-curricular and extra-curricular activities, contributing to initiatives such as the Music Association, Science Association, Research Committee, and others. She took the initiative in establishing the <strong>Entrepreneurship Development Cell</strong> (EDC) at Sathaye College, nurturing a spirit of innovation and enterprise among students.&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">1) She is currently working as an <strong>On Job Training (OJT) in-charge</strong> and <strong>Secretary</strong> and <strong>SPOC</strong> for <strong>Acharya Chanakya Koushalya Vikas Kendra (ACKVK) of Sathaye College.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sukruta Pethe is recently <strong>nominated by VC of University of Mumbai as a Member of Internship/OJT Guidelines Draft Committee for Mumbai University Undergraduate Programme.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duty assigned at departmental level: T. Y. B.Sc. Practical In-Charge since 2010-11</li>\n<li>Duties assigned for extra-curriculum activities:</li>\n<li>Start-up Co-ordinator in PTVA&rsquo;s Institutional Innovation Centre (IIC) since 2019.</li>\n<li>Member of Examination Committee since 2020.</li>\n<li>Entrepreneurship Development Cell (EDC) In-Charge since 2020.</li>\n<li>Music Association In-Charge from 2009 to 2019.</li>\n<li>Member of Gymkhana Committee from 2009 to 2019</li>\n<li>Member of Science Association from 2004 to 2012</li>\n<li>Member of Result Finalization Committee from 2004 to 2012</li>\n<li>Member of Admission Committee from 2004 till date</li>\n<li>Member of Discipline Committee from 2013 to 2019</li>\n<li>Member of Library Committee in 2013</li>\n<li>Member of Research Committee since 2015</li>\n<li>Member of College Web-Site Development Committee in 2016, 2017.</li>\n<li>Member of Prize Distribution Committee from 2012 to 2019</li>\n<li>Member of Independence Day Celebration Committee since 2011</li>\n<li>Member of Quest Lecture Series Committee from 2017 to 2018</li>\n<li>Member of NAAC Preparation Committee for Criterion III, 2017, Criterion II from 2018 to 2020, Criterion VII since 2021</li>\n<li>Worked as B.Sc. I.T. In-Charge from October 2002 to May 2006.</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3030, 74, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3031, 75, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li>Worked as an <strong>In-Charge B.Sc. IT department in Sathaye College</strong> (5 years from 2002 to 2006) and taught Mathematics, Discrete Mathematics, Electronics and Telecommunication as well as ERP Management and Project Management papers.</li>\n<li>Working as an Assistant Profeesor in Physics from 2002 in Sathaye College.</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3032, 76, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Professionl:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>She was invited for to deliver a Public Lecture o in <strong>विज्ञान व्याख्यानमाला</strong>&nbsp; by Phatak Granthalaya of Tilak Mandir to give a speech on \"<strong>Fractals, Chaos and Synchronisation</strong>\" in Marathi on <strong>5th</strong> <strong>October 2018</strong> organised by a well-known Organisation in Vile Parle East namely Tilak Mandir. It is an initiative by its Library namely Phatak Granthalaya.</li>\n<li>Worked as a Resource Person for Regional (RBPT) workshop organized by <strong>IISER, Pune</strong> in Cooch Behar, West Bengal from <strong>18<sup>th</sup> to 20<sup>th</sup></strong> <strong>September 2019</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Social:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Her community efforts have led to guiding over 50 societies, Higher Education Institutes, Scholls and hosting 2,500+ visitors to her own housing society.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span>She has also delivered an awareness lecture in NIRRH , Mumbai.</span></li>\n<li><span>She was invited as a chief guest in Yashwantra Chavan Mukta Vidyapeeth Open University Centre at Chetana College Bandra on 8th March 2023 on the occassion of Womens Day Celebraton.</span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3033, 77, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '0', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3034, 78, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3035, 79, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>1) Title of Project: </strong>Preparation and testing of MCQ bank based on some Physics topics from undergraduate Physics course of University of Mumbai.</p>\n<p>Principal Investigator: Dr. M. R. Rajwade</p>\n<p>Co-Investigator: Sukruta Pethe</p>\n<p><strong>Funding Agency: </strong>BCUD University of &nbsp;Mumbai</p>\n<p><strong>Grant :</strong> 31400 / -</p>\n<p><strong>Nature and&nbsp; Status</strong> : Completed in period 09/06/2012 to 30/04/2013</p>\n<p>2) Institution Research Grant has been sanctioned for a research project for academic year 2025-26</p>\n<p><strong>Title of Project:&nbsp;</strong>Biomechanical and Nonlinear Dynamical Study of Swaying in Y-Branched Plants under Controlled Wind Conditions</p>\n<p><strong>Principal Investigator: </strong>Sukruta Pethe (Physics)</p>\n<p><strong>Co-Investigator: </strong>Chaitali S. Pujare (Botany)</p>\n<p><strong>Grant:</strong> Rs. 50000/-</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3036, 80, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3037, 81, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3038, 95, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Chapter in Book:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Contributed a chapter namely <em>Astronomy in Ancient Indian Knowledge System&nbsp;</em>in a text book of Indian Knowledge Systems Semester -I/II published by Sathaye College (Autonomous) with ISBN:978-81-984134-2-0</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Research Papers:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Development of Room Temperature Operating NH<sub>3</sub> Gas Sensor Based on Free Standing PPy-PVA Composite Films, International Journal of Science and Research (IJSR), Volume 5 Issue 6, June 2016, pp.2582-2588 (ISSN Online: 2319-7064) Authors:&nbsp;Y. V. Gulwadi, S. P. Patil, Smt. <strong>S. A. Pethe</strong>, J. B. Bhadane</li>\r\n<li>Room Temperature Polyaniline-Polyvinyl alcohol Composite-based flexible Ammonia Sensor International Journal of Science and Research (IJSR)&nbsp;<br />ISSN (Online): 2319-7064 Index Copernicus Value (2013): 6.14 | Impact Factor (2014): 5.611Authors: S. P. Patil, <strong>S. A. Pethe,</strong> J. B. Bhadane, Y. V. Gulwadi</li>\r\n<li>Steam Generation by Localizing Heat Due to Solar Thermal Energy using GO and rGO in the International Journal ofo Novel Research and Development (IJNRD) ISSN: 2456-4184 Author: <strong>S. A. Pethe</strong></li>\r\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3039, 96, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>Attended a blended mode workshop organised by Teaching Learning Centre (ICT) at IIT Bombay funded by PMMMNMIT, MHRD, Govt. of India, on Moodle Learning Management System held at D. J. Sanghavi College of Engineering, Vile Parle Mumbai on <strong>25<sup>th</sup> March 2019</strong></li>\n<li>Participated in the National Webinar on Physics Education Post Covid Era organized by Indian Association of Physics Teachers (IAPT) on <strong>21<sup>st</sup> and 22<sup>nd</sup> July 2020.</strong></li>\n<li>Participated in E-summit20 organized by Entrepreneurship Cell, IIT Bombay on <strong>1<sup>st</sup> and 2<sup>nd</sup> February 2020.</strong></li>\n<li>Participated in two days E-workshop on Copyrights for Academicians organised by PTVAIM&rsquo;s Centre of Entrepreneurship and Innovation from <strong>20<sup>th</sup> and 21<sup>st</sup> October 2020</strong>.<strong></strong></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3040, 97, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li>&nbsp;Development of Room Temperature Operating NH<sub>3</sub> Gas Sensor Based on Free Standing PPy-PVA Composite Films, International Journal of Science and Research (IJSR), Volume 5 Issue 6, June 2016, pp.2582-2588 (ISSN Online: 2319-7064) Authors:&nbsp;Y. V. Gulwadi, S. P. Patil, Smt. <strong>S. A. Pethe</strong>, J. B. Bhadane</li>\n<li>Room Temperature Polyaniline-Polyvinyl alcohol Composite-based flexible Ammonia Sensor International Journal of Science and Research (IJSR)&nbsp;<br />ISSN (Online): 2319-7064 Index Copernicus Value (2013): 6.14 | Impact Factor (2014): 5.611Authors: S. P. Patil, <strong>S. A. Pethe,</strong> J. B. Bhadane, Y. V. Gulwadi</li>\n<li>Steam Generation by Localizing Heat Due to Solar Thermal Energy using GO and rGO in the International Journal ofo Novel Research and Development (IJNRD) ISSN: 2456-4184 Author: <strong>S. A. Pethe</strong></li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
