(3118, 97, 320, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>List of Publications</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Method for quantification of lipids and proteins from the foot tissues of Giant African Snail (Achatina fulica)<br />Co-author: Tanaya C. Tarale, Trupti N. Jadhav, Nilu S. Mishra, Pranjal P. Agre<br />Name of publication: International Research Journal of Modernization in Engineering Technologyand Science<br />Year of publication: 2023<br />eISSN: 2582-5208</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Role of Geographical Separation in Molecular Evolution of the Giant Wood Spider (Nephila pilipes)<br />Co-author: NA<br />Name of Publication : Journal of Emerging Technologies and Innovative Research (JETIR)<br />Year of Publication :2022<br />eISSN :2349-5162</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Molecular Comparison of Fumarylacetoacetate Hydrolase (FAH) gene in TyrosineCatabolism of Frugivorous and Insectivorous Bats<br />Co-author: Ashok P. Manekar<br />Name of Publication : International Journal of All Research Education and Scientific Methods(IJARESM)<br />Year of Publication :2021<br />eISSN :2455-6211</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Molecular Characterization of HPD gene in Indian Bats<br />Co-author: Ashok P. Manekar<br />Name of Publication :Journal for Advanced Research in Applied Sciences<br />Year of Publication :2017<br />ISSN :ISSN 2394-8442</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Homogentisate 1, 2 Dioxygenase (HGD) Gene Characterization from Insectivorous andFrugivorous Bats<br />Co-author: Ashok P. Manekar<br />Name of Publication :World Wide Journal of Multidisciplinary Research and Development<br />Year of Publication :2017<br />ISSN :e-ISSN: 2454-6615</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Antiepileptic Drug Sodium Valproate Alters Male Reproductive Functions In Rats<br />Co-author: Ashok P. Manekar, Yogita S. Patil-Dhuri,Shreya R. Patil, Geetha D. Shetty,DigvijayTonchar, Sandhya Kadiru, Jagdish R. Mehta<br />Name of Publication :International Journal of Molecular Genetics.<br />Year of Publication :2015<br />ISSN :ISSN 2249-4227</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Comparative Study of Two lakes (Powai and Vihar) in Mumbai, with respect to Physico-Chemical Parameters and Zooplankton Diversity<br />Co-author: Vitthal Dandwate, Nikhil Yadav and Deelip Bharmal<br />Name of Publication :International Journal of Science, Environment and Technology<br />Year of Publication :2015<br />ISSN :ISSN 2278-3687 (O); 2277-663X (P)</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Induction of secondary axis in hydra revisited: New insights into pattern formation<br />Co-author: Surendra Ghaskadbi and Saroj Ghaskadbi<br />Name of Publication :International Journal of Molecular and Cellular Medicine (IJMCM)<br />Year of Publication :2012<br />ISSN :e-ISSN: 2251-9645 p-ISSN: 2251-9637</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 320, '2025-09-23', 0),
