(3158, 71, 324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Dr. Ravindra Harsing Pawara earned his Ph.D. in November, 2018 with a thesis on \"<span>Effect of Imidacloprid on Fresh Water Spotted Snakehead Fish Channa Punctatus (Bloch)(Perciformes:Channidae)\",</span> under the guidance of Dr. Nisar Patel at KBC, North Maharashtra University, Jalgaon.</p>\n<p><span><strong>State Eligibility Test (SET)</strong>:&nbsp;</span>Qualified in December 2019, conducted by UGC and Savitribai Phule University, Pune.</p>\n<p><span><strong>Master of Science (M.Sc.): </strong></span>Zoology (Entomology) from KBC, North Maharashtra University, Jalgaon in 2007.</p>\n<h4><span>Honors and Recognitions:</span></h4>\n<p>He was awarded the Rajiv Gandhi National Fellowship by UGC, New Delhi, from 2011 to April 2016.</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 324, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3159, 73, 324, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\r\n<li>Science Association and Gravity Academic year 2022-2023.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Member of NAAC Criteria I (Teaching-Learning and Evaluation).</li>\r\n<li>Member of Board of Studies (BOS) in Zoology.</li>\r\n<li>Member of Cultural Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Member of Admission Committee.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Member of Discipline Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Member of Garden Committee.</li>\r\n<li>Member of CAP Committee.</li>\r\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 324, '2025-09-23', 0),
