llabus of S.Y.B.Sc. Zoology&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 86px; width: 225px;\" width=\"228\">\r\n<p>Department of Zoology &ndash; Kirti College &ndash; Dadar</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 86px; width: 113px;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p>10<sup>th</sup> July 2016</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 48px;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p><strong>19.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 238px;\" width=\"241\">\r\n<p>One day state level Intercollegiate Seminar cum workshop on <strong>&ldquo;Human rights and duties education&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 225px;\" width=\"228\">\r\n<p>Chembur Sarvankash Shikshanshastra Mahavidyala &ndash; Chembur &ndash; Mumbai</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 113px;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p>23<sup>rd</sup> Dec 2015</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 104px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 48px;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p><strong>20.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 238px;\" width=\"241\">\r\n<p>UGC sponsored National Seminar on &ldquo;<strong>Wetlands &ndash; Present status, ecology and conservation&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 225px;\" width=\"228\">\r\n<p>M.D. college &ndash; Parel &ndash; Mumbai</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 104px; width: 113px;\" width=\"112\">\r\n<p>12<sup>th</sup> Aug 2015</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 86px;\">\r\n<td style=\"height: 86px; width: 48px;\" width=\"47\">\r\n<p><strong>21.</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 86px; width: 238px;\" width=\"241\">\r\n<p>One day workshop for&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>&ldquo;Revised Syllabus of F.Y.B.Sc. in Zoology&rdquo;</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"height: 86px; width: 225px;\" width=\"228\">\r\n<p>ICLE&rsquo;s M.J. college &ndash; Vashi &ndash; Navi Mumbai</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td styl