(3333, 78, 337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\r\n<li>Eco crop model approach of agro-climatic suitability for cashew and coconut plantations in Sindhudurg district. Co-author: Dnyaneshwar Bombe<br />Name of event: Inter-Institutional Research Conclave: 2022-23<br />Period: 28/02/2023<br />Name of organiser: Parle Tilak Vidyalaya Association\' s Sathaye College (Autonomous), Mumbai</li>\r\n<li>GC-MS analysis of saponins, steroids and terpenoids from leaves and male flowers of <em>Homonoia riparia</em> Lour.<br />Co Author: Smita Henry Gaurea and Smrity Prabha<br />Name of Conference: International Virtual Conference on Recent advances in chemical and biological sciences.<br />Level: International<br />Period: 25th September 2022 to 26th September 2022<br />Name of Organisers: IQAC, Department of Chemistry and Biological Sciences, Gokhale Education Society\'s N. B. Mehta (Valwada) Science College, Bordi<br />The paper was awarded with First Best Paper Presentation Award.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>GC-MS analysis of tannins and flavonoids from leaves and male flowers of <em>Homonoia riparia </em>Lour.<br />Co Author :Smita Henry Gaurea, Smrity Prabha and Ujwala Chintamani Bapat<br />Name of Conference :XXVI Annual Conference of Indian Association for Angiosperm Taxonomy &amp; International Seminar on Conservation and Sustainable Utilization of Biodiversity<br />Level :National<br />Period :07/11/2016-09/11/2016<br />Name of Organizers :Department of Botany, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, Maharashtra</li>\r\n<li>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Antifungal activity of gum-resin extracts of <em>Boswellia serrata </em>Roxb. ex Colebr., <em>Commiphora mukul</em> (Hooks ex Stocks) Engl., <em>Gardenia resinifera </em>Roth. and <em>Shorea robusta</em> Gaertn. against plant pathogenic fungi<br />Co Author :Smita Henry Gaurea, Alka Bapat, Smrity Prabha and Ujwala C. Bapat.<br />Name of Conference :XXVI Annual Conference of Indian Association for Angiosperm Taxonomy &amp; International Seminar on Conservation and Sustainable Utilization of Biodiversity&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Level :National<br />Period :07/11/2016-09/11/2016<br />Name of Organizers :Department of Botany, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, Maharashtra</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Antifungal activity of ethanolic and petroleum ether extracts of some medicinal plants against the plant pathogenic fungus <em>Nigrospora oryzae</em> (Berk. &amp; Broome) Petch.<br />Co Author :Smrity Prabha, Smita Henry Gaurea, Jyoti Kumar, and Ujwala C. Bapat<br />Name of Conference :XXVI Annual Conference of Indian Association for Angiosperm Taxonomy &amp; International Seminar on Conservation and Sustainable Utilization of Biodiversity<br />Level :National<br />Period :07/11/2016-09/11/2016<br />Name of Organizers :Department of Botany, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, Maharashtra</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\">Antifungal activity study of the extracts of <em>Homonoia riparia, Pedilanthus tithymaloides</em> and <em>Phyllanthus fraternus.</em><br />Co Author :Ujwala C. Bapat<br />Name of Conference :5th World Ayurveda Congress and Arogya Expo - Focal theme &lsquo;Enriching Public Health through Ayurveda\'<br />Level :International<br />Period :07/12/2012-10/12/2012<br />Name of Organizers :World Ayurveda Foundation</li>\r\n<li style=\"line-height: 1;\">Assessment of plant biodiversity in Mokhada, Palghar district, Maharashtra&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Conference: International E-Conference on &lsquo;Advances in Life Sciences, Biodiversity and Conservation&rsquo;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author: Ankita More, Nilesh Sharma&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Level: International&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Period: 8/04/2025&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Organisers: Departments of Botany and Zoology and IQAC of Shri Sadguru Gangageer Maharaj Science, Gautam Arts and Sanjivani Commerce College, Kopargaon- 423601</li>\r\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 337, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3334, 79, 337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li>Research advisor for Mr. Bhushan Nadekar (MSc student):<br />Green synthesis of silver nanoparticles extracted from Celosia argentea and Solanum anguivi.<br />Name of event: Inter-Institutional Research Conclave: 2022-23<br />Period: 28/02/2023<br />Name of organiser: Parle Tilak Vidyalaya Association\' s Sathaye College (Autonomous), Mumbai</li>\n<li>Research advisor for Mr. Shreyas Waghmare (MSc student):<br />A case study of soil analysis from Khanvel, Silvassa, Dadra and Nagar Haveli.<br />Name of event: Inter-Institutional Research Conclave: 2022-23<br />Period: 28/02/2023<br />Name of organiser: Parle Tilak Vidyalaya Association\' s Sathaye College (Autonomous), Mumbai</li>\n<li>Guided a research project of Mr. Omkar Gaikwad and Ms. Karishma Upadhyay<br />Assessment of vegetation cover of Palghar Taluka using NDVI technique.<br />Name of event: 17th Avishkar: Intercollegiate/ Institute/ Department Research Convention<br />(Zonal Round; Engineering and Technology Category and UG level)<br />Period: 22/12/2022<br />Name of organizer: University of Mumbai at St. Andrew&rsquo;s College of Arts, Science and<br />Commerce, Bandra, Mumbai for Mumbai III Zone</li>\n<li>Research advisor for Mr. Shreyas Waghmare<br />A mini review on morphology, chemical constituents and biological activities of Homonoia.<br />Name of event: Fledgling Researcher&rsquo;s Programme - 2021-22<br />Period: 25/02/2022<br />Name of organizer: Parle Tilak Vidyalaya Association\' s Sathaye College (Autonomous), Mumbai</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 337, '2025-09-23', 0),
