(3339, 97, 337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. Evaluation of antioxidant activity of <em>Homonoia riparia</em> Lour., <em>Kirganelia reticulata</em> (Poir) Baill., <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em> Webster and <em>Pedilanthus tithymaloides </em>(Linn.) Poit. and its correlation with the total phenolic and flavonoid contents<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharma and Bio Sciences&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :P. Muthuprasanna, K. Suriaprabha<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2015<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :0975-6299<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Impact Factor :6.27</p>\r\n<p><br />2. Phytochemical investigations and antimicrobial and anticancer activities of <em>Homonoia riparia </em>Lour.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :Prof. M. S. Bhatia<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publisher :Innovare Academic Sciences Pvt Ltd<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2014<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :0975-1491<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Impact Factor :5.00</p>\r\n<p>3. Study of antimicrobial activity and phytochemical evaluation of <em>Jatropha gossypifolia</em>, <em>Sapium sebiferum, Kirganelia reticulata, Phyllanthus fraternus</em> and <em>Pedilanthus tithymaloides</em><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences and Research<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Name of Editors :Shashi Alok, Monika Sabharwal<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Year of Publication :2014<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;ISSN :0975-8232<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Impact Factor :2.60</p>\r\n<p>4. Antibacterial activity studies of extracts of <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em> Webster, <em>Jatropha gossypifolia</em> Linn. and <em>Sapium sebiferum</em> (L.)Roxb.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC, Mhadnak TR<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :Xplore<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :Agnelo Menezes, Aditi Sawant,Pearl Pastakia<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publisher :St. Xaviers College<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2012<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :2249-1878</p>\r\n<p>5. Antifungal activity study of the extracts of <em>Homonoia riparia, Pedilanthus tithymaloides </em>and <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em><br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :Ancient Science of Life<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :Dr. P.R. Krishnakumar, Devidas Varier<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publisher :Wolters Kluwer - Medknow<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2012<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :2249-9547&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>6.&nbsp;Assessment of Plant Biodiversity in Mokhada, Palghar district, Maharashtra<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author: Ankita More and Nilesh Sharma&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication: International Journal of Biology Sciences 2025; 7(6): 145-150&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors: Dr. Mangesh Jagatrao Dagawal&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publisher: Comprehensive Publications <strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp