(3415, 98, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. Online National Level Workshop on &ldquo;E-content Development&rdquo; by MD College, Parel, Mumbai.<br />2. Online workshop on \"Experiential Teaching with diverse tools\" conducted by the IQAC, M.D. College.<br />3. FDP by Mumbai University, BMM department of Lala Lajpatrai College of Commerce &amp; Economics &amp; North Storm Academy on &ldquo;Online College Management and Online Content Creation tools&rdquo;.<br />4. FDP by North Storm Academy on &ldquo;Online course planning, design and Best practices for online teaching&rdquo;.<br />5. Online National Webinar on &lsquo;Dynamics of Online Education: A dialogue on Policy and practice&rsquo; organized by Department of Education, Rajiv Gandhi University (A Central University), Doimukh.<br />6. \"A NATIONAL WEBINAR SERIES ON Knowledge Generation in Education during COVID-19 Pandemic from May 12 - 16, 2020\" conducted by the collaborative efforts of Bombay Teacher\'s Training College, HSNC University with the Department of Education, University of Mumbai.<br />7. National Webinar on &ldquo;Education GenNext: Perspectives, Opportunities and Challenges&rdquo; conducted by St. Teresa\'s Institute of Education, Santacruz, Mumbai.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 254, '2025-09-23', 0),
