(3466, 98, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"2e0b1b9c-fded-4c16-ba2b-ca8701f03452\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"35\">Orientation &amp; Refresher Courses</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"204\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">\r\n<li data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"116\"><strong data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"61\">Orientation Course</strong> &ndash; Goa University, <strong data-start=\"80\" data-end=\"116\" data-is-only-node=\"\">27 February 2010 &ndash; 26 March 2010</strong></li>\r\n<li data-start=\"117\" data-end=\"204\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"143\">Refresher Course &ndash; I</strong> &ndash; University of Pune, <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"204\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">23 January 2002 &ndash; 19 February 2002</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mb-px h-px w-full opacity-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 313, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3467, 98, 314, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"145\">\n<p>Orientation Course</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p>ASC University Of Mumbai</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"105\">\n<p>15/12/2008</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"103\">\n<p>13/01/2009</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"145\">\n<p>Refresher Course 1</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p>ASC University Of Mumbai&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"105\">\n<p>17/01/2011</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"103\">\n<p>07/02/2011</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"145\">\n<p>Refresher Course 2</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p>ASC University Of Mumbai&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"105\">\n<p>09/12/2014</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"103\">\n<p>30/12/2014</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"145\">\n<p>Refresher Course 3</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"213\">\n<p>HRDC University Of Mumbai</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"105\">\n<p>16/11/2015</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"103\">\n<p>05/12/2015</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</li>\n<li>Level I and II workshops on RBPT (Research Based Pedagogical Tool) organized by IISER, Pune in association with MHRD, British Council and Newton-Bhabha fund and DBT, Ministry of Science and Technology in Raipur in <strong>October 2017</strong> and in Pune in <strong>January</strong> <strong>2018</strong></li>\n<li>Participated in the course on Basics of Special Theory of Relativity organised by IIT, Kanpur and conducted by Prof. H. C. Verma, Retired, Department of Physics, IIT, Kanpur <strong>from 18<sup>th</sup> December 2018 to 8<sup>th</sup> March 2019</strong>.</li>\n<li>Successfully Faculty Development Programme in Family Managed Business organized by AIFMB and SRK Diamonds, Surat at Surat in <strong>January 2020</strong>.</li>\n<li>Successfully completed two weeks Faculty Development Programme organised by PMMMNMIT, MHRD in Advanced Concepts for Developing MOOCS from <strong>2<sup>nd</sup> July to 17<sup>th</sup> July 2020</strong>.</li>\n<li>Participated in three days Basic Entrepreneurship Development Programme organised by PTVAIM&rsquo;s Centre of Entrepreneurship and Innovation from <strong>4<sup>th</sup> to 6<sup>th</sup> February 2020</strong>.</li>\n<li>Participated in 6 weeks FDP on Flipped Classroom organised by IQAC of Sathaye College in the first half of 2025.</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 314, '2025-09-23', 0),
