(3480, 98, 328, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>May-June(2020)</strong></p>\n<p>Completed a Faculty Development Program on the topic <strong>\'Evolution from Offline to Online Teaching</strong>\' organised by Dnyansadhana College in association with Department of Information Technology (University of Mumbai), Yashwantrao Chavan Maharashtra Open University, Mumbai Regional Centre and Microsoft.</p>\n<p><strong>June(2020)</strong></p>\n<p>Completed a Faculty Development Program on the topic <strong>\'A Bootcamp on Artificial Intelligence, machine Learning and AI Chat bots\' </strong>organized by Kishinchand Chellaram College in association with University Department of Information Technology(University of Mumbai)</p>\n<p><strong>January-March(2025)</strong></p>\n<p>Completed a Faculty Development Program on the topic <strong>\'Flipped Learning\'</strong> organised by Sathaye College(Autonomous).</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 328, '2025-09-23', 0),
