(3857, 105, 48, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Education and research are complementary to each other. Research-oriented teaching-learning helps higher education institutes achieve global competency. Research keeps teachers updated and makes teaching more interesting to students. It fosters application-oriented studies in students.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In view of this, the research committee has introduced two programmes to nurture the research environment in our college. The first is \"The Fledgling Researchers&rsquo; Programme,\" where students will explore their new research ideas under the guidance of their research advisors. Surely, this programme will engender the next generation of researchers.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\"The Reminiscences of a Research Journey\" is the second programme. The senior faculty members share experiences and difficulties faced during their research journey. This encourages young teachers to conduct research and forecast potential future problems.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">To facilitate the research environment, this year the college started the central research and instrumentation laboratory. It provides major basic instruments used in scientific research and different advanced software for research in languages, commerce, and the humanities.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Of 64 permanent faculty members, one has a D.Litt, 27 have PhD degrees, and eight are pursuing the doctoral programme. A total of 222 research papers have been published in national and international journals. 65 books and 9 chapters have been published in the last five years. The college has received a research grant of Rs. 40, 46,970 and 15 research projects have been completed by the faculty members.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(3858, 105, 49, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Research Facilities in Botany Laboratory</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp; Basic Infrastructure</strong><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Spacious, well-ventilated laboratory with adequate lighting</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Working benches with water and gas connections</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Storage cabinets for chemicals and plant specimens</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Preparation room and wash area</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Separate research workspace for PG students</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Microscopy &amp; Imaging Facilities</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Compound microscopes (student &amp; research grade)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Stereo zoom microscope</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Trinocular microscope with digital camera attachment</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Microphotography setup</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Projection microscope / LCD display system</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Plant Taxonomy &amp; Herbarium Facilities</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Well-maintained herbarium with mounted specimens</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Herbarium cabinets and drying press</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Plant identification keys and floras (e.g., regional flora references)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Access to Botanical Survey reports (such as those of the Botanical Survey of India)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Field survey kits (GPS, plant press, sample bags)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong> Microtechnique &amp; Anatomy Section</strong></span></li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Microtome (manual/rotary)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Staining reagents and chemicals</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Permanent slide preparation facility</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Incubator</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Oven and autoclave</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Plant Physiology &amp; Biochemistry Lab</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Colorimeter / Spectrophotometer</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Centrifuge</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">pH meter</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Hot air oven</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Water bath</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Analytical balance</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Phytochemistry &amp; Research Support</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Soxhlet apparatus</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Distillation unit</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Chromatography setup (Paper/TLC)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Refrigerator &amp; deep freezer</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Glassware and chemical storage</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Environmental &amp; Ecology Research</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Soil testing kits</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Moisture meter</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Light meter</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Environmental monitoring tools</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Composting/vermicomposting unit</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>ICT &amp; Digital Support</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Computers with internet access</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Access to e-journals (INFLIBNET, N-List)</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Digital plant database</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">LCD projector for research presentations</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&nbsp;Safety &amp; Compliance</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">First aid kit</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Fire extinguisher</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Chemical safety guidelines display</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12pt; font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Waste disposal system (bio-waste &amp; chemical waste)</span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 333, '2026-02-21', 0),
