(4323, 1, 61, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"line-height: 1; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Contact:- +91 8655060176&nbsp; &nbsp; Whatsapp Direct Link :- <span style=\"color: #1713e2;\"><a style=\"color: #1713e2;\" title=\"Whatsapp Group  Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EdVJx3oKBGoBqs9Mgzbru7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for More information</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<hr />\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #e03e2d; color: #1713e2;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\">Department of Defence &amp; Strategic Studies</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Best College for Defence &amp; Strategic Studies </span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">in Mumbai</span></strong></span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\">Affiliated to </strong></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">University of Mumbai</span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1t8xs9v\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"436\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;BA in Defence &amp; Strategic Studies (UG Degree &ndash; 3 Years)&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"280\" data-end=\"707\">Welcome to one of the <strong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"369\">Best Colleges for Defence &amp; Strategic Studies Courses in Mumbai</strong>, offering a <strong data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"440\">Bachelor of Arts (B.A.) in Defence &amp; Strategic Studies</strong> &ndash; a 3-year undergraduate degree program designed to develop students with strong understanding of <strong data-start=\"539\" data-end=\"665\">national security, military studies, international relations, strategic affairs, disaster management, and defence analysis</strong> affiliated to the University of Mumbai. The <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sathaye College</span></span> is recognized as one of the leading institutes for Defence &amp; Strategic Studies education in Mumbai which is established in 2023, providing students with a blend of <strong data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"987\">academic excellence, practical exposure, leadership development, and national service orientation</strong>. The program covers important areas such as <strong data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1299\">National Security, International Relations, Military History, Defence Journalism, Strategic Thought, Internal Security, Disaster Management, Maritime Security, Terrorism &amp; Counter-Terrorism, Cyber Security, Military Sociology, and Emerging Defence Technologies</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1778340075-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Admission Open 2026-27\" width=\"400\" height=\"601\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1778340075-3.jpeg\" alt=\"Def Description\" width=\"400\" height=\"601\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1; text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"988\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"905\">three-year undergraduate program</strong>, affiliated with the <strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"951\">University of Mumbai. </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This innovative format bridges the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world industry practices, making it one of the <strong data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1391\">best Defence &amp; Strategic Studies degree programs in Mumbai</strong>.</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"1ew1pxq\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"932\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Why Choose This Program?</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"963\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">If you are searching for the:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1185\">\n<li data-section-id=\"9vppaw\" data-start=\"2684\" data-end=\"2726\">Best Defence Studies College in Mumbai</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"b9u312\" data-start=\"2727\" data-end=\"2778\">Top Defence &amp; Strategic Studies Degree in India</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1radaoa\" data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2836\">B.A. Defence Studies Course with Career Opportunities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jpspop\" data-start=\"2837\" data-end=\"2881\">Defence Studies Course with NCC Exposure</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"133i6ro\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2948\">Strategic Studies Degree for UPSC &amp; Defence Career Preparation</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"1hv1k5g\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1247\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Key Highlights:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1o1ksko\" data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3016\">3-Year B.A. Degree (NEP-Aligned Curriculum)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fogown\" data-start=\"3017\" data-end=\"3060\">University of Mumbai Affiliated Program</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1f0qjtl\" data-start=\"3061\" data-end=\"3102\">NCC Exposure &amp; Leadership Development</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vgf0h7\" data-start=\"3103\" data-end=\"3153\">Focus on National Security &amp; Strategic Affairs</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3i6phs\" data-start=\"3154\" data-end=\"3184\">Career-Oriented Curriculum</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"96j1fl\" data-start=\"3185\" data-end=\"3234\">Workshops, Seminars &amp; Defence Expert Sessions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1s6k68q\" data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3282\">Practical Exposure through Field Activities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fnmye1\" data-start=\"3283\" data-end=\"3337\">Skill Development for Defence &amp; Government Careers</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Course Overview</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"3363\" data-end=\"3438\">The <strong>B.A. in Defence &amp; Strategic Studies</strong> focuses on developing expertise in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3829\">\n<li data-section-id=\"15wvclj\" data-start=\"3440\" data-end=\"3481\">National Security &amp; Strategic Studies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5xvstq\" data-start=\"3482\" data-end=\"3520\">Military History &amp; Warfare Studies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7pex7j\" data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3565\">International Relations &amp; Foreign Policy</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"16ncsjn\" data-start=\"3566\" data-end=\"3609\">Disaster Management &amp; Internal Security</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ey0qwm\" data-start=\"3610\" data-end=\"3640\">Maritime &amp; Border Security</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6gw3vb\" data-start=\"3641\" data-end=\"3674\">Terrorism &amp; Counter-Terrorism</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"oypynz\" data-start=\"3675\" data-end=\"3713\">Defence Journalism &amp; Media Studies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1emp0hx\" data-start=\"3714\" data-end=\"3764\">Cyber Security &amp; Emerging Defence Technologies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jfb6qe\" data-start=\"3765\" data-end=\"3800\">Military Psychology &amp; Sociology</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1cc9dgj\" data-start=\"3801\" data-end=\"3829\">Peace &amp; Conflict Studies</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Facilities</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1663\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Sathaye College</span></span> provides modern facilities to ensure students receive quality academic and practical exposure throughout the program.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smart classrooms with audio-visual learning support</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"7pdcib\" data-start=\"4090\" data-end=\"4154\">Seminar halls for strategic discussions and defence lectures</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1214kjm\" data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4208\">Wi-Fi enabled campus and digital learning support</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1d3kppg\" data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4270\">Defence-related workshops and expert interaction sessions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1kdt4g0\" data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4323\">Access to NCC training and leadership activities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"2ty8hc\" data-start=\"4324\" data-end=\"4374\">Educational visits and field exposure programs</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"jp7n3g\" data-start=\"4375\" data-end=\"4417\">LMS Moodle as Online Learning Platform</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Expert Teachers &amp; Industrial Experts</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"4591\" data-end=\"4796\">The department is guided by qualified academicians, defence professionals, NCC officers, strategic analysts, and industry experts who provide students with a combination of academic and practical learning. Students benefit through:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"5072\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1i3y5b0\" data-start=\"4824\" data-end=\"4858\">Interactive classroom sessions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tzunr4\" data-start=\"4859\" data-end=\"4902\">Strategic case studies and war analysis</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ge54pp\" data-start=\"4903\" data-end=\"4951\">Defence-oriented discussions and simulations</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"355wwa\" data-start=\"4952\" data-end=\"5007\">Guest lectures by armed forces officers and experts</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"yofr5s\" data-start=\"5008\" data-end=\"5072\">Guidance for competitive examinations and career development</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"5074\" data-end=\"5179\">The department focuses on building leadership, analytical ability, and strategic thinking among students.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Library</span></strong></span></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5547\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1vc9eyb\" data-start=\"5227\" data-end=\"5334\">Books on defence studies, military history, strategic affairs, geopolitics, and international relations</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1u9xuhn\" data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5403\">Access to journals, research publications, and digital resources</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"129iw1c\" data-start=\"5404\" data-end=\"5461\">Study and reading facilities for academic development</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"129iw1c\" data-start=\"5404\" data-end=\"5461\">Reference material for UPSC, MPSC, CDS, AFCAT, and other competitive examination</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1778500294-a.jpeg\" alt=\"12\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\" /><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1778500298-d.jpeg\" alt=\"123\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-start=\"5549\" data-end=\"5636\">Students are encouraged to engage in research, policy analysis, and strategic learning.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Infrastructure</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3479\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sathaye College boasts a student-friendly infrastructure designed to support both academic and extracurricular development. Facilities include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spacious classrooms with smart boards</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n3ssr5\" data-start=\"5765\" data-end=\"5802\">Seminar and conference facilities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dlt02w\" data-start=\"5803\" data-end=\"5846\">Technology-enabled teaching environment</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"100wjwm\" data-start=\"5847\" data-end=\"5883\">Green and well-maintained campus</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12pisv1\" data-start=\"5884\" data-end=\"5925\">Recreation and student activity areas</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"8b1msn\" data-start=\"5926\" data-end=\"5960\">Gymkhana and sports facilities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1n5t1i\" data-start=\"5961\" data-end=\"6010\">NCC KOTE and defence activity support systems</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Placement Cell</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4106\">The department actively supports students through career guidance and skill development initiatives.</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"5pi08b\" data-start=\"6325\" data-end=\"6382\">Career counselling for defence and government sectors</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"3s0ilj\" data-start=\"6383\" data-end=\"6451\">Guidance for UPSC, MPSC, CDS, AFCAT, CAPF and Police Recruitment</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xv6u0u\" data-start=\"6452\" data-end=\"6503\">Soft skill and personality development sessions</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1xg6mpt\" data-start=\"6504\" data-end=\"6544\">Internship and project opportunities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1snj9p8\" data-start=\"6545\" data-end=\"6590\">Resume building and interview preparation</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18dgzxg\" data-start=\"6591\" data-end=\"6659\">Networking opportunities with defence and security professionals</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Career Opportunity</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p data-start=\"6690\" data-end=\"6779\">After completing the <strong>B.A. in Defence &amp; Strategic Studies</strong>, students can pursue careers in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"7096\">\n<li data-section-id=\"9ek21z\" data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6814\">Indian Army, Navy &amp; Air Force</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1plm0ox\" data-start=\"6815\" data-end=\"6847\">Police &amp; Paramilitary Forces</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"g8awgs\" data-start=\"6848\" data-end=\"6884\">Intelligence &amp; Security Agencies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"tc83ur\" data-start=\"6885\" data-end=\"6920\">Disaster Management Authorities</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"nuivzq\" data-start=\"6921\" data-end=\"6951\">Defence Journalism &amp; Media</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14z9q28\" data-start=\"6952\" data-end=\"6990\">Civil Services &amp; Government Sector</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1jn55ch\" data-start=\"6991\" data-end=\"7027\">Strategic Research Organizations</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19pvvt4\" data-start=\"7028\" data-end=\"7072\">International Relations &amp; Policy Studies</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11g5t5e\" data-start=\"7073\" data-end=\"7096\">Teaching &amp; Academia</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The defence and security sector is rapidly growing, creating increasing opportunities for skilled professionals with knowledge of national security and strategic affairs.</p>\n<p data-start=\"7340\" data-end=\"7564\">Among the very few colleges offering this specialized program, we provide the B.A. in Defence &amp; Strategic Studies at one of the most affordable fee structures without compromising on quality education and practical exposure.Top-quality Defence &amp; Strategic Studies education at highly affordable fees &mdash; an opportunity unmatched by many institutes.</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2700\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #1713e2; background-color: #e03e2d;\">Fees:- 15,760 Every Year</span></strong></span></p>\n<hr />\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dr (Capt) Gaurang Rajwadkar</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Coordinator</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Department of Defence &amp; Strategic Studies</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Contact:- +91 8655060176, <span style=\"color: #1713e2;\">bos.defencencc@sathayecollege.edu.in</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong> Whatsapp Direct Link :- <span style=\"color: #1713e2;\"><a style=\"color: #1713e2;\" title=\"Whatsapp Group  Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EdVJx3oKBGoBqs9Mgzbru7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for More information</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> </strong></span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 449, '2026-05-11', 0),
