(4506, 114, 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>The department has its own maintained Departmental Library to encourage the culture of reading among students. It also helps the budding writers into their creative thinking and writing.&nbsp;</p>', '0', 0, 1, '', 192, '2025-09-23', 0),
