(4514, 114, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong><u>Library Report: </u></strong></p> <p><strong><u>Introduction: </u></strong></p> <p>The Department of Accountancy library is a valuable resource for students pursuing their Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) degree and Professional Cources like CA, ICWA, CS, MBA etc. The library provides access to a wide range of accounting and Taxation textbooks to support students&rsquo; academic success.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><u>Collection:</u></strong></p> <p>The library has a comprehensive collection of books, resources catering to the needs of F.Y.Bcom, S.Y.Bcom, and T.Y.Bcom students. The collection includes:</p> <p>- Textbooks: Latest editions of prescribed textbooks for all three years of the BCom program.</p> <p>- Reference Books: For CA, ICWA, CS, B.Com, M.Com</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><u>Conclusion:</u></strong></p> <p>The Department of Accountancy library is a vital resource for students pursuing their B.Com degree. The library&rsquo;s comprehensive collection support students\' academic success.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 224, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4515, 114, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>The <strong>College Library</strong> serves as a vital resource hub for students and faculty of the <strong>Department of Law</strong>, providing a wealth of materials to support academic and professional development. Designed to meet the needs of students pursuing the <strong>Business Law</strong> subject as part of the <strong>3-year Bachelor of Commerce (B.Com) program</strong>, the library offers a wide range of books, reference materials, legal resources, and other essential reading materials.</p>\n<hr />\n<h4>Key Features of the Library:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Extensive Collection of Books:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Comprehensive titles on <strong>Business Law</strong>, including textbooks, casebooks, and guides.</li>\n<li>Additional books covering related areas such as <strong>Contract Law</strong>, <strong>Corporate Law</strong>, <strong>Consumer Protection</strong>, and <strong>Intellectual Property Rights</strong>.</li>\n<li>Updated editions to ensure access to the latest legal developments.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Reference Materials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Encyclopedias, dictionaries, and handbooks related to law and business studies.</li>\n<li>Commentaries on significant legal acts and regulations.</li>\n<li>Study aids and preparatory materials for academic and professional exams.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Legal Resources:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Bare Acts</strong>: Copies of central and state laws for ready reference.</li>\n<li>Law reports and digests for case law research.</li>\n<li>Journals and periodicals providing insights into current legal issues and business trends.</li>\n<li>Access to online legal databases for advanced research (e.g., legal portals and e-journals).</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Newspapers and Current Affairs:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A dedicated section for <strong>daily newspapers</strong>, including financial and legal dailies, to help students stay updated with current developments in law, business, and governance.</li>\n<li>Weekly and monthly magazines focusing on commerce, law, and socio-economic topics.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>E-Resources and Digital Library Access:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Subscriptions to <strong>online legal platforms</strong> offering judgments, case laws, and statutes.</li>\n<li>E-books and digital archives available for convenient access anytime, anywhere.</li>\n<li>Wi-Fi-enabled reading zones for seamless use of digital resources.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Special Legal Materials:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Landmark case studies, legal precedents, and moot court guides.</li>\n<li>Research publications and reports by eminent legal scholars and institutions.</li>\n<li>Historical and international law materials for a broader perspective.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>User-Friendly Facilities:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Well-organized reading areas for individual study and group discussions.</li>\n<li>Assistance from professional librarians for locating and utilizing resources.</li>\n<li>Regular updates and displays of newly acquired books and journals.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<h4>Benefits for Students:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Comprehensive Support:</strong> Access to diverse resources ensures students gain a deep understanding of Business Law concepts and their practical applications.</li>\n<li><strong>Research and Preparation:</strong> Ideal for preparing assignments, projects, and competitive examinations.</li>\n<li><strong>Practical Insights:</strong> Resources like case studies and legal reports enhance critical thinking and problem-solving skills.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The College Library for the <strong>Department of Law</strong> stands as a testament to our commitment to academic excellence, ensuring that students and faculty have the resources they need to excel in their legal and business studies.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 214, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4516, 114, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span>The Departmental Library of the Commerce Department serves as a significant academic resource, supporting the teaching, learning, and research needs of students and faculty. The Departmental library is a rich collection of textbooks, reference books, journals, project reports, and periodicals related to various fields of commerce, such as entrepreneurship, finance, marketing, management,human resources, etc. Students and faculty members are encouraged to utilize the departmental library for assignments, research projects, and exam preparation. Regular updates and new additions ensure that the library remains current with emerging trends and knowledge in the field of commerce.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 392, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4517, 114, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
