(4521, 114, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Departmental Library:</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">In addition to the College library, the Department of Physics maintains its own well-curated departmental library, housing an excellent collection of physics books, including rare and classic editions. Students are actively encouraged to borrow books and retain them for extended periods to support their deeper learning and research interests.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The detailed catalog of our departmental library collection is available at the attached link. The number of books is doubled and the updation of list is in process.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Department-of-Physics-list-of-books.pdf\" title=\"List of the Books in the Physics Departmental Library \"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #236fa1;\">List of the Books in the Physics Departmental Library:</span></a></p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 211, '2025-09-23', 0),
