(4576, 52, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<section>Library plans its activities to realize college mission i.e.\n<ul class=\"list-home-programs\">\n<li>To foster strong disciplinary knowledge among students and teachers by aligning teaching&ndash;learning practices with the structured framework of the curriculum.</li>\n<li>To enhance students&rsquo; holistic skills and competencies through a wide range of extracurricular reading activities.</li>\n<li>To cultivate advanced reading and research abilities in learners by promoting information literacy and critical inquiry.</li>\n<li>To empower students to become self-directed learners and develop leadership qualities essential for their personal and academic growth.</li>\n</ul>\n</section>', '1', 0, 1, '', 2, '2026-02-24', 0),
