(4728, 58, 64, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div style=\"margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\">\n<div>\n<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Useful instructions for Library services are printed on the rear side of the Library Identity Card</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">\"Special Privilege Cards\" or \"Reading Club Cards\" for reading are available to regular and passed students based on recommendations and scrutiny of statistics.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Journals and magazines are issued to students in the Reading Hall for spot reading only. They should not be lent out (except for paid memberships).</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Sending reminders for books is not obligatory for the library.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">No reader should take material out of the library without proper issuance.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Books drawn on lost cards remain the sole responsibility of the borrower. Lost cards must be reported immediately.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">For refund of Caution Money, students must submit library tickets with the application.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">Regular students should retain library cards until membership renewal next year.</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #b30000;\">Books returned late during examination periods will call for a heavy fine.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>', '0', 0, 0, '', 2, '2026-08-06', 0),
