(4744, 120, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Report of World Commerce Day</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/World-Commerce-Day-Pic.png\" width=\"388\" height=\"231\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/World-Commerce-Day-23-24.pdf\" title=\"Report on World Commerce Day\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/World-Commerce-Day-23-24.pdf</a></p>\n<p>Report on Ad-imagination</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/ad-imagination-01-pic.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"372\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/AD-MAGINATION-MARATHON.pdf\" title=\"Report on Ad-imagination \">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/AD-MAGINATION-MARATHON.pdf</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Report on vanijyaustav</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Vaanjyotsatav-23-24-pic-01.jpg\" width=\"520\" height=\"352\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Report-on-Vaanijya-Utsav.pdf\" title=\"Report on vanijyaustov\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Report-on-Vaanijya-Utsav.pdf</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>ACADEMIC YEAR 2023-2024-</p>\n<p>Report on Advance Career Opportunities in Financial Markets,</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Career-Opoortunities-in-fin-market-pic-01.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"304\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p>Report on Advance Career Opportunities in Financial Markets,</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Advanced-Career-Opportunities-in-Financial-Market-(1).pdf\" title=\"Advanced Career Opportunities in Financial-Market\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Advanced-Career-Opportunities-in-Financial-Market-(1).pdf</a></p>\n<p>02.</p>\n<p>Career Opportunities in Banking Sector</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Career-opportunities-in-bankiong-sector.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"385\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Career-Opportunities-in-Banking-Sector-(1).pdf\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Career-Opportunities-in-Banking-Sector-(1).pdf</a></p>\n<p>03. Changing Landscape of Career in Finacial Market and Fintech Technology</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/changing-landscape-pic-01.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"289\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Changing-Landscape-of-Career-130723-(2).pdf\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Changing-Landscape-of-Career-130723-(2).pdf</a></p>\n<p>04. Legacy &amp; Leadership Nuturing Success in Family- Managed Business.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Legacy-and-Leadership-pic-01.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"285\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Legacy-and-leadership-pic-02.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"888\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Legacy-and-Leadership-Nurturing-Success-040823-(5).pdf\">https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Legacy-and-Leadership-Nurturing-Success-040823-(5).pdf</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/stock.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" /></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/event/a-guest-lecture-on-stock-market\"><u>A GUEST LECTURE ON STOCK MARKET</u></a></p>\n<p>by Mr. Nirmit R. N. Director of Nirmit Edusol</p>\n<p><a class=\"text-theme-color-2 font-12\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/event/a-guest-lecture-on-stock-market\"><u>View Gallery</u></a></p>\n<p><strong>Academic year 2022-23</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"list-items-pdf\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Website-Update-C0MMERCE-DEPARTMENT-d4a6ec15-3324-4068-a4db-f544c0d12c9d.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guest lecture on &ldquo;Stock Market &ndash; An overview and Career Prospects.&rdquo; on 12 th August, 2021</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/Website-Update.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guest lecture on &ldquo;Budget 2022-Amrit Kal.&rdquo; on 05th March, 2022</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1690607407-Guest-Lecture-On-&ldquo;RESUME-BUILDING&rdquo;---for-merge-9e507603-a14d-4bd7-8326-23fedb99d47f.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Guest Lecture On &ldquo;RESUME BUILDING&rdquo; On 20th of August, 2022.</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#\">lecture on opportunities in financial market 7th of October 2022, at 10:30 am</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#\">Industrial Visit at Jaipur 02nd February, 2023 to 07th February,2023</a></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 193, '2025-09-23', 0),
