(4821, 108, 355, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>I am an experienced lecturer in commerce with over five years of teaching expertise. Specializing in Business Policy &amp; Administration, Marketing, Consumer Behaviour, and Management subjects, brings both academic depth and practical insight to the classroom. Known for engaging teaching style and student-centered approach, emphasizes real-world applications through case studies and current industry trends. My dedication to mentoring and fostering critical thinking helps students grow academically and professionally.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 355, '2025-09-23', 0),
