(4838, 108, 356, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Mr. Omkar Ghodake</strong><br /><em>Assistant Professor, Department of Commerce</em></p>\n<p>I hold a Master of Commerce (M.Com) degree and have qualified the Maharashtra State Eligibility Test (M-SET). With over six years of teaching experience in the field of commerce, I am committed to delivering quality education and promoting academic growth among students.</p>\n<p><strong>Area of Interest:</strong> Marketing, Human Resource Management, Consumer Behaviour, Business Services</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 356, '2025-09-23', 0),
