(4872, 108, 358, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>A dedicated, passionate and versatile generalist having a broad skill set and diverse experiences in the field of Finance, Sales, Hospitality and Teaching. He also runs a financial firm, ensuring financial well being of his clients through efficient financial planning and risk management.&nbsp; He holds a Bachelor\'s Degree in Management Studies and his experties lies in finance and NCC studies. He has served in NCC during his academic years and had achieved the rank of SUO(Senior Under Officer) and holds \'B\' and \'C\' Certificates, thereby gaining knowledge on Indian Defense, leadership, Human Resource Management, Personality Development. He had been part of Rotaract Club of BKC as Secretary. His interest lies in engaging with students and young learners on the topic of NCC, Defense, Finance and Personality Development. Outside of his professional work, He enjoy reading, trekking and travelling.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 358, '2025-09-23', 0),
