(4890, 71, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. University Grants Commission (UGC) - National Eligibility Test for Assistant Professor (NET) - 30th Dec, 2021</p>\n<p>2. University Grants Commission (UGC) - National Eligibility Test for Assistant Professor (NET) - 30th Jult, 2020</p>\n<p>3. Maharashtra state eligibility test ( SET) - Savitribai Phule Pune University - 2013</p>\n<p>4. Bhartiya Vidya Bhavan Gandhi Institute of Computer Education &amp; Information Technology - Accounts Assistant Course</p>\n<p>( Computer basics / Windows / MS Word, MS Excel / Computerised Practical Accounting with Tally 7.2 )</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4891, 73, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Contribution in College administration&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Member, IQAC Sub- Committee for the Academic Year 2025-26, Dr. K. S. Bhosale - Incharge, Attributes - Governance and Administration (PROCESS)</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Member, Career Guidance and Placement Cell, Shri. Subhash Bansode -Co-ordinator</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>सदस्य, साठे महाविद्यालय (स्वायत्त) हिंदी विभाग, एवं दक्षिण मध्य क्षेत्र सांस्कृतिक केंद्र नागपूर, संस्कृती मंत्रालय भारत सरकार, साहित्यिक सांस्कृतिक शोध संस्था मुंबई के संयुक्त तत्वावधान मैं आयोजित द्वि-दिवसीय राष्ट्रीय संगोष्ठी २८ एवं २९ मार्च २०२५ पारंपरिक कलाओ मैं रोजगार की संभावना, समनव्यक प्रो.डॉ.पी.के. सिंग,</p>\n<p>सह-समनव्यक प्रो.डॉ.एस.डी. सोनवणे,</p>\n<p>सदस्य, स्वागत समिती</p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4892, 75, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>One beautiful year of Experience in Teaching Field &amp; Many more to go..</p>\n<p>A journey filled with growth, discovery, and profound connections. This year of teaching has been nothing short of transformative, a vibrant tapestry woven with the threads of curiosity, resilience, and inspiration. Each day unfolded like a blank canvas, waiting for the brushstrokes of shared knowledge and vibrant discussions.</p>\n<p>I witnessed the spark of understanding light up in the eyes of my students, iluminating the path of learning.</p>\n<p>Beyond the curriculum, i learned invaluable lessons in patience, empathy, and the boundless potential of human connection.</p>\n<p>I look forward to embarking on new adventures in teaching, armed with the wisdom gained from the vibrant tapestry of this remarkable year.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
