(4895, 78, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol> <li>CHEMBUR TROMBAY EDUCATION SOCIETY\'S N.G.ACHARYA &amp; D.K. MARATHE COLLEGE, OF ARTS, SCIENCE &amp; COMMERCE. CERTIFICATE OF Participation paper titled Contemporary Instructional Reforms in Higher Education, one day multidisciplinary International Conference on 23rd April, 2025. \"Media &amp; Management In the Digital Age: Innovations, Challenges &amp; Future Prospects\" Organised by Dept of Media &amp; Management Studies in Collaboration with Internal Quality Assurance Cell (IQAC).</li> </ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
