(4900, 96, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1.Smt. P.N. Doshi Women\'s College, Dept of Post Graduate Studies &amp; Research, S.ND.T. Women\'s University certify that Two Day Workshop on NET/SET in Commerce organized jointly by the P.G. Department of Commerce, SNDT Women\'s University and the Commerce Teachers Association, Mumbai.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>2.PTVA\'s SATHAYE COLLEGE (autonomous) certify Shri. Sukhadev Pandhare, Dept of Accoutancy successfuly completed Faculty Development Programme on Flipped Learning organised by Sathaye College (Autonomous) from 16th Jan 2025 to 6th March 2025.&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>3. TOLANI COLLEGE OF COMMERCE (AUTONOMOUS) MUMBAI NAAC Re- Accredited with A Grade CERTIFICATE&nbsp;of Participation in the one-day National Level Faculty Develpoment Programme held on 14th July 2025 on the topic of Forensic Accounting &amp; Fraud Examination : A Comparative study with Traditional Auditing.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>4. Nirmala Meorial Foundation College of Commerce and Science (Autonomous) , Mumbai In Collaboration with Vivek Education Society\'s Vivek College of Commerce (Autonomous) , Mumbai Presents CERTIFICATE OF PARTICIPATION in National Level Webinar on Research Methodology titled \" From Curiosity to Contribution : The Story of Meaningful Research \" organised by Research Cell of Nirmala Memorial Foundation College of Commerce and Science (Autonomous) in association with Research Cell of Vivek Education Society\'s Vivek College of Commerce (Autonomous) on Saturday, 19th July, 2025.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>5. BALBHARTI\'s MEGHANMAL J. PANCHOLIA COLLEGE OF COMMERCE, participated in the one week online National Level Faculty Development Program on \"EMPOWERING EDUCATORS: FIELD- BASED PROJECT IMPLEMENTATION IN UNDERGRADUATE CURRICULUM AS PER NEP-2020 GUIDELINES\" permanently affiliated to the University of Mumbai &amp; NAAC Re-accredited with grade-B in collaboration with Nucleus of Learning &amp; Development from 21 to 26 July 2025.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>6. Tilak Education Society\'s J.K. COLLEGE of SCIENCE AND COMMERCE (Autonomous) In Collaboration with BHAVNA TRUST JUNIOR &amp; DEGREE COLLEGE OF COMMERCE &amp; SCIENCE In Association with IQAC Cluster India CERTIFICATE OF PARTICIPATION completed a National Level FDP on \"Enhancing Academic Excellence: A 2-Day FDP on the New NAAC Framework\" on 28th and 29th July.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4901, 97, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4902, 98, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>PTVA\'s SATHAYE COLLEGE (AUTONOMOUS)</p>\n<p>Dept of Accountancy has successfully completed Faculty Development Programme on \"Flipped Learning\" organised by Sathaye College (Autonomous) from 16th Jan 2025 to 6th March 2025.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
(4903, 103, 360, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span>Speacialied in the subject of Advanced Accoutancy, Financial Management, Cost &amp; Management&nbsp; Accounting, Auditing &amp; Taxation.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 360, '2025-09-23', 0),
