(4940, 108, 365, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span>I am a passionate and dedicated<strong> Psychology educator and counselor</strong>. With experience in both teaching and providing mental health support, I strive to create an engaging and supportive environment for my students. As an active member of the Board of Studies for B.A. Psychology under NEP 2020, I continuously work towards enhancing the academic experience. My approach blends innovative teaching methods with empathetic counseling, aiming to nurture both the minds and well-being of those I work with.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 365, '2025-09-23', 0),
