(4965, 122, 26, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1.&nbsp;Concept of Choice from the Perspective of Determinism, Fatalism and Existentialism, <strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">Kimaya Gonbare TYBA 2023</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. <span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\"><strong>Mr Ritesh Pal TYBA Philosophy 2024-25</strong></span><br />The Department of Philosophy encouraged one of its advanced learners, Riteshkumar Pal, to participate in the <em>4th Research Fledgling Research Programme</em> organized by the college on 22nd February 2025.</p>\n<p>Under the guidance of Ms. Sampada Chawan, the student actively engaged in the research process and presented his work entitled- &ldquo;From Absurdity to Liberation: Exploring the Transformaive power of Art&rdquo; as part of the programme. The initiative aimed at fostering research aptitude, critical inquiry, and academic confidence among undergraduate students.</p>\n<p>The department&rsquo;s support for participation in such research activities reflects its commitment to nurturing advanced learners and promoting a culture of research and academic excellence.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 262, '2026-02-23', 0),
