(4999, 123, 19, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong>Attended Workshop, Conference and Seminar by Faculty&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Dr. Pratibha S. Kamble, HoD, Department of Economics</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p>Participated in the One Day Workshop on the 21st Aavishkar Inter Collegiate/Institute/Department Research Convention 2026&ndash;27, organised by the University of Mumbai on 22 July 2026.</p>\n<p>Attended the Seminar On &lsquo;Recent Techniques In Applied Statistics&rsquo; Held On Department Of Statistics, University Of Mumbai On 5 March 2016.</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated in the two day Zonal Workshop on &ldquo;Sexual Harassment of Women at Workplace Act 2013, and related issues jointly organized by Women Development Cell, University of Mumbai and K.P.B. Hinduja College of Commerce on 7-8 September 2015.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated as the Discussant in the International conference on &ldquo;Critical Race Theory and Critical Dalit Studies: Understating Segregation. Exclusion Intersectionality and the Narratives of Struggle&rdquo; organized by Dr.Ambedkar Centre for Social Justice, Phule-Ambedkar Chair, University of Mumbai and Indiana University, USA on 25-26 June 2015.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated in the Seminar on &ldquo;Status of Social Science Research in Western India: Critical Engagement and Future Direction&rdquo; from 14-16 November, 2014.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated in the Two-Day Workshop on &ldquo;Capacity Building on Gender Sensitization&rdquo; focusing on violence against Women, organized by Women Development Cell, University of Mumbai on 12 and 13 July 2013.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated in two days conference on &ldquo;Wealth of India&rdquo; organized by NISSECT at Town Hall, Thane on 23 and 24 March, 2013.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Participated in the National seminar organized by the IQAC of R.A.Podar College of Commerce and Economics on 7-8 September, 2012.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Attended Census 2011 data dissemination workshop conducted by SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Santacruz, Mumbai on 25 March, 2013.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Worked as Organizing Committee Member and attended the lecture by Helen Pennant, Director, Cambridge Commonwealth, European and International Trust, on the University of Cambridge via The Cambridge Trust: Scholarship Opportunities at Department of History, University of Mumbai on 15 September 2015.</li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Worked as Organizing Committee Member of UGC sponsored One Day National Conference organised by Department of Political Science, Economics, Geography and Sociology, at Sathaye College, Mumbai on Contemporary Debate on Urbanization, on 5 August, 2015.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Mr. O. I. Vasave (Assistant Professor)</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Attended National Conference on &ldquo;Emerging Trends in Mathematics, Statistics and Applications&rdquo; on 28th April 2026 (10.30 a.m. to 4.30 p.m.) organized by the Departments of Mathematics &amp; Statistics of N.S.S. College of Commerce &amp; Economics, Mumbai and Sheth NKTT College, Thane, Maharashtra. We appreciate her active participation.</li>\n<li>Participated in the One-Day National E-Conference on &lsquo;Global Challenges and Multidisciplinary Approaches in the Contemporary World&rsquo; (GCMACW 2026), organized by Dr. Shantilal Dhanji Devsey Arts, Commerce and Science College, Wada, Palghar, on 15th April 2026.</li>\n<li>Participated in Faculty Development Programme on \'Flipped Learning\' organized by Sathaye College (Autonomous) from 16th January to 6th March, 2025.</li>\n<li>Participated in one day state level conference on \"Intellectual Property Rights\" organised by Internal Quality Assurance Cell PTVA\'S Sathaye College</li>\n<li>Participated in the National seminar on \"Tribes in transition: Issues and Challenges in the Era of Globalisation organised by the department of Sociology University of Mumbai vidyanagari Santacruz East MumbaI on 19th and 20th&nbsp; January 2017.</li>\n<li>Worked as Organizing Committee Member of UGC sponsored One Day National Conference organised by Department of Political Science, Economics, Geography and Sociology, at Sathaye College, Mumbai on Contemporary Debate on Urbanization, on 5 August, 2015.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Workshop organised for Students By Department of&nbsp; Economics</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/index.php/Five-Day%20Research%20Methodology%20Workshop%20on%20the%20theme%20&ldquo;Building%20Strong%20Research%20Foundations%20through%20Methodological%20Excellence\"><strong>Five-Day Research Methodology Workshop on the theme &ldquo;Building Strong Research Foundations through Methodological Excellence</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15kOds7axKwhd9hgDUR5OCbyO3GYZcA-t/view?usp=sharing\">WORKSHOP FOR R PROGRAMMING</a>&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JZ3pLxMC7gI4LM0F3C6akq4Pg_N1aER_/view?usp=sharing\">WORKSHOP FOR RESEARCH METHODOLY&nbsp;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1y_G_57v7Hy5CaNE5kGzFGfjeUf29vtTa/view?usp=sharing\">VSC Data Analysis Workshop</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eUv3owV6bNMu5hrqugVB2hmCx5H_ACQN/view?usp=sharing\">SEMINAR ON RANDOMISED CONTROLLED TRIALS AND NATURAL&nbsp;</a><br /><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eUv3owV6bNMu5hrqugVB2hmCx5H_ACQN/view?usp=sharing\">EXPERIMENTS.&nbsp;</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WJFWn4MklNNmXgLA8UA_yb61SFkJBxIa/view?usp=sharing\">Webinar on Roadmap for Economics Graduates&nbsp;</a></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 248, '2026-09-28', 0),
