ference on Biodiversity, Conservation and Role of Molecular Phylogenetics in Plant Systematic-2022 at Rayat Shikshan Sanstha&rsquo;s, Arts, Science &amp; Commerce College, Mokhada, Palghar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.54671%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">2</td>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0455%; height: 36px;\">\n<p>Studies on <em>Capparis grandis</em> L.f. : A medicinal and nutritional plant.</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7019%; height: 36px;\">Internation conference on Current trends in Sustainable development at Patkar-Varde College, Goregaon (West)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.54671%; height: 18px; text-align: center;\">3</td>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0455%; height: 18px;\">\n<p>Phytochemical analysis of <em>Capparis grandis</em> L.f.&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7019%; height: 18px;\">Internation conference on Current trends in Sustainable development at Patkar-Varde College, Goregaon (West)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.54671%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">4</td>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0455%; height: 36px;\">\n<p>Qualitative phytochemical analysis &amp; TLC fingerprinting of leaves of <em>Murrya Paniculata</em> (L.) JACK</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7019%; height: 36px;\">Dubai International conference on Human Health, Plant Science &amp; Sustainability&nbsp; (ICHHPSS-2025)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 3.54671%; height: 36px; text-align: center;\">5</td>\n<td style=\"width: 22.0455%; height: 36px;\">\n<p>Assessment of Plant Biodiversity in Mokhada, Palghar district, Maharashtra</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 23.7019%; height: 36px;\">International conference on Advances in Life Sciences, Biodiversity and Conservation at Shri Sadguru Gangageer Maharaj Science, Gautam Arts and Sanjivani Commerce College, Kopargaon, Ahilyanagar</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 369, '2025-09-23'