(5118, 108, 371, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Currently working as Assistant Professor, Department of Mathematics, PTVA\'s Sathaye College(Autonomous) , &nbsp;Mumbai , Maharashtra . I did my M.Sc. from University of Mumbai. I Love and enjoy Teaching as we get chance to interact with young minds. Some of my teachers played a crucial role in shaping my career and I always try to do that as a teacher and motivate students to think independently. I have learned many things as a teacher and try to learn new things whenever possible.</p>\n<p><span>I also promote Open Source Software in education through workshops and training programs. You can reach me at&nbsp; rmpathakmaths@gmail.com</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 371, '2025-09-23', 0),
