(5367, 95, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Contributed a chapter in a book on&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\"Gender Inequality, Dowry/Domestic violence.\",</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Substance Abuse, Corruption, Cybercrime, Sexual Violence/Human Trafficking.</li>\r\n<li>Child Labour, Poverty, Illiteracy&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Presented a research Paper on topic&nbsp; \"Teaching and learning in government schools of Mumbai\" at ISS during the 50th All India Sociological Conference, 2025 on Mobilities and Inequalities: Shifting Contexts: Changing Paradigms held&nbsp; at SRM University - AP, Amravati during 28th December 2025 to 30th December 2025.&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 384, '2025-09-23', 0),
