(5385, 126, 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">ADD-ON COURSE SANSKRIT</span></strong></p>\n<p>Certificate Course on \'<strong>LEARNING SANSKRIT AS A SECOND LANGUAGE</strong>\'</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Course Objectives:</span> </strong></p>\n<p>To learn Sanskrit Language with constructie approach. Course focuses on language skills viz. Listening, Speaking, Reading &amp; Writing in Sanskrit.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"><strong>Course Duration:</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> 30 Hours</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Fee Structure:</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sathaye College Students - Rs. 700</li>\n<li>For students other than Sathaye College - Rs. 1000</li>\n<li>Others: Rs. 2000</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">Detail Course Structure &amp; Syllabus:</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16gH9lbiCK8kV32h-4NgbnZhRT2sOJQTx/view?usp=sharing\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/16gH9lbiCK8kV32h-4NgbnZhRT2sOJQTx/view?usp=sharing</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 156, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5386, 126, 30, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Add on -courses Syllabus 2025-2026</p>\n<p>Gender and Law&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/genderandlaw/home\" title=\"Gender and Law\">https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/genderandlaw/home</a></p>\n<p>Film Appreciation&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/adoncourse/home\" title=\"Syllabus of Film appreciation\">https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/adoncourse/home</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 372, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5387, 126, 31, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Add-on courses offer significant benefits, providing specialized skills and knowledge beyond the standard curriculum. This focused learning can make you more competitive in the job market by showing initiative and commitment to ongoing education in a specific field. Furthermore, students from different academic streams who have an interest in these add-on courses can also join and gain valuable knowledge in a new field.</p>\n<p>Below courses can open up new career paths allowing you to specialize in your chosen field. They equip you with practical skills and industry knowledge, making you a valuable asset to potential employers.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Communication Skills</li>\n<li>Writing Skills for Media</li>\n<li>Digital Media Journalism</li>\n<li>Ad Film Making</li>\n<li>Short Film Making</li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 165, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5388, 126, 32, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Add on Course on Tally Prime Software&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 173, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5389, 126, 33, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Business Law</p>', '0', 0, 1, '', 2, '2026-05-11', 0),
(5390, 126, 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Add-on Course Offered by the Department of Commerce</strong><br /><strong>Course Title: Share Market &ndash; Technical and Fundamental Analysis</strong></p>\n<p>The Department of Commerce is proud to offer an enriching <em>Add-on Course</em> titled <strong>&ldquo;Share Market: Technical and Fundamental Analysis.&rdquo;</strong> Designed to cater to students across all faculties, this interdisciplinary course empowers learners with essential skills and knowledge to navigate and analyze the dynamic world of financial markets.</p>\n<p>Whether you\'re from Arts, Science, or Commerce, this course provides a practical foundation in understanding the stock market, focusing on both <strong>technical</strong> indicators and <strong>fundamental</strong> valuation methods. Students will gain insights into price trends, financial ratios, chart patterns, and market behavior&mdash;skills crucial for personal investment decisions and careers in finance.</p>\n<p>Open to all faculty students, this course adds value to your academic journey and enhances your financial literacy, making you better equipped for the real-world economy.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1jXuvl9l0EIjXQ8tKTP90AEfA0MT5qJtl/view?usp=drive_link\">Add-On Course Syllabus Link</a></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 391, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5391, 126, 35, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>BMS Department gives following Add On Courses:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Advanced Excel &amp; Dashboarding.</li>\n<li>Office Applications</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 404, '2025-09-23', 0),
