(5394, 126, 39, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"61\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"61\">Add-on Courses:</strong></span></p>\n<ol data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"240\">\n<li data-section-id=\"dn34tk\" data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"130\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"66\" data-end=\"116\">Development and Applications of Biofertilizers</strong> &ndash; 4 Credits &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776258876-Certificate-Course-I-Development-and-Applications-of-Biofertilizers.docx.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here For Syllabus</a></span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"cvn886\" data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"190\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"176\">Computational Biology &amp; Bioinformatics</strong> &ndash; 4 Credits &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1776258917-Certificate-Course-II-Computational-Biology-&amp;-Bioinformatics.docx.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here For Syllabus</a></span></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"i73j0y\" data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"240\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"226\">Food Nutrition and Dietetics</strong> &ndash; 2 Credits &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a style=\"color: #3598db;\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1745840117-Food-Nutrition-and-Dietetics---Add-On-Course-Dept-of-Microbiology.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click here For Syllabus</a></span></span></li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 305, '2026-04-15', 0),
(5395, 126, 40, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Department offers an Add-On Course namely <strong>Certificate Course in Electrical and Electronics Laboratory Equipment Repairs and Maintenance.</strong></p>\n<p>The objective of the course is to provide the skill of laboratory equipment repairing and maintenance, one can maintain his or her own laboratory or one can always become a service provider for repairing and maintenance of various laboratories in the market.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>This course is designed to expose participants to the techniques of maintenance and repair of electronic and electrical laboratory equipment involving the use of simple fault detection and diagnostic methods.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Students from any discipline (10th pass), science teachers, Laboratory assistants, Equipment suppliers can do this course.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>For more details about our Add-On course, please <span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #236fa1;\"><strong><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/add-on-phy-dept-sathayecollege/home\" title=\"Click here\">Click here</a>.</strong></span></span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #236fa1;\"><strong><img src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/a.PNG\" width=\"1302\" height=\"413\" alt=\"\" /></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/add-on-phy-dept-sathayecollege/home\"></a></p>\n<p></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 211, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5396, 126, 41, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Department of Statistics offers two Add-on Courses :</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/statistics-add-on-course-1/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Statistical Data Analysis Using MS-Excel-Basic</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Okhat_xu-ai968T6ojiAoMkH0Et3ZdBU/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">(Click for Syllabus )</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/sathayecollege.edu.in/add-on-course-ii-statistics/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Statistical Data Analysis Using MS-Excel-Advanced</a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PcrpNGlDdFiSrq1HLkWEtvSBTfOkC6Dv/view?usp=drive_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">(Click for Syllabus )</a></li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 183, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5397, 126, 43, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li><strong>Descriptive Statistics using Python</strong>&nbsp;\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Eligibility</strong>: Applicant should have passed Class Twelve from a recognized board&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Course Content</strong>:\n<ol>\n<li>Introduction to Data Analysis: Understanding nature of data, Data Analysis Process, Quantitative and Qualitative data analysis, Python and data analysis, SciPy</li>\n<li>The NumPy library: Introduction, Basic operations, Indexing, Slicing and iterating, Shape and Array manipulation, Reading and writing array data on files</li>\n<li>Pandas library: Introduction, Getting started with Pandas, Introduction to Pandas data structures, Reindexing, Dropping, Arithmetic and data alignment, Operation between data structures, Function Application and Mapping, Sorting and Ranking, Correlation and covariance, Not A Number data, Reading and writing data in file</li>\n<li>Data manipulation with Pandas: Data preparation, Concatenation and Data Transformation, Detecting and filtering outliers, String manipulation, Permutations, Data Aggregation, Group iteration, Advanced data aggregation</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Basic Data Science</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Eligibility</strong>: Applicant should have passed Class Twelve from a recognized board&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>Course Content:</strong>&nbsp;\n<ol>\n<li>Introduction to Data Science: Data Science: Overview and Terminology, Data Scientist: Role, Skill set and Job opportunities, Data science applications,</li>\n<li>Understanding the Statistics and Probability: Introduction to Descriptive and Inferential statistics, Measures of central tendency, Measures of variability, Central limit theorem and Normal distribution, Confidence Interval and error, Hypothesis testing, Probability Distributions, Probability types : Marginal, Joint and Conditional, Bayes Theorem</li>\n<li>Basics of Machine Learning: Introduction to Machine learning, Basics of model building: Training set and Test set, Supervised and Unsupervised learning models, Accuracy and Confusion matrix</li>\n<li>Implementation of machine learning models using Python: Python packages and libraries for model building and data analysis, Building simple supervised learning models to train and test using Python,&nbsp;Building unsupervised learning models using Python</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 328, '2025-10-16', 0),
