(5429, 108, 385, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"adn ads\" data-message-id=\"#msg-a:r3060037918876579470\" data-legacy-message-id=\"1967fc12a372adb3\">\n<div class=\"gs\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<div id=\":lq\" class=\"ii gt\" jslog=\"20277; u014N:xr6bB; 1:WyIjdGhyZWFkLWE6ci0yMDkzMjM3MDE1OTQ2MTI1NjY5Il0.; 4:WyIjbXNnLWE6cjMwNjAwMzc5MTg4NzY1Nzk0NzAiLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLDEsMCxbMSwwLDBdLDY4LDQwMSxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsMSxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCxudWxsLG51bGwsbnVsbCwwXQ..\">\n<div id=\":lp\" class=\"a3s aiL \">\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span>Ms. Hridaya Bhoir has completed a <strong>Master&rsquo;s degree in Economics</strong> and has further strengthened their expertise through a comprehensive course in Financial Modelling and Valuation. Currently <strong>pursuing a Ph.D. in Economics. <br /></strong>She<strong> </strong>is deeply committed to advancing academic research and contributing to the field. With two years of teaching experience, they bring both a strong foundation of knowledge and a genuine passion for Economics to the classroom, inspiring students and fostering a dynamic learning environment.</span></p>\n<br />\n<div>\n<div class=\"adL\"></div>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"adL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"adL\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"adL\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"WhmR8e\" data-hash=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ajx\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gA gt acV\">\n<div class=\"gB xu\" jslog=\"184332; u014N:xr6bB;\">\n<div class=\"mVCoBd\"></div>\n<div class=\"ip iq\">\n<div id=\":lr\">\n<table class=\"cf wS\" role=\"presentation\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"amq\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLtbbrqrd7fdMgEIiI-tbLZhRWQG7EcqjHy1g_l1hxRSQ2DKA=s40-p-mo\" jid=\"hridaya.bhoir@sathayecollege.edu.in\" data-hovercard-id=\"hridaya.bhoir@sathayecollege.edu.in\" class=\"ajn bofPge\" /></td>\n<td class=\"amr\">\n<div cl