(5446, 108, 386, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p data-start=\"110\" data-end=\"567\" class=\"\">A dedicated and qualified educator with a Master&rsquo;s degree in Economics and over 3 years of teaching experience at the undergraduate level. Demonstrated expertise in economic theory, quantitative analysis, and academic instruction. Successfully qualified the Maharashtra State Eligibility Test (MH-SET), showcasing strong subject knowledge and commitment to academic excellence. Adept at creating engaging learning environments and fostering student success.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 386, '2025-09-23', 0),
