;\"><strong data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1351\">Research Assistant</strong>, DST-PURSE-II Project, Department of Microbiology, Shivaji University, Kolhapur</span><br data-start=\"1431\" data-end=\"1434\" /><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><em data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1480\">(Dec 2019 &ndash; Nov 2020; Mar 2021 &ndash; Oct 2021)</em></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5553, 76, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li data-start=\"119\" data-end=\"382\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"121\" data-end=\"382\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Delivered an <strong data-start=\"134\" data-end=\"150\">invited talk</strong> on <em data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"209\">\"Use of Microorganisms in Recycling Biological Waste\"</em> during the workshop <em data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"282\">\"Recycling of Biological Waste by Vermicomposting\"</em>, organized by the Department of Microbiology, Rajaram College, Kolhapur, on <strong data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"381\">10th February 2020</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"598\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p data-start=\"386\" data-end=\"598\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Delivered <strong data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"414\">guest lectures</strong> for M.Sc. students under the <em data-start=\"444\" data-end=\"515\">\"Value Added Course: Development and Applications of Bio-fertilizers\"</em>, organized by the Department of Microbiology during the academic year <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"597\">2021&ndash;22</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"782\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"782\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Delivered a <strong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"631\">guest lecture</strong> in the short-term course <em data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"701\">\"Computational Biology and Bioinformatics\"</em> at S. M. Joshi College, Hadapsar, Pune, held from <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"781\">2nd to 10th February 2022</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"784\" data-end=\"968\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<p data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"968\" class=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Delivered a <strong data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"815\">guest lecture</strong> on <em data-start=\"819\" data-end=\"882\">\"Career Opportunities in Microbiology and Microbial Sciences\"</em> under the <em data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"916\">Lead College Activity</em> at Balwant College, Vita, on <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"967\">1st February 2024</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1184\" class=\"\">\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1184\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Delivered <strong data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1000\">guest lectures</strong> for M.Sc. students under the <em data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1101\">\"Value Added Course: Development and Applications of Bio-fertilizers\"</em>, organized by the Department of Microbiology during the academic year <strong data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1183\">2023&ndash;24</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
