(5560, 96, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Participated in and successfully completed the <strong>IP Awareness/Training Program</strong> under the <em>National Intellectual Property Awareness Mission</em>, organized by the <strong>Intellectual Property Office, India</strong>, held on <strong>27th February 2023</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Participated in and successfully completed the <strong>Workshop cum Hands-on Training on &ldquo;Techniques on Biogenic Synthesis of Nanomaterials&rdquo;</strong>, jointly organized by the <strong>School of Nanoscience and Biotechnology</strong>, <strong>Department of Biochemistry</strong>, and <strong>Department of Botany</strong> under the <strong>DBT-BUILDER SUK Programme</strong>, held from <strong>20th to 24th February 2023</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Participated in and successfully completed the <strong>Hands-on Training Program on &ldquo;Formulation Development Aspects of Nanotechnology-based Drug Delivery Systems&rdquo;</strong>, organized under the <strong>DST-STUTI Program</strong>, <strong>Department of Science and Technology</strong>, Government of India, held from <strong>18th to 24th August 2022</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Successfully completed the <strong>Online Course on &ldquo;Basics of High Performance Computing&rdquo;</strong>, jointly conducted by IIT Kharagpur, IIT Madras, IIT Goa, and IIT Palakkad under the aegis of the <strong>National Supercomputing Mission, India</strong>, from <strong>November 2020 to February 2021</strong>.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Workshop on \"Awareness about Sharing R &amp; D Resource through I-STEM Portal\"<br /></strong>Organized by SAIF-DST Centre, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, on 5th August 2022.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>Workshop on \"Research as Career: Opportunities Abroad and Associated Preparations\"<br /></strong>Jointly organized by the International Affairs Cell (IAC) and Department of Chemistry, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, under SUGAR and UGC-STRIDE, on 13th February 2021.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>One-Day National Workshop on \"Intellectual Property Rights\"<br /></strong>Organized by Y.C. College of Science, Karad, on 27th December 2019.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>One-Day Workshop on New Changed Syllabus (CBCS) for B.Sc.-I (Sem-I) Microbiology<br /></strong>Organized by Y.C. College of Science, Karad, on 14th August 2018.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>&lsquo;Avishkar-2016-17&rsquo; Research Project Competition<br /></strong>University Level (Central), held at Yashwantrao Chavan School of Rural Development, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, in the Medicine and Pharmacy (Teacher) category on 28th December 2016.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>One-Day National Level Competition on Biological Sciences (BioComp-2015)<br /></strong>Organized by the Department of Microbiology, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, on 30th January 2015.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><strong>102nd Indian Science Congress International Conference<br /></strong>Held at the University of Mumbai, from 3rd to 7th January 2015.</span></li>\r\n</ol>', '0', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0);
