" data-end=\"4076\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Naik, N. M., et al. <strong>(2024). </strong>Exploring Triazole-Based Co (II), Ni (II) and Cu (II) Complexes as Biologically Potent Molecules: Chemical Synthesis, Structural Elucidation and Molecular Docking Studies. <strong><em data-start=\"3941\" data-end=\"3989\">Computational &amp; Theoretical Chemistry eJournal</em>,</strong> 1-31. ISSN: 2210-2728 (Online), ISSN: 2210-271X (Print).</span><br data-start=\"4047\" data-end=\"4050\" /><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Impact Factor: 3.0.</span></strong></p>\n</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5562, 98, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li>\n<p data-start=\"82\" data-end=\"256\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Successfully completed the <strong data-start=\"109\" data-end=\"140\">Faculty Development Program</strong> on <em data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"164\">\"Flipped Learning\"</em> organized by <strong data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"210\">Sathaye College (Autonomous)</strong> from <strong data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"255\">16th January 2025 to 6th March 2025</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Successfully completed the <strong>MS-DEED Level 1 </strong>Online Workshop on <em>\"Introduction to Innovative Pedagogies for College Teachers\" &nbsp;</em>conducted by<em> </em><strong>IISER Pune</strong> from <strong>14th to 16th of September 2022.</strong> <br /></span></li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5563, 103, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><b>Microbial Metabolism and Physiology</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: In-depth study of bacterial metabolism and its implications in health and disease, particularly in neurodegenerative diseases like Alzheimer\'s.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /><br /></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><b>Antimicrobial Peptides and Natural Products</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Research on the identification, characterization, and potential applications of antimicrobial peptides and other bioactive metabolites produced by microorganisms.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /><br /></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><b>Nanobiotechnology</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Expertise in the biosynthesis of nanoparticles and their synergistic effects with bacterial metabolites for therapeutic applications, including the clearance of amyloid-beta peptides.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br /><br /></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><b>Bioinformatics</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Expertise in the computational techniques such as homology modeling, molecular docking, and molecular dynamics simulations to understand biomolecular interactions and their relevance to disease mechanisms.</span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><b>Microbial Ecology in Disease</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Studying the role of microorganisms in the pathogenesis of diseases, particularly Alzheimer\'s disease, and their impact on human health.</span></span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5564, 104, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>02/01/2025</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5565, 107, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Google Scholar</strong>:<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=a-iRUzQAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\"> </a><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=a-iRUzQAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\"> Nitin Maruti Naik</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>ResearchGate</strong>:<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Nitin-Naik-4\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Nitin-Naik-4\">Nitin M. Naik</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif;\"><b>ORCID:</b> <a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2196-1527\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: blue;\">0000-0002-2196-1527</span></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\"><span style=\"color: blue;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><b>Scopus:</b> </span><a href=\"https://www.scopus.com/hirsch/author.uri?accessor=authorProfile&amp;auidList=57221347838&amp;origin=AuthorProfile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"font-family: \'book antiqua\', palatino, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Profile Link</span></a></span></span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5566, 108, 405, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"471\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\"><em>Assistant Professor, Research Scholar, and Explorer in Microbiology</em></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"471\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Mr. Nitin Maruti Naik is an<strong> </strong>Assistant Professor in the Department of Microbiology at Sathaye College, Mumbai. He is currently pursuing his Ph.D. at the Department of Microbiology, Shivaji University, Kolhapur, focusing on the role of bacteria and their metabolites involved in Alzheimer&rsquo;s disease.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"907\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">With a strong foundation in microbiological research and teaching, Mr. Naik has accumulated over 04 years of undergraduate teaching experience, 05 years at the postgraduate level, and 06 years of research work. His research areas include microbial involvement in neurodegenerative diseases, antimicrobial peptides,&nbsp; nanoparticle biosynthesis &amp; bioinformatics.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1259\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">He has actively participated in various national workshops and conferences and holds a <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">design patent</span> for a \'Portable CRISPR Pathogen Detection Device\' granted by the Indian Patent Office. Mr. Naik is committed to fostering scientific curiosity, research skills, and ethical values among students through active mentorship and academic innovation. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"1259\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">H</span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">e continues to work towards impactful contributions in the fields of microbiology and Bioinformatics Research.</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 405, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5567, 71, 413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div dir=\"auto\">\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Teaching and Academic Achievements</strong></span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Curriculum and Exam Development:</span> Active BOS Member, Developed comprehensive lesson plans and set examination papers for BA and BCom Psychology courses at Sathaye College.</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Guided Undergraduate Research:</span> Successfully mentored SYBA students in conducting and presenting a qualitative research project on attachment styles in adolescents.</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Training:</span> Completed Faculty Development Program on \"Flipped Learning\"</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Certified Career Counselor</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><strong>Industry Experience:</strong><strong></strong></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Counseled 900+ Individuals</span>: Conducted over 900 one-on-one counseling sessions with women in urban slum communities, contributing to their emotional and personal development.</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Led Mental Health Awareness for 1500+ Women:</span> Designed and facilitated large-scale awareness programs on mental health, aspiration building, and physical well-being.</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Program Coordination and Training:</span> Led center-level operations at Myna Mahila Foundation, including training of trainers, data analysis, stakeholder coordination, and proposal writing.</span></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Multilingual Communication:</span> Effectively conducted counseling and educational sessions in English, Hindi, and Marathi, ensuring accessibility across diverse populations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 413, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5568, 73, 413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li data-start=\"215\" data-end=\"320\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Designed and planned syllabi for undergraduate psychology courses, incorporating varied teaching methods.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"439\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Developed examination papers aligned with course objectives to evaluate critical thinking and subject understanding.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"442\" data-end=\"562\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Assessed student performance through exams, quizzes, assignments, and projects with detailed feedback and documentation.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"565\" data-end=\"662\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Served on the organizing committee for departmental fests, managing event planning and execution.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"665\" data-end=\"805\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Maintained accurate student records including attendance, assignments, and academic performance in accordance with institutional guidelines.</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"930\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Conducted regular mentor-mentee sessions, guiding students on academic development, career planning, and study strategies.</span></li>\n</ul>', '1', 0, 1, '', 413, '2025-09-23', 0),
(5569, 75, 413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Academic Teaching: 2 years</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Industry Experience: 4 years</span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 413, '2025-09-23', 0),
