(5583, 108, 413, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino, serif;\">Hi! I&rsquo;m a <strong>Counseling Psychologist</strong>, <strong>Certified Career Counselor</strong> and <strong>Lecturer </strong>at Sathaye College. I&rsquo;ve spent the last couple of years doing what I love&mdash;working closely with people (children, adolescents, adults) especially women from underserved communities, through 1:1 counseling and mental health awareness sessions. I also teach a variety of psychology subjects across levels and enjoy mentoring students, creating engaging content, and being part of college events and initiatives. Hope to see you all soon :)</span></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 413, '2025-09-23', 0),
