(5675, 79, 426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Ongoing research on&nbsp;<em>Quasinormal Modes in f(R) Gravity&nbsp;</em>along with Dr. Amruta Sadhu.</p>\n<p>Also involved in research projects with students of S.Y.B.Sc. and T.Y.B.Sc. on the topic of&nbsp;<em>Stellarium based Study of Precession of Equinox.</em></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 426, '2025-09-23', 0),
