(5681, 98, 426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Successfully completed Faculty Development Programme on&nbsp;<strong><em>Flipped Learning&nbsp;</em></strong>organized by Sathaye College (Autonomous) from 16<sup>th</sup> January 2025 to 6<sup>th</sup> March 2025<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 426, '2025-09-23', 0),
