(5855, 108, 448, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>I am deeply committed to the field of education, where teaching serves as a source of inspiration and fulfillment for me. Research remains my core academic interest, continuously driving my pursuit of knowledge and innovation. I take great pleasure in engaging students with subjects such as Cell Biology, Molecular Biology, Genetics, Immunology, and Animal Physiology. These areas not only inspire my academic curiosity but also allow me to foster critical thinking and scientific inquiry in the classroom.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 448, '2025-09-23', 0),
