(6058, 130, 337, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ol>\n<li>Significance of Mangroves<br />Name of Conference: Online International conference on Climate Change, Mangroves and Sustainable Management<br />Level: International<br />Period: 24/04/2020<br />Name of Organizers: IQAC &amp; PG-Department of Botany of Shri Pancham Khemraj Mahavidyalaya, Sawantwadi, (MS) University of Mumbai, Mangrove Society of India &amp; Sahyadri Botanical Society, Kolhapur&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Study of antibacterial activity of the extracts of <em>Pedilanthus tithymaloides</em> (Linn.) Poit., <em>Kirganelia </em><em>reticulata</em> (Poir) Baill. and <em>Homonoia riparia</em> Lour.<br />Co Author :Trupti R. Mhadnak, Ujwala C. Bapat<br />Name of Conference :National conference on Plant Sciences<br />Level :National<br />Period :07/02/2013-08/02/2013<br />Name of Organizers :Department of Botany, Parvatibai Chowgule College of Arts and Science, Margoa, Goa</li>\n<li>Antimicrobial activity study and phytochemical screening of the extracts of <em>Tricholepis glaberrima</em> DC.<br />Co Author :Trupti R. Mhadnak and Ujwala C. Bapat<br />Name of Conference :National conference on Plant Sciences<br />Level :National<br />Period :07/02/2013-08/02/2013<br />Name of Organizers: Department of Botany, Parvatibai Chowgule College of Arts and Science, Margoa, Goa</li>\n</ol>', '1', 0, 1, '', 337, '2025-09-23', 0),
