(6171, 131, 333, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"20eab315-c9c6-41cd-bcf8-b3bb28960cb0\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"20eab315-c9c6-41cd-bcf8-b3bb28960cb0\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"65\" data-end=\"248\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">As a teacher in the Botany Department, my interests extend beyond classroom teaching to activities that promote environmental awareness, community engagement, and student development.</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"295\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">???? Academic and Professional Interests</span></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"602\">\n<li data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"350\">\n<p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"350\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Study and research in Bryophytes and Pteridophytes</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"399\">\n<p data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"399\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Plant Taxonomy and Biodiversity Conservation</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"444\">\n<p data-start=\"402\" data-end=\"444\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Ethnobotany and Sustainable Horticulture</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"484\">\n<p data-start=\"447\" data-end=\"484\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Phytochemistry and Medicinal Plants</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"545\">\n<p data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"545\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Curriculum development and innovative teaching practices</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"546\" data-end=\"602\">\n<p data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"602\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Promotion of skill-based education in plant sciences</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"604\" data-end=\"756\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">I am particularly interested in connecting traditional botanical knowledge with modern scientific approaches to promote sustainability and conservation.</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"803\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">???? Social and Environmental Activities</span></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<li data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"872\">\n<p data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"872\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Organizing tree plantation drives and campus greening programmes</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"952\">\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"952\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Active participation in celebration of Environment Day and Biodiversity Day</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1033\">\n<p data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1033\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Conducting awareness programmes on environmental protection and conservation</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1103\">\n<p data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1103\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Guiding students in cleanliness and garden maintenance activities</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1183\">\n<p data-start=\"1106\" data-end=\"1183\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Promoting medicinal plant cultivation and herbal awareness in the community</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1248\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Encouraging eco-friendly practices within the college campus</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1294\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">????&zwj;???? Student Development Initiatives</span></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1585\">\n<li data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1351\">\n<p data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1351\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Mentoring students for higher education and research</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1420\">\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1420\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Motivating participation in science exhibitions and competitions</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1421\" data-end=\"1517\">\n<p data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1517\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Conducting workshops on mushroom cultivation and herbarium preparation for skill development</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1585\">\n<p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1585\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Supporting outreach activities in schools and local communities</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1784\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif;\">Through these interests and social activities, I strive to integrate academic knowledge with social responsibility, fostering environmental consciousness and community engagement among students.&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\" style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\">&nbsp;</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 333, '2025-09-23', 0),
