(6210, 131, 426, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Interested in making Physics accessible to all and to break the stigma around the fact that <em>\'Physics is difficult to understand\'.&nbsp;</em>To do so, Ms. Malvika Naik, under the guidance of Smt. S. A. Pethe (HoD), organized a stall on <em>&lsquo;Fun with Physics Toys&rsquo;</em> during college&rsquo;s current fest . Ms. Malvika Naik is also eager at creating awareness towards contribution of Women Physicists to the world of Science and Technology. In doing so, she organized a programme to celebrate 8<sup>th</sup> March as International Women&rsquo;s day which included presentations by students and teachers on the topic of <em>&lsquo;Women in Physics&rsquo;</em></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 426, '2025-09-23', 0),
