(6217, 131, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Research in molecular biology, innovative teaching practices, curriculum, syllabus development, and student mentoring, along with active involvement in student outreach initiatives, Institutional research projects and participation in institutional committees (Cultural, Dance, Astra etc.).</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 448, '2025-09-23', 0),
