(6340, 97, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. Evaluation of antioxidant activity of <em>Homonoia riparia</em> Lour., <em>Kirganelia reticulata</em> (Poir) Baill., <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em> Webster and <em>Pedilanthus tithymaloides </em>(Linn.) Poit. and its correlation with the total phenolic and flavonoid contents<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharma and Bio Sciences&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :P. Muthuprasanna, K. Suriaprabha<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2015<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :0975-6299<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Impact Factor :6.27</p>\n<p><br />2. Phytochemical investigations and antimicrobial and anticancer activities of <em>Homonoia riparia </em>Lour.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharmacy and Pharmaceutical Sciences<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Editors :Prof. M. S. Bhatia<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publisher :Innovare Academic Sciences Pvt Ltd<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Year of Publication :2014<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; ISSN :0975-1491<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Impact Factor :5.00</p>\n<p>3. Study of antimicrobial activity and phytochemical evaluation of <em>Jatropha gossypifolia</em>, <em>Sapium sebiferum, Kirganelia reticulata, Phyllanthus fraternus</em> and <em>Pedilanthus&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; tithymaloides</em><br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharmaceutical Sciences and Research<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Name of Editors :Shashi Alok, Monika Sabharwal<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Year of Publication :2014<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;ISSN :0975-8232<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;Impact Factor :2.60</p>\n<p>4. Antibacterial activity studies of extracts of <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em> Webster, <em>Jatropha gossypifolia</em> Linn. and <em>Sapium sebiferum</em> (L.)Roxb.<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC, Mhadnak TR<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :Xplore<br ', NULL, 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(6341, 97, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>1. Evaluation of antioxidant activity of <em>Homonoia riparia</em> Lour., <em>Kirganelia reticulata</em> (Poir) Baill., <em>Phyllanthus fraternus</em> Webster and <em>Pedilanthus tithymaloides </em>(Linn.) Poit. and its correlation with the total phenolic and flavonoid contents<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Co Author :Bapat UC<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; Name of Publication :International Journal of Pharma and Bio Sciences&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &', NULL, 0, 1, '', 0, '2025-09-23', 0),
(6342, 1, 67, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"line-height: 1; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Contact:- +91 8655060176&nbsp; &nbsp; Whatsapp Direct Link :- <span style=\"color: #1713e2;\"><a style=\"color: #1713e2;\" title=\"Whatsapp Group  Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EfARidWqMmo48BYBxPYkNf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for More information</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<hr />\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #e03e2d; color: #1713e2;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\">Department of Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Best College for Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management </span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">in Mumbai</span></strong></span></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\">Affiliated to </strong></span></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"287\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">University of Mumbai</span>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1t8xs9v\" data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"436\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management (UG Degree &ndash; 3 Years)&nbsp;</span></strong></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"688\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Welcome to one of the <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"535\">Best Colleges for Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management Courses in Mumbai</strong>, offering a <strong data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"596\">B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong> &ndash; a <strong data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"640\">3-year undergraduate degree program</strong> designed to build industry-ready professionals affiliated to University of Mumbai. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This program is offered <strong data-start=\"714\" data-end=\"785\">in association with the <span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Logistics Sector Skill Council</span></span> (LSC) </strong>a government-recognized body under the Ministry of Skill Development and Entrepreneurship.The Sathaye College (Autonomous) India is one of the best Institutes of <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"535\">Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management Courses in Mumbai </strong>. The <strong data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"136\">B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong> program covers key industry-relevant subjects such as <strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"313\">Human Resource Management, Finance &amp; Marketing, Retail Chain Management, International Trade, and Logistics Operations</strong>, ensuring a strong foundation in both business and supply chain domains. In addition to theoretical knowledge, the program includes a <strong data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"495\">six-month industry training / internship</strong>, providing students with valuable <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"577\">hands-on experience and real-world exposure</strong> in the logistics and supply chain sector. The course is designed to develop essential professional skills such as <strong data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"783\">leadership, communication, team building, problem-solving, and technology management</strong>, making students <strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"841\">industry-ready and highly employable</strong> in the global logistics market.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1777963196-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Admission Open 2026-27\" width=\"457\" height=\"645\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"988\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This <strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"905\">three-year undergraduate program</strong>, affiliated with the <strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"951\">University of Mumbai</strong>, follows a unique <strong data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"985\">&ldquo;2+1&rdquo; model</strong>:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1192\">\n<li data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1071\">\n<p data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1071\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"991\" data-end=\"1008\">First 2 years</strong>: Rigorous academic training through classroom-based learning</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1192\">\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1192\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1088\">Final year</strong>: <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1113\">Paid apprenticeship</strong> (Approx 10,000) with leading logistics, warehousing, transportation, or e-commerce companies</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1392\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This innovative format bridges the gap between theoretical knowledge and real-world industry practices, making it one of the <strong data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1391\">best logistics and supply chain management degree programs in Mumbai</strong>.</span></p>\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"1ew1pxq\" data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"932\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Why Choose This Program?</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"963\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">If you are searching for the:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1185\">\n<li data-section-id=\"da1idf\" data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"1027\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Best Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management College in Mumbai</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"sdg12k\" data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1067\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Top B.Com Logistics Course in India</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"19bk1hq\" data-start=\"1068\" data-end=\"1123\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">UG Degree in Logistics with Placement Opportunities</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"u011o9\" data-start=\"1124\" data-end=\"1185\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Logistics Course with Apprenticeship / Practical Training</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"1hv1k5g\" data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1247\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Key Highlights:</span></strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1jop8y1\" data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1301\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3-Year B.Com Degree (NEP-Aligned Curriculum)</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"15bmtf5\" data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1363\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Industry-Integrated Program with LSC (NSDC Approved)</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"st0xce\" data-start=\"1364\" data-end=\"1423\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apprenticeship &amp; On-the-Job Training Opportunities</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"xjsgjm\" data-start=\"1424\" data-end=\"1515\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Specialization in Supply Chain, Warehousing, Port &amp; Shipping, E-Commerce Logistics</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"qb3h2v\" data-start=\"1516\" data-end=\"1573\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Skill-Based Learning with Real Industry Exposure</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"17arqd4\" data-start=\"1574\" data-end=\"1639\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Career-Oriented Curriculum for Global Logistics Industry</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"guhjwb\" data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1683\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Earn While You Learn Opportunities</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Course Overview</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1801\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The <strong data-start=\"1717\" data-end=\"1765\">B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong> focuses on developing expertise in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"2138\">\n<li data-section-id=\"i5plt1\" data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1843\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Supply Chain Management &amp; Operations</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fvieyh\" data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1888\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Transportation &amp; Distribution Management</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10adf2w\" data-start=\"1889\" data-end=\"1928\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Port, Shipping &amp; Maritime Logistics</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14vi56a\" data-start=\"1929\" data-end=\"1965\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Warehouse &amp; Inventory Management</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12ilglc\" data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2005\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">International Trade &amp; Documentation</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"11lj8un\" data-start=\"2006\" data-end=\"2039\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">E-Commerce &amp; Retail Logistics</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1mso2s7\" data-start=\"2040\" data-end=\"2089\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Customs Procedures &amp; Export-Import Management</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1lhb5nw\" data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2138\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Logistics Technology &amp; Digital Supply Chains</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Facilities</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1663\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sathaye College is equipped with modern facilities to ensure students receive <strong data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1599\">practical exposure and hands-on training</strong> throughout their academic journey. Some key facilities include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1721\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1687\">Smart Classrooms</strong> with audio-visual teaching aids</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1786\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1724\" data-end=\"1741\">Computer labs</strong> with ERP and logistics simulation software</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1841\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Wi-Fi enabled campus for seamless digital learning</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1844\" data-end=\"1916\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Regular <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1873\">industrial visits</strong> to logistics hubs, warehouses, and ports</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"2036\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"1919\" data-end=\"1970\">Workshops, seminars, and certification programs</strong> in logistics and SCM tools like SAP, Tally, Excel, and Power BI</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2038\" data-end=\"2167\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">These facilities support students in understanding <strong data-start=\"2089\" data-end=\"2124\">real-world logistics operations</strong> and prepare them for corporate challenges.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Expert Teachers &amp; Industrial Experts</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2194\" data-end=\"2418\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Our department is led by a team of <strong data-start=\"2229\" data-end=\"2299\">qualified professors, industry veterans, and logistics consultants</strong> who bring a blend of academic rigor and industry insight. These <strong data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2383\">expert teachers</strong> regularly engage students through:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2422\" data-end=\"2444\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Interactive lectures</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"2447\" data-end=\"2484\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Case studies and role-play sessions</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"2487\" data-end=\"2514\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Problem-solving exercises</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"2517\" data-end=\"2552\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Industry talks and guest lectures</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2606\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Mentoring for internships, projects, and placements</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2608\" data-end=\"2753\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Students benefit from guidance by faculty who are committed to <strong data-start=\"2671\" data-end=\"2728\">building leadership, analytical, and strategic skills</strong> in the logistics domain.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Library</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2844\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The <strong data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2803\">Sathaye College Library</strong> is a hub of academic resources offering:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2848\" data-end=\"2957\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">A rich collection of books in <strong data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2955\">logistics, supply chain, procurement, operations, and international trade</strong></span></li>\n<li data-start=\"2960\" data-end=\"3040\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Subscriptions to national and international logistics journals and e-resources</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3107\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Access to online databases, e-books, and research publications</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3110\" data-end=\"3190\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Reading and study zones that foster independent learning and group discussions</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3192\" data-end=\"3310\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Students can deepen their subject knowledge and stay updated on <strong data-start=\"3256\" data-end=\"3286\">global supply chain trends</strong> and <strong data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3309\">best practices</strong>.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Infrastructure</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3336\" data-end=\"3479\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sathaye College boasts a student-friendly infrastructure designed to support both academic and extracurricular development. Facilities include:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3525\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Spacious lecture halls with smart boards</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3568\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Dedicated seminar and conference rooms</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3571\" data-end=\"3605\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Tech-enabled classrooms and labs</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3608\" data-end=\"3656\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Well-maintained campus with green surroundings</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3717\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Access to recreation zones, common rooms, and cafeterias</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3717\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">LMS Moodle as Online Learning Platform</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3719\" data-end=\"3889\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">This <strong data-start=\"3724\" data-end=\"3749\">modern infrastructure</strong> contributes to an engaging and supportive environment for students enrolled in the <strong data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3880\">B.Com Logistics and Supply Chain Management</strong> program.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">Placement Cell</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"3915\" data-end=\"4106\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Our <strong data-start=\"3919\" data-end=\"3950\">Training and Placement Cell</strong> plays an active role in preparing students for successful careers in the logistics sector. The placement team collaborates with leading companies to offer:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4145\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"4110\" data-end=\"4125\">Internships</strong> and live projects</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4204\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong data-start=\"4148\" data-end=\"4177\">Campus recruitment drives</strong> with top logistics firms</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"4207\" data-end=\"4268\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Resume writing, group discussion, and interview preparation</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"4271\" data-end=\"4314\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Industry-specific skill-building sessions</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"4317\" data-end=\"4361\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Alumni networking and corporate mentorship</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4526\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Graduates from the program have secured placements in companies like <strong data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4483\">Blue Dart, DHL, Amazon, Flipkart, Maersk, FedEx</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"4489\" data-end=\"4511\">Reliance Logistics</strong>, among others.</span></p>\n<hr data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1460\" />\n<h2 style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-section-id=\"17zlqvw\" data-start=\"1690\" data-end=\"1711\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #e03e2d;\">&nbsp;Career Opportunity</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2234\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">After completing the <strong data-start=\"4579\" data-end=\"4629\">B.Com in Logistics and Supply Chain Management</strong>, students can pursue careers in:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Logistics Manager</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Supply Chain Analyst</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Operations Executive</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Warehouse Manager</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Import-Export Executive</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Procurement Manager</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Distribution Manager</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">E-Commerce Logistics Executive</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Shipping &amp; Port Operations Officer</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2700\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The logistics sector is one of the <strong data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2559\">fastest-growing industries in India</strong>, with high demand for skilled professionals in <strong data-start=\"2607\" data-end=\"2699\">multinational companies, shipping firms, e-commerce giants, and manufacturing industries</strong>.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2700\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">India&rsquo;s most affordable B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management&mdash;no other college offers this program at this priceAmong the very few colleges offering this program, we provide the B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management at one of the most affordable fees.Setting benchmarks in affordability, we offer this specialized logistics program at fees significantly lower than other colleges.Top-quality logistics education at the lowest fees&mdash;this opportunity is unmatched by any other institute.</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2700\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #1713e2; background-color: #e03e2d;\">Fees:- 41,300 Every Year</span></strong></span></p>\n<hr />\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Dr (Capt) Gaurang Rajwadkar</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Coordinator</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Department of Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Contact:- +91 8655060176, <a href=\"mailto:gaurang.rajwadkar@sathayecollege.edu.in\">gaurang.rajwadkar@sathayecollege.edu.in</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong> Whatsapp Direct Link :- <span style=\"color: #1713e2;\"><a style=\"color: #1713e2;\" title=\"Whatsapp Group  Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EfARidWqMmo48BYBxPYkNf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for More information</a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span> </strong></span></p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 449, '2026-05-05', 0),
(6344, 3, 67, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', '1', 0, 1, '', 214, '2025-09-23', 0),
(6345, 4, 67, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><strong><b>Program Options</b></strong></p>\n<div class=\"table-responsive\">\n<table style=\"width: 81.8955%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width: 43.9781%;\">\n<p><strong><b>Course</b></strong></p>\n</th>\n<th style=\"width: 54.2673%;\">\n<p><strong><b>Duration</b></strong></p>\n</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 43.9781%;\">\n<p>B.Com in Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 54.2673%;\">\n<p>Three-Year Degree Course<br />(2 years Teaching &amp; 1 year <span>A</span>pprenticeship)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<br />\n<h3 data-start=\"1299\" data-end=\"1346\"><strong data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1344\">Program Structure and Key Subjects</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1636\">The <strong data-start=\"1351\" data-end=\"1401\">B.Com in Logistics and Supply Chain Management</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1436\">three-year degree program</strong> spread across six semesters. The curriculum covers a wide range of business, logistics, and supply chain management topics, ensuring students acquire the necessary knowledge and practical experience.</p>\n<h4 data-start=\"2323\" data-end=\"2363\"><strong data-start=\"2328\" data-end=\"2361\">Apprenticeship-based Learning</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2765\">\n<li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2765\">\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2765\"><strong data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2396\">1 Year Paid Apprenticeship</strong> (Final Year)<br data-start=\"2409\" data-end=\"2412\" />In collaboration with the <strong data-start=\"2438\" data-end=\"2479\">Logistics Sector Skill Council (LSSC)</strong>, this degree incorporates a <strong data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2538\">1-year paid apprenticeship</strong> where students gain hands-on experience with leading logistics, transportation, warehousing, and e-commerce companies. This apprenticeship provides invaluable industry exposure, enhancing employability and practical knowledge.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"2767\" data-end=\"2770\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"2772\" data-end=\"2803\"><strong data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2801\">Program Highlights</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"3574\">\n<li data-start=\"2804\" data-end=\"2890\">\n<p data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2890\"><strong data-start=\"2806\" data-end=\"2848\">Affiliated to the University of Mumbai</strong>, offering a globally recognized degree.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"3059\">\n<p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"3059\"><strong data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2932\">2 years of classroom-based teaching</strong> combined with <strong data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2980\">1 year of paid apprenticeship</strong>, designed to provide a balance of academic and practical industry knowledge.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3060\" data-end=\"3186\">\n<p data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3186\"><strong data-start=\"3062\" data-end=\"3083\">In-depth exposure</strong> to logistics systems, procurement, transportation, e-commerce operations, and digital supply chains.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3187\" data-end=\"3344\">\n<p data-start=\"3189\" data-end=\"3344\">Collaboration with the <strong data-start=\"3212\" data-end=\"3253\">Logistics Sector Skill Council (LSSC)</strong> to align the program with national standards and ensure skills relevant to the industry.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3345\" data-end=\"3463\">\n<p data-start=\"3347\" data-end=\"3463\">Focus on <strong data-start=\"3356\" data-end=\"3389\">real-time logistics scenarios</strong>, supply chain optimization, and the latest industry tools and software.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3464\" data-end=\"3574\">\n<p data-start=\"3466\" data-end=\"3574\">Strong <strong data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3494\">placement support</strong>, facilitating direct connections with top logistics and supply chain companies.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"3576\" data-end=\"3579\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"3581\" data-end=\"3610\"><strong data-start=\"3588\" data-end=\"3608\">Career Prospects</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"3611\" data-end=\"3777\">Graduates of the <strong data-start=\"3628\" data-end=\"3678\">B.Com in Logistics and Supply Chain Management</strong> program from <strong data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3724\">Sathaye College (Autonomous)</strong> can explore a wide array of career opportunities in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"4046\">\n<li data-start=\"3779\" data-end=\"3804\">\n<p data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3804\">Logistics Coordinator</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3829\">\n<p data-start=\"3807\" data-end=\"3829\">Supply Chain Analyst</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3830\" data-end=\"3851\">\n<p data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3851\">Warehouse Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3852\" data-end=\"3890\">\n<p data-start=\"3854\" data-end=\"3890\">Freight and Transportation Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3923\">\n<p data-start=\"3893\" data-end=\"3923\">E-commerce Logistics Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3924\" data-end=\"3949\">\n<p data-start=\"3926\" data-end=\"3949\">Import/Export Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3950\" data-end=\"3973\">\n<p data-start=\"3952\" data-end=\"3973\">Procurement Officer</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3974\" data-end=\"3996\">\n<p data-start=\"3976\" data-end=\"3996\">Operations Manager</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"3997\" data-end=\"4018\">\n<p data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4018\">Inventory Planner</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4046\">\n<p data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4046\">Supply Chain Consultant</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"4048\" data-end=\"4237\">The program is designed to equip students with the <strong data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4124\">industry-ready skills</strong> that leading logistics companies demand, making this one of the <strong data-start=\"4189\" data-end=\"4236\">best logistics management degrees in Mumbai</strong>.</p>\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 214, '2025-09-23', 0),
(6346, 5, 67, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" title=\"B.Com. Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure (Click Here)\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1746856834-NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structures-BCom(Logistics).pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">B.Com. Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management NEP-1.1-Course-credit-structure <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">(Click Here)</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><a title=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FY-LSM-2026-27.pdf\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/FY-LSM-2026-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong>FY-Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management-Syllabus Sem I and II <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">(Click Here)</span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #e03e2d;\" title=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SY-LSM-2026-27.pdf\" href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SY-LSM-2026-27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SY-Logistics &amp; Supply Chain Management-Syllabus Sem III and IV <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">(Click Here)</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/VEC-Good-Citizen-SEM-1-(1).pdf\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\">Common Subjects <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">VEC Sem I</span></span></a></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/VEC-Good-Citizen-SEM-2-(1).pdf\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\">Common Subjects <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">VEC Sem I</span></span>I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/IKS--Indian-Knowledge-System.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\">Common Subjects&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>IKS</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><a href=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/SEC--Skill-Enhancement-Course-Syllabus-2025-26.pdf\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e2d; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><span style=\"color: #e03e