(7745, 108, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Testing Purpose:<br /><br />The college started some interesting intercollegiate festivals giving a platform to students to inculcate in them leadership qualities, organizational skills, and interpersonal relations. The college was twice accredited by NAAC with an &lsquo;A&rsquo; grade. It was recognized in 2004 as &lsquo;Best Vocational Institute&rsquo; at +2 level. Moreover, the University of Mumbai awarded the College in January 2015 as &lsquo;Best College of Mumbai University (urban) for the year 2013-14. The college bagged the prestigious &lsquo;Vice-Chancellor&rsquo;s Banner&rsquo; on 25th November 2015 (NCC day) for the excellent work done by our NCC cadets in all these years and particularly in the year 2014-15. Parle Tilak Vidyalaya Association founded in 1921, established Parle College now Sathaye College, with a vision to establish an institution of higher learning. This Arts and Science college immediately attracted a large number of students and with Principal C. B. Joshi as the founding Principal, the college flourished. He pursued academic excellence relentlessly. Dr. K. S. Nargund, doyen of Organic Chemistry put the college name in the research area of chemistry.<br /><br />Note :- Only Testing Purpose</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 507, '2025-10-15', 0),
