(7922, 75, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Shilahara Heritage Services</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Intern (October 2021 &ndash; December 2021)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Communication with faculty, posting timetables for lectures. Research on topics ranging from Pre-History to Medieval period. Managing social media page, conducting various activities on behalf of an organization. Internship also included making posters and writeups regarding various topics.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Wipro Ltd. </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Associate (December 2021 &ndash; December 2022)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>1 year experience in resolving claim benefit inquiries by researching and analyzing patient activity and determining appropriate action. Provide effective technical support to the process and actively resolve client issues directly or through timely escalation to meet process.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>India Lost and Found</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Cultural Researcher (February 2022 &ndash; July 2022)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Research and compilation of information regarding various historically important sites and monuments scattered across India. Data was collected through various means including research papers, articles, newspapers, etc. This data was incorporated into a sheet where it could be used to map monuments.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Institute of Oriental Studies, Thane</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Associate (June 2022 &ndash; December 2022)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Thane Oriental museum houses more than 500 artefacts which includes Coins, Objects, Stamps, Medals, etc. Coins and Medals were identified and classified according to the predetermined categories. Along with coins and medals, artefacts and Stamps were also documented accordingly. Conservation methods were used to ensure its preservation.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Know Your Nation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Associate Researcher (October 2022 &ndash; March 2023)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Know Your Nation is a content creating organization. Content includes short infographic videos based on vast area topics. Topics included are Defense Infrastructure, Archaeology, History, Social Workers, etc. Information on topics is collected and compiled for processing which could further aid the making of infographic videos.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Gramdevatas of Ratnagiri District</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Researcher (December 2022 &ndash; Present)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>As part of the project traditions, rituals and customs related to the village deity were recorded. During the course of the field visits folk-art, folktales and other places of religious significance were also recorded. Community integration within the village was also considered.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Project of </strong><strong>national importance titled &ldquo;Scientific Investigation, Digital Documentation, and Conservation of Petroglyphs of Konkan, Maharashtra&rdquo;</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Project Associate (June 2023 &ndash; May 2025)</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The region of Konkan has provided us with evidence of rock art in the form of geoglyphs which could be ranging from prehistoric phases. This research work is a part of the project which includes lithic, drone and archaeological surveys. Cultural surveys were also conducted to understand relationship between current culture with geoglyphs. Methods were implemented to ensure conservation and preservation of these geoglyphs.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 516, '2025-10-28', 0),
