(8335, 108, 535, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ms. Prerana Mestry works as an Assistant Professor in the Department of Sanskrit, and she has been teaching this subject for the last 3 years. She has completed her Graduation in Sanskrit from Ramnarain Ruia Autonomous College. Completed M.A. in Sanskrit from the Sanskrit Bhavan, University of Mumbai. She has also completed her B.Ed. in Sanskrit &amp; Marathi from Chembur Sarvankash Shikshan Shastra Mahavidyalaya.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 535, '2025-12-18', 0),
