(8461, 98, 540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<p>Online National Level Workshop on &ldquo;E-content Development&rdquo; by MD College, Parel, Mumbai.<br />2. Online workshop on \"Experiential Teaching with diverse tools\" conducted by the IQAC, M.D. College.<br />3. FDP by Mumbai University, BMM department of Lala Lajpatrai College of Commerce &amp; Economics &amp; North Storm Academy on &ldquo;Online College Management and Online Content Creation tools&rdquo;.<br />4. FDP by North Storm Academy on &ldquo;Online course planning, design and Best practices for online teaching&rdquo;.<br />5. Online National Webinar on &lsquo;Dynamics of Online Education: A dialogue on Policy and practice&rsquo; organized by Department of Education, Rajiv Gandhi University (A Central University), Doimukh.<br />6. \"A NATIONAL WEBINAR SERIES ON Knowledge Generation in Education during COVID-19 Pandemic from May 12 - 16, 2020\" conducted by the collaborative efforts of Bombay Teacher\'s Training College, HSNC University with the Department of Education, University of Mumbai.<br />7. National Webinar on &ldquo;Education GenNext: Perspectives, Opportunities and Challenges&rdquo; conducted by St. Teresa\'s Institute of Education, Santacruz, Mumbai.</p>\n<p>8. National Workshop on &ldquo;Mind set to Climb the Digital Hill, Peace in Distraction and care in Disturbance&rdquo; by HJC of Education, Khar.<br />9. National Webinar on &ldquo;Environmental Impact of COVID-19 and Right to Sustainable Living&rdquo; by HJC of Education, Khar<br />10. Online National Quiz on Educational Research Methodology is organized by Ashoka Education Foundations Ashoka international Centre for Educational Studies and Research, Nashik.<br />11. Online Quiz on \"Teacher&rsquo;s Mental Ability, General Knowledge and Aptitude Test\" by Guru Nanak College of Education and Research, Bhandup, Mumbai.<br />12. National levels quiz competition on &lsquo;COVID-19 Cognizance&rsquo; by Hansraj Jivandas College of Education.<br />13. National Level online Quiz on Awareness of \"Outcome-Based Education Paradigm\" among Teachers conducted by Department of Computer Engineering of Shree L. R. Tiwari of Engineering.<br />14. Online \"State level Microbiology Quiz 2020\" conducted by K.K.Wagh education society\'s Arts, Commerce, Science &amp; Computer science college Nashik.<br />15. National level webinar on &lsquo;Placements and COVID 19- Reinventing yourself for survival&rsquo; conducted by PTVA&rsquo;s Sathaye College.<br />16. Five days National level FDP on &lsquo;Creating Tech-Savvy Teachers for Future Classrooms&rsquo; organized by St. Teresa\'s Institute of Education, Santacruz, Mumbai.<br />17. National level webinar on &lsquo;A Teacher&rsquo;s Kit for 2020&rsquo; conducted by B.N.N. College, Bhiwandi.<br />18. National level one day training on Google form and quiz conducted by Makkskills.<br />19. National level five day FDP on &lsquo;Creating Tech-Savvy Teachers for Future Classrooms- Ed-Fly Training&rsquo; organized by EdFly.<br />20. Six days International webinar on &lsquo;Post Corona Era Dimensions in Education&rsquo; conducted by Chetana- International Journal of Education.</p>\n<p>Two days Online National FDP on &lsquo;Statistical Analysis of Quantitative data using Advance Excel for Research Scholars&rsquo; organized by Department of Mathematics, Rizvi College of Arts, Science &amp; Commerce.<br />22. Five-day Online National FDP on &lsquo;Evolution from Offline to Online Teaching&rsquo; organized by Satish Pradhan Dnyanasadhana College, Thane in association with Department of Information Technology University of Mumbai and Microsoft.<br />23. Two days International webinar on &lsquo;Future and Prospect of Higher Education after Lockdown&rsquo; organized by Ashoka Education Foundations Ashoka international Centre for Educational Studies and Research, Nashik.<br />24. Online session of yoga on International day of Yoga on 21st June 2020 organized by PTVA&rsquo;s Sathaye College.<br />7<br />25. Six days National webinar on &lsquo;Knowledge Generation in Education during COVID-19 Pandemic- Qualitative Research&rsquo; conducted by the collaborative efforts of Bombay Teacher\'s Training College, HSNC University with the Department of Education, University of Mumbai.<br />26. National webinar on &lsquo;Writing Research Paper: An Art&rsquo; organized by Department of Chemistry, B.N.N. College, Bhiwandi.<br />27. National webinar on &lsquo;Challenges and Opportunities in Teacher Education During and After COVID-19&rsquo; organized by Department of Education, Nehru Gram Bharati, Deemed to be University, UP.<br />28. Three days National webinar on &lsquo;New-age Tools for Teaching Online&rsquo; conducted by Academisthan.<br />29. Webinar on &lsquo;Memory Secrets for Teachers&rsquo; organized by PTVA&rsquo;s M.L. Dahanukar College of Commerce.<br />30. Two days online workshop on &lsquo;School Psychology: Life Skills, Mental health and Well-being&rsquo; organized by Indian School Psychology Association (InSPA).<br />31. One day National online workshop on &lsquo;Blended Learning&rsquo; organized by Department of Educational Technology SNDT Women&rsquo;s University, Mumbai.</p>\n<p>&ldquo;Inspiring Leadership through Emotional Intelligence&rdquo; authorized by Case Western Reserve University<br />2. &ldquo;Learning to Teach Online&rdquo; authorized by The University of New South Wales, Sydney.</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 540, '2026-01-28', 0),
