(8465, 108, 540, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '<div class=\"gs\">\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div id=\":m8\" class=\"ii gt\">\r\n<div id=\":m7\" class=\"a3s aiL\">\r\n<div id=\"avWBGd-20\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I am a dedicated teacher with a strong background in human physiology, psychology, and education.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I try to explain concepts in a simple and clear way so that all students can understand easily.&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">I support and guide my students and always encourage them to do their best. I manage my teaching along with my personal responsibilities with commitment. I also try to improve myself by learning new methods and exploring new opportunities in education, as teaching is not just a job for me but an important part of my life.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"avWBGd-21\" class=\"WhmR8e\" data-hash=\"0\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>', '1', 0, 1, '', 540, '2026-01-28', 0),
