rts.com/sports-management/ts/G/?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=genericbachelorsmay25ad1&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=22496966627&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADSTjqQDL03TF8Otii9ybLyo2p9vW&amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3O20_YyYjQMVuthMAh06ISImEAAYASAAEgK4XPD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">In collaboration with </a></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #000000;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" title=\"Ironwood Sports Management Global Academy\" href=\"https://ironwoodsports.com/sports-management/ts/G/?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=genericbachelorsmay25ad1&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=22496966627&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADSTjqQDL03TF8Otii9ybLyo2p9vW&amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3O20_YyYjQMVuthMAh06ISImEAAYASAAEgK4XPD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ironwood Sports Management</a></strong></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\" data-section-id=\"1g219gw\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"362\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; color: #000000;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #000000;\" title=\"Ironwood Sports Management Global Academy\" href=\"https://ironwoodsports.com/sports-management/ts/G/?utm_source=google&amp;utm_medium=cpc&amp;utm_campaign=genericbachelorsmay25ad1&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gad_campaignid=22496966627&amp;gbraid=0AAAAADSTjqQDL03TF8Otii9ybLyo2p9vW&amp;gclid=EAIaIQobChMI3O20_YyYjQMVuthMAh06ISImEAAYASAAEgK4XPD_BwE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Degree awarded by University of Mumbai&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(Click Here)</a></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"506\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">The M.Sc. Sports Management at Sathaye College is a premium postgraduate program designed for individuals who want to build careers in the business of sports. </span><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Unlike conventional management degrees, this program delivers domain-specific expertise across sports marketing, analytics, operations, and media&mdash;combined with practical </span><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">exposure in real-world sports environments. Offered in collaboration with Ironwood Sports Management, a pioneer in sports management training in India since 2009, the program blends academic rigor with industry immersion. Students graduate with a recognized degree from the University of Mumbai, along with the skills and exposure required to enter and grow in the sports industry.</span></p>\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"798\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://sathayecollege.edu.in/uploads/copy-1778528290-4.jpeg\" alt=\"1\" width=\"765\" height=\"496\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\" data-start=\"4781\" data-end=\"4881\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Dr (Capt) Gaurang Rajwadkar</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Coordinator</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Department of Sports Management</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>For More Queries: &ndash; 8291800821 / 9321260577 / 8655060176, </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>gaurang.rajwadkar@sathayecollege.edu.in</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Whatsapp Direct Link :-&nbsp;<a title=\"Whatsapp Group  Link\" href=\"https://chat.whatsapp.com/EdVJx3oKBGoBqs9Mgzbru7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Click Here for More information</a>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right; line-height: 1;\">&nbsp;</p>', '1', 0, 1, '', 449, '2026-07-15', 0),
