one;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ol>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">To possess knowledge about childhood education</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">To describe the concept of health</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">To acquire the knowledge of childhood and life skills</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">To identify the use of ICT in childhood</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<table style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" width=\"601\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" width=\"601\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Course Title: Introduction To Childhood Education</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" width=\"601\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Course Code: GBA1EDUVSC124</strong></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"226\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Academic Year: 2026-27</span></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"227\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times, serif; font-size: 14pt;\">No. of total contact Hours: 45</span></p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"148\">\n<p><s